<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">- Kwere Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Kulawa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kulawa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kulawa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kul</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kulawa</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Kulawa chosimulila simulizi isongele muna ichitabu cha Mwanduso yoilonga mbuli ya lukolo lwa Bulahimu. Chitabu chino chotangigwa Kulawa kwa viya cholaagusa kusonhela viya Waisilaili viwalawile Misili na kubwela isi ija Mulungu iyamulaganile Bulahimu. Kwa kusondelela mahokelo, wasomi wohuwila kuwa hanhu hakulu ha chitabu chino handikigwa na mulotezi Musa, mbuli ino yolongigwa mbaka na chitabu chanyewo. Kulawa 24:4 yolonga viya Musa viyandike hanhu hamwenga muna ichitabu chino. Chifungu muna ichitabu cha Yoshua 8:31 chotambula lagilizo dili muna ichitabu cha Kulawa 20:25 na kulonga, “fana viyandikigwe muna ichitabu cha malagilizo ya Musa.” Vitabu va Lagano da Sambi votambula vitabu vandikikwe na Musa, mfano Lagano da Sambi vodilonga mbuli ya chibago chikwaka moto bila kulungula, dolonga kuwa mbuli ino yandikigwa muna, “ichitabu cha Musa” (Maliko 12:26). Yodahika Waisilaili walawa muna iisi ya Misili hagati ya mwaka 1,300 hebu 1,400 KK (Inghali Chilisito). Muna ichitabu cha 1 Wafalume 6:1 ilongigwa Waisilaili walawa Misili miyaka 480 ing'hali hainafika mwaka wa nne wa kutawala kwake Mfalume Suleimani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Kulawa chokanhamiza viya viyatendile Mulungu muladi kugendesa waminika wake kusonhela chilagano chiyawalaganile Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo. Chitabu chosimulila sang'hano ng'hulu za ukombola wa Mulungu kwa welesi wa Bulahimu niiwawo Waisilaili, viwakalile wolawa muna iisi ya Misili (Kulawa sula ya 1 mbaka 12). Kulawa uko Mulungu kawalongoza wanhu wake mbaka kuna yamabawe yakalile hasi ya mulima Sinai hanhu haja Mulungu hoyamwing'hile Musa Malagilizo mengi muladi Waisilaili wayasondelele (Kulawa sula ya 12 mbaka 19). Malagilizo yano yolonga viya viwalondeke kusang'hana, viya viwalondeke kulava nhambiko, na mbuli zozilonga kusonhela uzenzi wa hema da mting'hano (baho hanhu hayakalile Mulungu hagati yawo) hamwe na sanduku da Lagano na via vimwenga va nhambiko muna dihema da mting'hano, na mawalo malumu ya wakulu wa nhambiko (Kulawa sula ya 20 mbaka 31). Maabaho viumalile wihi wihile haja Waisilaili viwaitendele nyang'hiti ya ng'ombe wa zahabu, Musa kaiting'hana na Mulungu kaidi (Kulawa sula ya 32 mbaka 33). Kuuhelelo wa chitabu chino chosoma via vitambuligwe ichanduso vovitendigwe (Kulawa sula ya 33 mbaka 40).</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zilimuno</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Muna isula ya 1 yolonga viya wana wa Isilaili viwagumigwe muna uutumwa muna iisi ya Misili.</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Muna isula ya 2 mbaka 4 zomtambula Musa na kusimulila ugima wake kwandusila udodo wake mbaka viyatangigwe kuwakombola wanhu wa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Maabaho mwandikaji kosimulila viya Mulungu viyatendile mauzauza na kuitowa isi ya Misili kwa mahulo makulu kwa lungilo da kuwakombola wanhu wake kulawa muna iisi ija na kulawa kwa wakalizi wa mfalume wa Misili. (Sula ya 5 mbaka 15:21).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Kulawa hano wanhu wa Isilaili wandusa mwanza na wafika kuna umulima Sinai (sula ya 15:22 mbaka sula 19).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Muna isula ya 20 mbaka 31 chosoma viya Mulungu viyamwing'hile Musa Malagilizo, malagilizo yalongile wanhu wa Mulungu, Waisilaili viwolondeka kukala na kutambika.</para>
  <para style="io1">6. Muna isula ya 32 yandikigwa viya wana wa Isilaili viwamulekile Mulungu kwa kumsongeza ndugu wa Musa yoyatangigwe Haluni yawatendele nyang'hiti ilingile fana ng'ombe wa zahabu.</para>
  <para style="io1">7. Sula ya 33 mbaka 40 zolonga viya Musa viyauwonile utunhizo wa Mulungu na kuwafunza Waisilaili malagilizo ya Mulungu, hamwe na kuwalongela voilondeka kuzenga hema da mting'hano na sanduku da lagano na via vimwenga va nhambiko hana dihema da mting'hanila na mbuli za mawalo ya wakulu wa nhambiko.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EXO 1" />
  <para style="s">Waisilaeli wogazigwa muna iisi ya Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 1:1" />Yano mazina ya wana wa Yakobo yoyatangigwe Isilaili wowahitile Misili hamwe nayo. <verse eid="EXO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 1:2" />Wakala Lubeni na Simeoni na Lawi na Yuda‚ <verse eid="EXO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 1:3" />Isakali na Zabuloni na Benjamini na <verse eid="EXO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 1:4" />Dani na Nafutali na Gadi na Asheli. <verse eid="EXO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 1:5" />Welesi wose wa Yakobo wakala malongo saba‚ lusita ulwo Yosefu kakala yokala uko Misili. <verse eid="EXO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 1:6" />Maabaho hamwande Yosefu kadanganika, iviya na ndugu zake na welesi wose wadanganika‚ <verse eid="EXO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 1:7" />Mbali welesi wa Isilaili wakala wokweleka na kongezeka ng'hani‚ wakala wengi ng'hani na wagendelela kongezeka nguvu, ivo muna iisi ya Misili wakala wenela wawo. <verse eid="EXO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 1:8" />Maabaho kalawilila mfalume imwenga yohammanyile wa kuitawala Misili Yosefu.<verse eid="EXO 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 1:9" />Kawalongela wanhu wake‚ “Loleni wanhu wa Isilaili wengi ng'hani na wana nguvu kufosa cheye. <verse eid="EXO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 1:10" />Cholondeka chizahile nzila ya ubala sekewongezeke, one siivo, ihalawilila ng'hondo wezailumba na wehi wetu na kuitowa na cheye na kusegela mwiisi.” <verse eid="EXO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 1:11" />Ivo Wamisili waweka wemilizi wawemilize Waisilaili na kuwagaza kwa sang'hano ndala ya kumzengela mfalume wa Misili mabululu ya ngama uko Pisomo na Lamasesi. <verse eid="EXO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 1:12" />Mbali kwaviya Wamisili viwawagazile Waisilaili, niivo viwongezeke na kwenela. Wamisili wawadumba Waisilaili, <verse eid="EXO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 1:13" />na wawatendela usede wanhu wa Isilaili. <verse eid="EXO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 1:14" />Wautenda ugima wawo wihe kwa sang'hano ndala, sang'hano ya kutenda chokaa na kutenda matafali na sang'hano zose za muna imigunda. Sang'hano izo zose, Waisilaili wasang'haniligwa kwa usede.<verse eid="EXO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 1:15" />Maabaho mfalume wa Misili kawalongela walala wowataza wanaake wa Chiebulaniya kweleka, imwe zina jake katangigwa Shifila na wekaidi zina jake katangigwa Pua. <verse eid="EXO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 1:16" />Kawalongela, “Muhawataza wanaake wa Chiebulaniya kuna ukuibasula‚ one yahavumbuka mwana wa chilume mkomeni, mbali one yahavumbuka mwana wa chike mulekeni.” <verse eid="EXO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 1:17" />Mbali walala wamdumba Mulungu na hawatendile fana viyawalagilize mfalume wa Misili‚ wawaleka wana wa chilume wakale. <verse eid="EXO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 1:18" />Maabaho mfalume wa Misili kawatanga walala waja na kawauza‚ “Habali mutenda vino? Habali muwaleka wana wa chilume wakale?” <verse eid="EXO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 1:19" />Walala wawo wamwidika mfalume wa Misili‚ “Wanaake wa Chiebulaniya hawalingile fana wanaake wa Chimisili bule, woibasula himahima na wana wawo wokwelekigwa yang'hali mulala hanafika.” <verse eid="EXO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 1:20" />Ivo Mulungu kawatendela mbuli zinogile walala wawo, na wanhu wongezeka ng'hani, wagendelela kuwa na nguvu ng'hani. <verse eid="EXO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 1:21" />Na kwaviya walala wawo wamdumba Mulungu, Mulungu kaweng'ha welesi wawo wenyewo. <verse eid="EXO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 1:22" />Maabaho mfalume wa Misili kawalagiliza wanhu wake wose, “Chila mwana wa chilume yondayelekwe kwa Waebulaniya yasigwe muna ulwanda lwa Naili, mbali chila mwana wa chike mulekeni.”<verse eid="EXO 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EXO 2" />
  <para style="s">Kwelekigwa kwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 2:1" />Siku izo munhu yolawa kabila da Lawi kasola muke wa kabila jake mwenyewo, <verse eid="EXO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 2:2" />nayo kapata wimo na kaibasula mwana wa chilume. Viyamuwone kakala mwana yanogile ng'hani‚ kamfisa kwa miyezi mitatu. <verse eid="EXO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 2:3" />Mbali viyapotwile kumfisa kampatila chigelo cha mayani na kachibulugiza tulasi‚ kamwika mgati yake na kuchika hana yamayani yokota muna ulwanda lwa Naili. <verse eid="EXO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 2:4" />Lumbu jake imwana kema hatali hainzila muladi yadahe kulola chiya chondachimulawilile.<verse eid="EXO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 2:5" />Mwana wa chike wa mfalume wa Misili kahumuluka kuulwanda yoge‚ wasang'hani wake wakala wogenda genda mumgwazo ya ulwanda. Viyawone ichigelo muna yamakengega‚ kamtuma msang'hani wa chike yachisole. <verse eid="EXO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 2:6" />Kachivugula na kawona mwana wa chilume. Kakala kolila, ivo kamuwonela ubazi na kalonga, “Ino imwe wa wana wa Chiebulaniya.”<verse eid="EXO 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 2:7" />Maabaho lumbu wa imwana kamuuza mndele wa mfalume wa Misili‚ “Nihite nikamtange muke wa kumong'heza imwana mwa wanaake wa Chiebulaniya?” <verse eid="EXO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 2:8" />Mndele wa mfalume wa Misili kamwidika, “Wona.” Ivo imndele kahita na kamgala mami yake imwana. <verse eid="EXO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 2:9" />Mndele wa mfalume wa Misili kamulongela mwanamke ija, “Msole imwana ino unyong'hezele, nizakuliha.” Ivo mwanamke ija kamsola imwana kamong'heza. <verse eid="EXO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 2:10" />Hamwande mwana viyakulile kamgala kwa mndele wa mfalume wa Misili‚ nayo kamtenda kuwa mwanage. Mndele wa mfalume kalonga, “Nimulava muna yamazi.” Ivo kamtanga zina jake Musa.<verse eid="EXO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kokimbilila Midiyani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 2:11" />Siku izo Musa viyakulile kahita kuwalaula ndugu zake Waebulaniya na kulola sang'hano zawo ndala ziwotenda. Kawona Mmisili komtowa Muebulaniya, imwe wa ndugu zake. <verse eid="EXO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 2:12" />Musa kalola banzi zose‚ viyawone kuwa habule munhu yomuwona‚ kamkoma Mmisili ija na lukuli lwake kalufisa muna umsanga. <verse eid="EXO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 2:13" />Igolo yake kahita kaidi na kawona Waebulaniya waidi woitowa. Kamulongela ija yabanange, “Habali komtowa Muebulaniya miyago?”<verse eid="EXO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 2:14" />Munhu ija kamwidika, “Yelihi yakutendile weye kuwa mtawala wetu na msemi? Vino kolonda unikome fana viya viumkomile Mmisili ija?” Maabaho Musa kadumba na kaiuzagiza mwenyewo, “Vino wanhu wavimanya chiya chinitendile?” <verse eid="EXO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 2:15" />Mfalume viyahulike mbuli zilawilile, kalonda kumkoma Musa, mbali Musa kambanga mfalume wa Misili na kahita kukala muna isi ya Midiani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 2:15">Siku dimwe Musa kakala hamgwazo wa disima. <verse eid="EXO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 2:16" />Mkulu wa nhambiko wa Midiani kakala na wandele saba, nawo weza kudeha mazi. Wamemeza mbaluti muladi wadahe kuwang'wiza ng'hondolo na luti wa tati yawo. <verse eid="EXO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 2:17" />Wadimi weza na wawawinga wandele waja saba, mbali Musa kema na kuwataza kuding'wiza bumbila da wanyama wawo. <verse eid="EXO 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 2:18" />Viwabwelile kwa tati yawo Yesilo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yesilo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesilo iviya zina jake dimwenga katangigwa Leueli. </char></note>‚ kawauza‚ “Habali diyelo hamkalame bule kubwela?”<verse eid="EXO 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 2:19" />Wamwidika‚ “Mmisili kachilopola na wadimi na iviya kachidehela mazi na kung'wiza wanyama wetu.”<verse eid="EXO 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 2:20" />Kawauza wandele wake, “Munhu iyo kakulihi?” “Habali mumuleka uko munhu iyo? Hiteni mukamgoneke yaje na cheye.”<verse eid="EXO 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 2:21" />Musa katogola kukala haja, Yesilo kamwing'ha Musa mndele wake yatangigwe Sipola yamsole. <verse eid="EXO 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 2:22" />Sipola kamwelekela mwana wa chilume. Musa kailongela mwenyewo‚ “Nitogoligwa kukala muna iisi iyo ya manyambenyambe.” Ivo kamtanga mwana iyo zina Gelishomu.<verse eid="EXO 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 2:23" />Viifosile miyaka mingi mfalume wa Misili kadanganika‚ mbali Waisilaili wakala wang'hali muna utumwa na wolilila kutazigwa. Kugutilila kwawo kumfikila Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 2:24" />Mulungu kahulika ndilo yawo na kakumbuka lagano diyekile na Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo. <verse eid="EXO 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 2:25" />Mulungu viyawawonile Waisilaili na kavimanya viya viwogaya.<verse eid="EXO 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EXO 3" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu komtanga Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 3:1" />Siku dimwe Musa viyakalile yodima ng'hondolo na luti wa Yesilo mkoi wake‚ mkulu wa nhambiko wa Midiani, kadilanguliza bumbila kufosa ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa muna ichuwala kuhita Holebu‚ kuna mulima wa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 3:2" />Msenga wa Mndewa Mulungu kamulawilila Musa muna dilambi da moto muna ichibago. Musa kawona ichibago chokwaka moto mbali hachitakamile. <verse eid="EXO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 3:3" />Musa kalonga, “Yano mauzauza, habali chibago chokwaka moto na hachitakamila? Nizachikwenhukila nikachilole.”<verse eid="EXO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 3:4" />Mndewa Mulungu viyawone kuwa Musa kokwenhuka habehi, kamtanga kulawa hagati ya ichibago na kalonga, “Musa! Musa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 3:4">Musa kamwidika “Wona, nabaha.”<verse eid="EXO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 3:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela‚ “Sekeukwenhuke habehi. Vula vilatu vako, kwaviya howimile ni hanhu helile.” <verse eid="EXO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 3:6" />Maabaho kalonga, “Niye Mulungu wa wasaho zako‚ Mulungu wa Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo.” Ivo Musa kaigubika chihanga chake‚ kwaviya kadumba kumulola Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 3:7" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kalonga‚ “Kweli niyawona manhesa ya wanhu wangu weli muna iisi ya Misili. Nihulika viwolila kwa ichimu cha wemilizi wa Misili. Niumanya usungu wawo. <verse eid="EXO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 3:8" />Ivo nihumuluka muladi niwakombole muna yamakono ya Wamisili‚ nizawalava umo na kuwagala kuna isi ino inogile na ng'hulu, isi ili na ulongo unogile‚ isi ya Wakanaani na Wahiti na Waamoli na Wapelizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 3:9" />Lelo kulila kwa wanhu wangu Waisilaili kunifikila niye. Niwona viya Wamisili viwowagaza. <verse eid="EXO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 3:10" />Lelo hita nokutuma kwa mfalume wa Misili muladi ukawalave wanhu wangu wana Isilaili muna iisi ya Misili.”<verse eid="EXO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 3:11" />Mbali Musa kamulongela Mulungu‚ “Niye yelihi mbaka nidahe kuhita kwa mfalume wa Misili na kuwalava Waisilaili muna iisi ya Misili?”<verse eid="EXO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 3:12" />Mulungu kamulongela‚ “Nizakuwa hamwe na weye. Na chino chizakuwa chilaguso kuwa niye niiyo nikutumile. Vondauwalave wanhu muna iisi ya Misili, kwizamtambikila Mulungu muna umulima uno.”<verse eid="EXO 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 3:13" />Musa kamulongela Mulungu‚ “One nihahita kwa wanhu wa Isilaili na kuwalongela‚ ‘Mulungu wa wasaho zenu kanhuma kumwenu‚’ nawo wezaniuza‚ ‘Zina jake nani?’ Niwalongeleze?”<verse eid="EXO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 3:14" />Mulungu kamulongela Musa‚ “NIYE IYO NIYE.” Na kalonga, “Walongele vino wanhu wa Isilaili‚ ‘Ija iwomtanga IYO NIYE kanhuma kumwenu.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 3:15" />Iviya Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Walongele Waisilaili‚ ‘Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa wasaho zenu na Mulungu wa Bulahimu na Mulungu wa Isaka na Mulungu wa Yakobo‚ kanhuma kumwenu.’ Dino ijo zina jangu siku zose, dizakumbukigwa kwa welesi wose.” <verse eid="EXO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 3:16" />Hita na ukawating'hanize hamwe walala wa Isilaili na uwalongele‚ Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa wasaho zenu na Mulungu wa Bulahimu na wa Isaka na wa Yakobo, kanilawilila na kanilongela, “Niziwona mbuli zimutendiligwa uko Misili.”<verse eid="EXO 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 3:17" />Na nimulaganilani kuwa nizamulavani muna yamanhesa yenu uko Misili na kuwengiza muna iisi ya Wakanaani na Wahiti na Waamoli na Wapelizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi‚ isi ili na ulongo unogile.<verse eid="EXO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 3:18" />“Walala wa Isilaili wezakutegeleza, maabaho weye na walala wa Isilaili mwizahita kwa mfalume wa Misili na kumulongela, ‘Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Waebulaniya, kaiting'hana na cheye. Lelo chokulamba chilekelele chigende muna ichuwala siku nhatu muladi chikamulavile nhambiko Mulungu wetu.’ <verse eid="EXO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 3:19" />Novimanya kuwa mfalume wa Misili hezawalekela muhite mbaka yahavimanya kuwa niye nina nguvu kufosa yeye. <verse eid="EXO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 3:20" />Mbali nizasang'hanila nguvu zangu kuwatagusa Wamisili kwa kutenda vinhu va mauzauza haja. Hamwande kezamulekelani muhite.<verse eid="EXO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 3:21" />“Nizawatenda Wamisili wanoge kumwenu muladi vondamusegele‚ sekemusegele makono muhala. <verse eid="EXO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 3:22" />Chila mwanamke wa Chiisilaili kezampula mkaya miyage na ija yokala nayo muna ikaye yake yamwing'he via va hela na via va zahabu hamwe na mawalo. Mwizawavaza wanenu wa chike na wa chilume. Vino niivo vondamusole vinhu va Wamisili.”<verse eid="EXO 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EXO 4" />
  <para style="s">Mulungu komwing'ha Musa udahi wa kutenda mauzauza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 4:1" />Maabaho Musa kamwidika Mndewa Mulungu, “Mbali Waisilaili hawezanihuwila na hawezanitegeleza, mana wezalonga, ‘Mndewa Mulungu hakulawilile bule.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 4:2" />Mndewa Mulungu kamuuza Musa‚ “Icho choni chiwamhile mumkono wako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 4:2">Musa kamwidika, “Fimbo.”<verse eid="EXO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 4:3" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela‚ “Ilagaze hasi.” Ivo kailagaza hasi na igaluka iwa zoka. Musa kakimbila. <verse eid="EXO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 4:4" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa‚ “Golosa mkono wako ujamhe umkila.” Ivo kagolosa mkono wake kajamha, najo digaluka kuwa fimbo kaidi muna umkono wake. <verse eid="EXO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 4:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela, “Kwa kutenda ivo Waisilaili wezahuwila kuwa Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa wasaho zawo na Mulungu wa Bulahimu na Mulungu wa Isaka na Mulungu wa Yakobo, kakulawilila.”<verse eid="EXO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 4:6" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa mwanza kaidi‚ “Ika mkono mudiwalo jako.” Musa keka mkono wake muna diwalo, viyaulavile‚ ugaluka mzelu fana munhu yeli na utamu wa mbende. <verse eid="EXO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 4:7" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela‚ “Ika mkono wako muna diwalo kaidi.” Katenda ivo‚ viyaulavile, ukala mgima, fana mbende yake imwenga.<verse eid="EXO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 4:8" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela‚ “One hawakuhuwile na kutogola chilaguso cha mauzauza cha mwanduso, yodahika chilaguso cha mauzauza chino chekaidi wezachitogola. <verse eid="EXO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 4:9" />Mbali one hawahuwile vilaguso vino vidi hebu kukutegeleza‚ sola mazi muulwanda lwa Naili na yetile muna iisi inyalile‚ mazi yondauyadehe kulawa muulwanda yezagaluka damu muna iisi.”<verse eid="EXO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 4:10" />Musa kamulongela Mndewa Mulungu, “Nokulamba Mndewa, niye sidaha kulonga goya kwandusila mwaka‚ hata kwandusila baho viulongile na niye msang'hani wako, kwaviya niye sidaha kulonga goya, na lulimi lwangu luzama.”<verse eid="EXO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 4:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela‚ “Yelihi yaumbile mulomo wa munhu? Hebu yelihi yomtenda munhu yawe bubu hebu msuwamagutwi? Yelihi yomtenda munhu yalole hebu yawe chipofu? Vino siyo niye Mndewa Mulungu? <verse eid="EXO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 4:12" />Lelo hita, nizakutaza kulonga na kukufunza mbuli za kulonga.”<verse eid="EXO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 4:13" />Mbali Musa kamwidika‚ “Mndewa, nolamba umtume munhu imwenga.”<verse eid="EXO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 4:14" />Mndewa Mulungu kamuwonela ludoko Musa na kalonga‚ “Vino kahabule sekulu wako Haluni‚ ija Imulawi? Nivimanya kuwa yeye kodaha kulonga vinogile. Kweli, kokwiza kuiting'hana na weye na vondayakuwone kezadeng'helela. <verse eid="EXO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 4:15" />Weye kwizalonga nayo na kumulongela mbuli zose zondayalonge, niye nizawatazeni na kuwafunza mbuli zondamutende. <verse eid="EXO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 4:16" />Haluni kezakuwa mulonzi wako na kezawalongela wanhu kwa ichimu chako. Weye kwizakuwa fana mulungu kumwake. <verse eid="EXO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 4:17" />Sola fimbo ino muna umkono wako muladi udahe kutenda vilaguso va mauzauza.”<verse eid="EXO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kobwela Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 4:18" />Maabaho Musa kabwela kaidi kwa Yesilo, mkoi wake‚ na kamulongela. “Nokulamba nilekelele nibwele kwa ndugu zangu uko Misili nikawalole fana wang'hali wagima.” Yesilo kamulongela Musa, “Hita kwa tindiwalo.”<verse eid="EXO 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 4:19" />Lusita Musa viyakalile uko Midiani‚ Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela‚ “Bwela Misili‚ mana wanhu wose walondile kukukoma wadanganika.” <verse eid="EXO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 4:20" />Musa kamsola muke wake na wanage‚ kawakweza muna ichihongwe na kubwela Misili. Kasola fimbo ija Mulungu iyamulongele yaisole.<verse eid="EXO 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 4:21" />Kaidi Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa‚ “Vondaufike Misili utende haulongozi ha mfalume wa Misili mauzauza yose yonikwing'hile udahi wa kuyatenda. Mbali niye nizautenda moyo wa mfalume wa Misili kuwa mdala, nayo hezawalekela Waisilaili wasegele. <verse eid="EXO 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 4:22" />Maabaho kolondeka umulongele mfalume wa Misili kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, ‘Isilaili niiyo mwanangu chaudele. <verse eid="EXO 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 4:23" />Nikulongela umulekele mwanangu yahite‚ muladi yanitambikile, mbali kulema kumulekela yahite, ivo nizamkoma chaudele wako wa chilume.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 4:24" />“Ikala viwakalile hanhu ha lago mwiinzila kuhita Misili, Mndewa Mulungu kaiting'hana nayo na kageza kumkoma. <verse eid="EXO 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 4:25" />Maabaho Sipola muke wake, kasola dibwe dikutwa kakanha govi da mwanage, na kumdalisa najo Musa mumgulu na kalonga, ‘Weye kwa mulume wa damu yangu.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 4:26" />Kwa ichimu chino cha mwingizo, Sipola kamulongela Musa, “Weye kwa mulume wa damu yangu.” Kwa ivo Mndewa Mulungu kaulekela ugima wa Musa.<verse eid="EXO 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 4:27" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Haluni, “Hita kuna ichuwala ukaiting'hane na Musa.” Ivo Haluni kahita na waiting'hana kuna mulima wa Mulungu, kamnonela. <verse eid="EXO 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 4:28" />Maabaho Musa kamulongela Haluni chila chinhu chiyatumigwe na Mulungu kulonga, iviya vilaguso va mauzauza viyamulagilize yatende. <verse eid="EXO 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 4:29" />Musa na Haluni wahita Misili na wawaduganya hamwe walala wose wa Isilaili. <verse eid="EXO 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 4:30" />Haluni kawalongela chila chinhu Mndewa Mulungu choyamulongele Musa. Iviya katenda vilaguso haulongozi ha wanhu, <verse eid="EXO 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 4:31" />nawo wahuwila. Viwahulike kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kawezila wanhu wa Isilaili kuwalola viya viwoigaza chiusede, watumbala mavindi na wamtosela Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EXO 5" />
  <para style="s">Musa na Haluni haulongozi ha mfalume wa Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 5:1" />Maabaho Musa na Haluni wahita kwa mfalume wa Misili na kumulongela‚ “Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili‚ kalonga, ‘Walekelele wanhu wangu wahite‚ muladi wakanitendele dugila kuna ichuwala.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 5:2" />Mfalume wa Misili kawalongela‚ “Mndewa Mulungu iyo yelihi mbaka nimtegeleze na kuwalekelela Waisilaili wahite? Simmanyile bule Mndewa Mulungu, na siwalekelela Waisilaili wahite.”<verse eid="EXO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 5:3" />Musa na Haluni wamwidika, “Mulungu wa Waebulaniya kachilawilila yeye mwenyewo. Lelo chilekele chigende mwanza wa siku nhatu kuna ichuwala, chikamulavile nhambiko Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu. One hachitendile ivo, kezachikoma kwa matamu hebu ng'hondo.”<verse eid="EXO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 5:4" />Mbali mfalume wa Misili kawalongela‚ “Mweye Musa na Haluni‚ habali mowalekeza wanhu sang'hano zawo? Mweye watumwa wose hiteni kuna zisang'hano zenu! <verse eid="EXO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 5:5" />Maabaho mfalume wa Misili kawalongela‚ ‘Loleni‚ lelo wanhu wa isi wengi kufosa Wamisili. Molonda kuwalekeza sang'hano zawo!’ ”<verse eid="EXO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 5:6" />Siku iyo iyo mfalume wa Misili kawalagiliza wemilizi wa Chimisili na wanyapala wa Chiisilaili, kalonga, <verse eid="EXO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 5:7" />“Sekemuweng'he wanhu wano mayani ya kutendela matafali fana vimutendaga. Walekeni wahite wakazahile wenyewo. <verse eid="EXO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 5:8" />Mbali peta ya matafali iwe fana yaja yowakalile wotengeneza mwanduso‚ wekileni iyo iyo na sekemuwahunguzile hata chidogo. Kwaviya wawo ni wabwa wolonga, ‘Chileke chihite chikamulavile nhambiko Mulungu wetu!’ <verse eid="EXO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 5:9" />Wongezeni wanhu wano sang'hano ndala muladi wagaye na waleke kuhulika mbuli za uvwizi.”<verse eid="EXO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 5:10" />Wemilizi wa Chimisili na wanyapala wa Chiisilaili wahita na kuwalongela Waisilaili‚ “mfalume wa Misili kawalongela kuwa hezaweng'ha mayani. <verse eid="EXO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 5:11" />Hiteni wenyewo mkazahile mayani hohose hondamudahe kuyapata‚ mbali molondeka mutende matafali ya peta ija ija.” <verse eid="EXO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 5:12" />Ivo wanhu wapwililika isi yose ya Misili wozahila mayani yasigale ya kutendela matafali. <verse eid="EXO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 5:13" />Wemilizi wawo waiyoha kulonga‚ “Komelezeni sang'hano zenu zimutendaga fana baho umwaka vimukalile mogaliligwa mayani.” <verse eid="EXO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 5:14" />Wemilizi wa Chimisili wawatowa wanyapala wa Chiisilaili wowasaguligwe kulola goya sang'hano wahita kwa mfalume wa Misili, walonga, “Habali hamkomeleza sang'hano yenu na kufikiza peta ya matafali ija ija fana ya umwaka?”<verse eid="EXO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 5:15" />Maabaho wemilizi wa Chiisilaili weza na kumulilila mfalume wa Misili‚ “Habali kochitendela vino cheye wasang'hani wako? <verse eid="EXO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 5:16" />Haching'higwa kaidi mayani yoyose, na kuno chowangilizigwa kutenda matafali. Iviya cheye wasang'hani wako chotowigwa, mbali wabanange wanhu wako.”<verse eid="EXO 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 5:17" />Mfalume wa Misili kalonga‚ “Mweye mwa wabwa, mana hamulonda kusang'hana usang'hano‚ lekamana munipula niwalekelele muhite na kumulavila nhambiko Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 5:18" />Lelo hiteni mkasang'hane usang'hano, mana hamwizakwing'higwa mayani‚ na molondeka kutenda matafali peta ija ija.” <verse eid="EXO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 5:19" />Lelo wemilizi wa Waisilaili wawona kuwa wa muna yamagayo, mana walongeligwa, “Hamwizaihunguza peta ya matafali ya chila siku.”<verse eid="EXO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 5:20" />Viwasegele kwa mfalume wa Misili‚ wawafika Musa na Haluni wowakalile wowagozela. <verse eid="EXO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 5:21" />Wawalongela Musa na Haluni, “Mndewa Mulungu yamuloleni na kuhumiza, kwaviya muchitenda cheye fana china mnung'ho wihile haulongozi ha mfalume wa Misili na wasang'hani wake, mweye muweng'ha chimu cha kuchikoma.”<verse eid="EXO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kolongelela kwa Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 5:22" />Maabaho Musa kabwela kwa Mndewa Mulungu na kumulongela‚ “Mndewa Mulungu, habali kuwatendela vihile wanhu wano? Habali kunhuma? <verse eid="EXO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 5:23" />Kwandusila vinihitile na kulonga na mfalume wa Misili kwa zina jako, kawatendela vihile wanhu wano na weye hutendile chochose kuwakombola.”<verse eid="EXO 5:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EXO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 6:1" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa‚ “Sambi kwizawona chondanimtendele mfalume wa Misili. Mana kwa shuluti yangu kezawalekelela wanhu wangu, kwa shuluti kezawawinga muna iisi yake.”<verse eid="EXO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulungu komtanga Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 6:2" />Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Niye Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 6:3" />Nimulawilila Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo fana viya Mulungu yeli na udahi‚ mbali zina jangu Mndewa Mulungu siditendile dimanyike kumwawo. <verse eid="EXO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 6:4" />Iviya nitenda nawo lagano jangu kuwa nizaweng'ha isi ya Kanaani, uko wezakala fana nyambenyambe. <verse eid="EXO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 6:5" />Iviya nihulika kulongelela kwa Waisilaili‚ waja Wamisili wawashulutiza kusang'hana sang'hano za chitumwa, ivo nikumbuka lagano jangu. <verse eid="EXO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 6:6" />Uwalongele Waisilaili, ‘Niye Mndewa Mulungu! Nizamulavani na kumulekelani kulawa muna utumwa wa Wamisili. Nizawinula mkono wangu wili na nguvu kuwatagusa Wamisili na nizamkombolani. <verse eid="EXO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 6:7" />Nizawatendani kuwa wanhu wangu‚ niye nizakuwa Mulungu wenu. Mweye mwizanimanya kuwa niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu yoniwalekelele kulawa kuna uutumwa muna iisi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 6:8" />Nizamgalani muna iisi ija yoniilahile kuweng'ha Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo. Nizamwing'hani iwe yenu‚ niye iyo Mndewa Mulungu.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 6:9" />Musa kawalongela Waisilaili mbuli ino‚ mbali wawo hawamtegeleze kwaviya wakala wafa moyo kwa ichimu cha utumwa.<verse eid="EXO 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 6:10" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa‚ <verse eid="EXO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 6:11" />“Hita kwa mfalume wa Misili ukamulongele kuwa kolondeka kuwalekelela Waisilaili wasegele muna iisi yake.”<verse eid="EXO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 6:12" />Mbali Musa kamwidika Mndewa Mulungu‚ “Lola, Waisilaili hawanitegeleze. Lelo mfalume wa Misili kezanitegeleza? Niye sidaha kulonga vinogile!” <verse eid="EXO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 6:13" />Mndewa Mulungu kawalagiliza Musa na Haluni‚ “Walongele Waisilaili na mfalume wa Misili kuwa niwalagilizani mweye kuwalava Waisilaili muna iisi ya Misili.”<verse eid="EXO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Musa na Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 6:14" />Wano wawo walangulizi wa ng'holo. Lubeni‚ chaudele wa Yakobo kakala na wana wane wa chilume, Henoki na Palu na Heziloni na Kalimi. Wawo wakala lukolo lwa Lubeni. <verse eid="EXO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 6:15" />Simeoni kakala na wana sita wa chilume‚ Yemueli na Yamini na Ohadi na Yakini na Sohali na Shauli, mwana wa mwanamke wa Chikanaani. Wawo wakala wa kaye ya Simeoni. <verse eid="EXO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 6:16" />Yano ni mazina ya wana wa chilume wa Lawi na nyelesi zawo‚ fana viili maandiko yawo, Gelishoni na Kohasi na Melali. Lawi kakala miyaka gana na malongo matatu na saba. <verse eid="EXO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 6:17" />Wana wa chilume wa Gelishoni wakala Libini na Shimei, nawo wakala na lukolo lwawo. <verse eid="EXO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 6:18" />Wana wa chilume wa Kohasi wakala Amilamu na Ishali na Hebuloni na Uzieli. Kohati kakala miyaka gana na malongo matatu na nhatu. <verse eid="EXO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 6:19" />Wana wa chilume wa Melali wakala Mali na Mushi. Wano wawo mawasaho wa ng'holo za Walawi fana viili maandiko yawo.<verse eid="EXO 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 6:20" />Amilamu kamsola Yokebedi lumbu wa tati yake‚ nayo kamwelekela Haluni na Musa. Amulamu kakala miyaka gana malongo matatu na saba. <verse eid="EXO 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 6:21" />Wana wa chilume wa Ishali wakala Kola na Nefegi na Zikili. <verse eid="EXO 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 6:22" />Wana wa chilume wa Uzieli wakala Mishaeli na Elisafani na Sisili.<verse eid="EXO 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 6:23" />Haluni kamsola Elisheba mndele wa Aminadabu, iviya kakala lumbu jake Nashoni, nayo kamwelekela Nadabu na Abihu na Eleazali na Isamali. <verse eid="EXO 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 6:24" />Wana wa chilume wa Kola wakala Asili na Elikana na Abiasafu. Wawo wakala wasaho wa ng'holo za Kola. <verse eid="EXO 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 6:25" />Eleazali mwana wa chilume wa Haluni kamsola imwe wa wandele wa Putieli, iyo kamwelekela Finehasi. Wano wakala wakulu wa ng'holo za Lawi.<verse eid="EXO 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 6:26" />Wano ni Haluni na Musa waja Mndewa Mulungu woyawalongele‚ “Walaveni wanhu wa Isilaili muna iisi ya Misili, lukolo kwa lukolo.” <verse eid="EXO 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 6:27" />Musa na Haluni niiwawo wowamulongele mfalume wa Misili yawalekelele Waisilaili walawe muna iisi ya Misili.<verse eid="EXO 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kowalagiliza Musa na Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 6:28" />Mndewa Mulungu viyalongile na Musa muna iisi ya Misili‚ <verse eid="EXO 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 6:29" />kamulongela Musa‚ “Niye Mndewa Mulungu. Mulongele mfalume wa Misili chila chinhu chonikulongela.” <verse eid="EXO 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 6:30" />Mbali Musa kamulongela Mndewa Mulungu‚ “Vino mfalume wa Misili kezanitegeleza? Niye sidaha kulonga vinogile.”<verse eid="EXO 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EXO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 7:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa‚ “Nikutenda uwe fana mulungu kwa mfalume wa Misili‚ sekulu wako Haluni kezalonga mbuli zako fana mulongaji wako. <verse eid="EXO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 7:2" />Mulongele Haluni chila chinhu chonikulagilize‚ nayo kezamulongela mfalume wa Misili yawalekelele Waisilaili wasegele muna iisi yake. <verse eid="EXO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 7:3" />Nizautenda moyo wa mfalume wa Misili uwe mdala‚ nizakongeza vilaguso vangu na mauzauza yangu muna iisi ya Misili, <verse eid="EXO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 7:4" />mbali mfalume wa Misili hezakutegeleza bule. Maabaho nizagolosa mkono wangu uli na nguvu na kuitagusa isi ya Misili na kuwalava wanhu wangu wa Isilaili kwa kuwatagusa ng'hani Wamisili. <verse eid="EXO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 7:5" />Wamisili wezanimanya kuwa niye iyo Mndewa Mulungu‚ lusita vondanilaguse udahi wangu na kuwalava Waisilaili muna iisi ya Misili.”<verse eid="EXO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 7:6" />Musa na Haluni watenda fana viya Mndewa Mulungu viyawalagilize. <verse eid="EXO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 7:7" />Lusita luja viwamulongele mfalume wa Misili, Musa kakala na miyaka malongo manane na Haluni kakala na miyaka malongo manane na mitatu.<verse eid="EXO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fimbo ya Haluni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 7:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kawalongela Musa na Haluni‚ <verse eid="EXO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 7:9" />“Mfalume wa Misili yahalonga na mweye, ‘Ilaguseni kwa kutenda mauzauza,’ maabaho mulongele Haluni, ‘Sola fimbo yako na ilagaze hasi haulongozi wa mfalume wa Misili, nayo izagaluka kuwa zoka.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 7:10" />Musa na Haluni wahita kwa mfalume wa Misili na kutenda fana viya Mndewa Mulungu viyawalagilize. Haluni kadilagaza hasi fimbo yake haulongozi ha mfalume wa Misili na wasang'hani wake, nayo igaluka kuwa zoka.<verse eid="EXO 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 7:11" />Maabaho mfalume wa Misili kawatanga wanhu wake weli na ubala na wahawi wa Misili‚ nawo watenda fana ivo kwa uhawi wawo. <verse eid="EXO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 7:12" />Chila munhu kailagaza fimbo yake, nayo igaluka kuwa zoka. Mbali fimbo ya Haluni izimela fimbo zawo. <verse eid="EXO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 7:13" />Moyo wa mfalume wa Misili ukala ung'hali mdala, halondile kuwategeleza, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyalongile.<verse eid="EXO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hulo da damu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 7:14" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa‚ “Moyo wa mfalume wa Misili mdala ng'hani, kolema kuwalekelela wanhu wahite. <verse eid="EXO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 7:15" />Ivo hita ukaiting'hane na mfalume wa Misili imitondo lusita viyohita kuulwanda lwa Naili. Mgozele muingema ya ulwanda. Sola mhome yako ija yoigaluke kuwa zoka. <verse eid="EXO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 7:16" />Maabaho mulongele mfalume wa Misili‚ Mndewa Mulungu‚ Mulungu wa Waebulaniya‚ kanhuma kumwako. Kolonga, ‘Walekelele wanhu wangu wahite‚ muladi wakanitambikile kuichuwala. Mbali mbaka sambi weye kolema kutegeleza. <verse eid="EXO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 7:17" />Lekamana Mndewa Mulungu kolonga kuwa kwa mbuli ino‚ kwizanimanya kuwa niye iyo Mndewa Mulungu. Lola nizayatowa mazi yano yeli muulwanda lwa Naili kwa mhome ino inili nayo mumkono wangu‚ nayo yezagaluka kuwa damu. <verse eid="EXO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 7:18" />Somba weli muna ulwanda lwa Naili wezakufa‚ lwanda lose lwizanung'ha vundo na Wamisili wezakwihilwa kung'wa mazi ya lwanda ulo.’”<verse eid="EXO 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 7:19" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa‚ “Mulongele Haluni yasole mhome yake yaigolose uchanyha ya mazi ya Misili na uchanyha ya nyanda zose na makolongo yose na malamba yose na mazimbu yose, nayo yezakuwa damu. Isi yose izakuwa na damu, mbaka muna ivia vose va mbawo na mabwe.” <verse eid="EXO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 7:20" />Musa na Haluni watenda fana viya Mndewa Mulungu viyawalagilize. Haluni kenula uchanyha mhome yake haulongozi ha mfalume wa Misili na wasang'hani wake, kayatowa mazi ya lwanda Naili, yose yagaluka kuwa damu. <verse eid="EXO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 7:21" />Somba weli muulwanda wafa‚ ulwanda lunung'ha vundo‚ ivo Wamisili wapotwa kuyang'wa mazi ya lwanda ulo. Isi yose ya Misili imema damu. <verse eid="EXO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 7:22" />Mbali wahawi wa Misili watenda vinhu fana ivo kwa uhawi wawo‚ ivo moyo wa mfalume wa Misili ukala ung'hali mdala, halondile kuwategeleza Musa na Haluni‚ fana Mndewa Mulungu viyalongile. <verse eid="EXO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 7:23" />Mfalume wa Misili kabwela ukaye yake, hata mbuli zino zilawilile hazigesile bule. <verse eid="EXO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 7:24" />Wamisili wose wahimba mumgwazo wa lwanda lwa Naili muladi wapate mazi ya kung'wa‚ mana wapotwa kung'wa mazi ya lwanda lwa Naili.<verse eid="EXO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 7:25" />Zifosa siku saba Mndewa Mulungu viyagaluse mazi ya lwanda lwa Naili.<verse eid="EXO 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EXO 8" />
  <para style="s">Hulo da mabula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 8:1" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa‚ “Hita kwa mfalume wa Misili na umulongele, Mndewa Mulungu kolonga‚ ‘Walekelele wanhu wangu wahite wakanitambikile. <verse eid="EXO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 8:2" />One uhalema kuwaleka wahite, nizaitowa isi yako yose kwa kugala mabula. <verse eid="EXO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 8:3" />Lwanda lwa Naili lwizamema mabula‚ nayo yezakwingila mbaka muna ikaye yako na muna ichiheleto chako cha kugona na muna dikomwa jako na muna zikaye za wanhu wako na wasang'hani wako. Mabula yayo yezakwingila muna ivivu venu na muna iviya va kubulugila usage. <verse eid="EXO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 8:4" />Mabula yezakudanda weye na wanhu wako na wasang'hani wako.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 8:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa‚ “Mulongele Haluni yagolose mkono wake na fimbo yake uchanyha ya nyanda na uchanyha ya makolongo na mazimbu‚ mabula yezalawilila na kwenela chila hanhu muna iisi ya Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 8:6" />Haluni kagolosa mkono wake muna yamazi yose ya Misili‚ mabula yalawilila na yaigubika isi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 8:7" />Mbali wahawi wa Misili watenda vinhu fana ivo kwa uhawi wawo, iviya mabula yeza yaigubika isi.<verse eid="EXO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 8:8" />Mfalume wa Misili kawatanga Musa na Haluni‚ kawalongela‚ “Mpuleni Mndewa Mulungu yayasegeze mabula yano kumwangu na kwa wanhu wangu, nizawalekelela wanhu wenu wahite wakamtambikile Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="EXO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 8:9" />Musa kamulongela mfalume wa Misili‚ “Vinoga! Nilongele lusita loulonda nikupulile kwa Mulungu, niwapulile wanhu wako na wasang'hani wako. Nizampula yayadanganize mabula yano yeli muna zikaye zenu, yezasigala muna ulwanda lwa Naili muhala.”<verse eid="EXO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 8:10" />Mfalume wa Misili kamwidika, “Igolo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 8:10">Musa kamwidika‚ “Nizatenda fana viulongile, muladi uvimanye kuwa habule munhu yoyose yalingile fana Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu. <verse eid="EXO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 8:11" />Mabula yezasegela kumwako na muna zikaye zako na muna zikaye za wasang'hani wako na wanhu wako, yezasigala muna ulwanda lwa Naili muhala.” <verse eid="EXO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 8:12" />Maabaho Musa na Haluni wasegela kwa mfalume wa Misili, Musa kampula Mndewa Mulungu yamsegezele mfalume wa Misili mabula yayo yoyamgalile. <verse eid="EXO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 8:13" />Mndewa Mulungu katenda fana viya Musa viyapulile‚ mabula wafa muna zikaye zawo na muna zimbuga zawo na muna imigunda yawo. <verse eid="EXO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 8:14" />Wamisili wayaduganya mabula yayo vibugulu bugulu, isi yose inung'ha vundo. <verse eid="EXO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 8:15" />Mfalume wa Misili viyawone mabula yafa‚ kawa na moyo mdala kaidi‚ hawategeleze Musa na Haluni, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyalongile.<verse eid="EXO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hulo da usawasawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 8:16" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Mulongele Haluni yadigolose balati jake na kuyatowa matimbwisi‚ nayo yezagaluka kuwa usawasawa muna iisi yose ya Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 8:17" />Nawo watenda ivo, Haluni kagolosa balati jake na kayatowa yamatimbwisi, nayo yagaluka usawasawa uwavamba wanhu na wanyama. Matimbwisi yose muna iisi ya Misili yagaluka kuwa usawasawa. <verse eid="EXO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 8:18" />Wahawi kwa uhawi wawo wageza kutenda matimbwisi yagaluke kuwa usawasawa, mbali wapotwa. Usawasawa uwo uwavamba wanhu na wanyama. <verse eid="EXO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 8:19" />Wahawi waja wamulongela mfalume wa Misili, “Sang'hano ino kaitenda Mulungu!” Mbali mfalume wa Misili kagendelela kuwa na moyo mdala, hawategeleze Musa na Haluni, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyalongile.<verse eid="EXO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hulo da ng'honzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 8:20" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Igolo wiidawe ng'hani uhite kwa mfalume wa Misili lusita viyohita kuulwanda na umulongele kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, ‘Uwaleke wanhu wangu wahite wakanitosele.’ <verse eid="EXO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 8:21" />One uhalema kuwalekelela wahite, nizakugalila mabumbila ya ng'honzi, weye na wasang'hani wako na wanhu wako. Ng'honzi wawo wezakwingila muna zikaye zenu, kaye zose za Wamisili zizamema mabumbila ya ng'honzi, hata isi yose wanhu haweli.”<verse eid="EXO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 8:22" />“Mbali siku iyo nizaibagula isi ya Gosheni iwokala wanhu wangu, muladi ng'honzi sekewawe uko. Kwa kutenda ivo kwizavimanya kuwa niye Mndewa Mulungu na muna iisi ino. <verse eid="EXO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 8:23" />Nizawabagula wanhu wangu na wanhu wako. Chilaguso chino cha mauzauza chizalawilila igolo.” <verse eid="EXO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 8:24" />Mndewa Mulungu katenda fana viyalongile. Mabumbila makulu ya ng'honzi yengila muna ikaye ya mfalume wa Misili na muna zikaye za wasang'hani wake. Wanhu wose wa isi iyo wagazigwa na ng'honzi wawo.<verse eid="EXO 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 8:25" />Maabaho mfalume wa Misili kawatanga Musa na Haluni na kawalongela, “Hiteni mukamtosele Mulungu wenu muna iisi ino.”<verse eid="EXO 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 8:26" />Musa kamwidika, “Havinogile kutenda ivo, mana nhambiko zondachimtambikile Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu, zizawatenda Wamisili wehilwe. Vino Wamisili wahachiwona cholava nhambiko zoziwehila wawo, hawezachitowa na mabwe mbaka chidanganike? <verse eid="EXO 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 8:27" />Cholondeka chigende mwanza wa siku nhatu muna ichuwala chikamulavile nhambiko Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu, fana viyachilagilize.”<verse eid="EXO 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 8:28" />Mfalume wa Misili kawalongela, “Nizamulekani muhite mukamulavile nhambiko Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu kuichuwala, mbali sekemuhite kutali ng'hani. Iviya nipulileni na niye.”<verse eid="EXO 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 8:29" />Musa kamwidika, “Sambi vonisegela, nizampula Mndewa Mulungu muladi igolo yayasegeze mabumbila yano ya ng'honzi kumwako na kwa wasang'hani wako na kwa wanhu wako. Mbali weye sekeuchivwizile kaidi kwa kulema kuwaleka wanhu wahite kumulavila nhambiko Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="EXO 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 8:30" />Maabaho Musa kasegela kwa mfalume wa Misili na kampula Mndewa Mulungu, <verse eid="EXO 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 8:31" />Mndewa Mulungu katenda fana Musa viyampulile. Kawasegeza ng'honzi wose kwa mfalume wa Misili na kwa wasang'hani wake na kwa wanhu wake, hasigale hata ng'honzi imwe. <verse eid="EXO 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 8:32" />Mbali hata mwanza uno mfalume wa Misili kakala na moyo mdala na hawalekile wanhu wasegele.<verse eid="EXO 8:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EXO 9" />
  <para style="s">Hulo da mitamu ya wanyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 9:1" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Hita kwa mfalume wa Misili na umulongele kuwa Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Waebulaniya kolonga, ‘Walekele wanhu wangu wahite muladi wakanitosele. <verse eid="EXO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 9:2" />One uhalema kaidi kuwaleka wahite na uhagendelela kuwamhilila, <verse eid="EXO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 9:3" />nizagolosa mkono wangu na kuwagalila wanyama wako mitamu, ng'ombe na vihongwe na mhunda na ngamiya na ng'hondolo na luti. <verse eid="EXO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 9:4" />Na nizagola wanyama wa Waisilaili na wanyama wa Wamisili muladi hata mnyama imwe wa Waisilaili sekeyafe.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 9:5" />Mndewa Mulungu keka lusita na kalonga, “Igolo Mndewa Mulungu kezatenda mbuli ino muna iisi.”<verse eid="EXO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 9:6" />Igolo yake Mndewa Mulungu katenda fana viyalongile. Wanyama wose wa Wamisili wafa, mbali wanyama wa Waisilaili hafile hata imwe. <verse eid="EXO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 9:7" />Mfalume wa Misili kauza chiya chilawilile kwa wanyama wa Waisilaili, kalongiligwa kuwa habule hata mnyama imwe yafile. Hata ivo mfalume wa Misili kagendelela kuwa na moyo mdala, hawalekele wanhu wahite.<verse eid="EXO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hulo da maihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 9:8" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kawalongela Musa na Haluni, “Soleni maganza ya maivu ya tanuli, maabaho Musa yayapigise uchanyha haulongozi ha mfalume wa Misili. <verse eid="EXO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 9:9" />Maivu yayo yezakuwa timbwisi sisili dondajenele muna iisi yose ya Misili. Nayo yezagala maihu yondayatumbuke na kuwa vilonda kwa wanhu na wanyama chila hanhu muna iisi ya Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 9:10" />Ivo wasola maivu ya tanuli na wema haulongozi ha mfalume wa Misili, Musa kayapigisa uchanyha, nayo yawa maihu yotumbuka na kuwa vilonda kwa wanhu na wanyama. <verse eid="EXO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 9:11" />Wahawi wapotwa kwima haulongozi ha Musa kwaviya wakala na maihu, mana Wamisili wose wakala na maihu. <verse eid="EXO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 9:12" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kautenda moyo wa mfalume wa Misili uwe mdala na hawategeleze Musa na Haluni, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulongele Musa.<verse eid="EXO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hulo da mvula ya mabwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 9:13" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Igolo wiidawe ng'hani uhite kwa mfalume wa Misili na umulongele kuwa Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Waebulaniya, kolonga, ‘Walekele wanhu wangu wahite muladi wakanitosele. <verse eid="EXO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 9:14" />Mana lelo nogala mahulo yangu yose kumwako na wasang'hani wako na wanhu wako, ivo kwizavimanya kuwa habule yalingile fana niye muna izisi zose. <verse eid="EXO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 9:15" />Mana one nihakugalile mitamu ihile weye na wanhu wako, muhawile mudanganika mumala. <verse eid="EXO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 9:16" />Mbali nikuleka uwe mgima muladi kulagusa udahi wangu. Ivo wanhu wa zisi zose wezavimanya kuwa niye iyo yelihi. <verse eid="EXO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 9:17" />Mbali ung'hali kowalagusa udugi wanhu wangu na huwalekela wasegele. <verse eid="EXO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 9:18" />Lelo, igolo lusita fana luno, nizagala mvula ng'hulu ya mabwe, iyo hainalawilila muna iisi ya Misili, kwandusila mwanduso wake mbaka sambi. <verse eid="EXO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 9:19" />Lelo lagiliza wanyama wako na chila chinhu chili kumgunda vikigwe muna ikaye. Kwaviya mvula ya mabwe izamtonyela chila munhu na mnyama yeli kumgunda na mnyama yeli kunze ya kaye, wose wezakufa.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 9:20" />Wasang'hani wamwenga wa mfalume wa Misili wadumba na watenda fana viyalongile Mndewa Mulungu. Wawagala watumwa wawo na wanyama wawo muna ikaye. <verse eid="EXO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 9:21" />Mbali waja wayehule mbuli ya Mndewa Mulungu, wawaleka watumwa wawo na wanyama wawo kuna imigunda.<verse eid="EXO 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 9:22" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Golosa mkono wako kuulanga, muladi mvula ya mabwe itonye chila hanhu muna iisi ya Misili. Iwatonyele wanhu na wanyama na vose vihandigwe muna imigunda.” <verse eid="EXO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 9:23" />Ivo Musa kagolosa mhome yake kuulanga, Mndewa Mulungu kagala mvula ya mabwe na mbumo, lumwemwe lumweka muna iisi. Mndewa Mulungu kagala mvula ya mabwe muna iisi yose ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 9:24" />Mvula ng'hulu ya mabwe ikalile na lumwemwe, iyo habule munhu yoyose muna iisi ya Misili yaiwonile mvula ilingile ivo kwandusila mwanduso. <verse eid="EXO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 9:25" />Mvula iyo ya mabwe ibemenda chila chinhu chikalile muna imigunda na chila hanhu muna iisi ya Misili, wanyama na wanhu. Mabwe ya mvula iyo yabemenda mimeya yose na mibiki kuna imigunda. <verse eid="EXO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 9:26" />Muna iisi ya Gosheni muhala, kowakalile Waisilaili, hakukalile na mvula ya mabwe.<verse eid="EXO 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 9:27" />Mfalume wa Misili kawatuma wanhu wakawatange Musa na Haluni na kawalongela. “Mwanza uno nitenda uhasanyi, Mndewa Mulungu kanoga, mbali niye na wanhu wangu chibananga. <verse eid="EXO 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 9:28" />Mpuleni Mndewa Mulungu, mana mibumo ino na mvula ya mabwe viiyoha ng'hani. Niye nizamulekelani musegele na hebu hamwizagendelela kukala hano.”<verse eid="EXO 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 9:29" />Musa kamulongela, “Lusita vondanilawe muna dibululu, nizakwinula makono yangu kuchanyha na kumpula Mndewa Mulungu. Mibumo izaleka, hebu hakwizakuwa na mvula ya mabwe kaidi, muladi uvimanye kuwa zisi zose ni za Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 9:30" />Mbali novimanya kuwa weye na wasang'hani wako hamumdumba Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="EXO 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 9:31" />Mkonge na chinhu chilingile fana magota ya uwele vose vikala vibanangigwa, kwaviya uwele ukala na masuke na mkonge ukala wokwalika. <verse eid="EXO 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 9:32" />Mbali ngano na vinhu vimwenga vilingile fana ngano havibanangike, kwaviya vokalama kukangala.<verse eid="EXO 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 9:33" />Musa kasegela ukaye kwa mfalume wa Misili na kahita kunze ya bululu, kenula makono yake kwa Mndewa Mulungu, mibumo na mvula ya mabwe vileka. Mvula haitonyile muna iisi. <verse eid="EXO 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 9:34" />Mbali mfalume wa Misili viyawonile mvula na mvula ya mabwe na mibumo vileka, katenda uhasanyi kaidi. Kawa na moyo mdala yeye na wasang'hani wake. <verse eid="EXO 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 9:35" />Ivo moyo wa mfalume wa Misili ukala mdala, hawalekile Waisilaili wahite, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyalongile kufosela Musa.<verse eid="EXO 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EXO 10" />
  <para style="s">Hulo da nzige</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 10:1" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Hita kwa mfalume wa Misili, mana niutenda moyo wake na moyo wa wasang'hani wake kuwa mdala muladi nidahe kutenda vilaguso vangu kumwawo. <verse eid="EXO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 10:2" />Nitenda vino muladi muwasimulile wanenu na wazukulu zenu, viya viniwatendile Wamisili kuwa wabozi kwa kutenda mauzauza kumwawo, ivo mwizavimanya kuwa niye iyo Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="EXO 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 10:3" />Ivo Musa na Haluni wahita kwa mfalume wa Misili na wamulongela, “Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Waebulaniya, kolonga, ‘Vino kwizalema kuinyendanyenda haulongozi wangu mbaka zuwaki? Walekelele wanhu wangu wahite, muladi wakanitambikile. <verse eid="EXO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 10:4" />One uhalema kuwalekela wanhu wangu wasegele, igolo nizagala nzige muna iisi yako. <verse eid="EXO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 10:5" />Wezatanda isi yose, habule munhu yondayadahe kuwona hasi. Wezakuja vinhu visigale viifosile mvula ya mabwe, hamwe na chila mbiki ukwima muna imigunda yako. <verse eid="EXO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 10:6" />Nzige wawo wezamema muna zikaye zako na muna zikaye za wasang'hani wako na muna zikaye za Wamisili wose. Wezakuwa wengi ng'hani hata wasaho zenu hawanawawona kwandusila viwelekigwe mbaka diyelo.’ ” Maabaho Musa kahinduka na kasegela kwa mfalume wa Misili.<verse eid="EXO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 10:7" />Wasang'hani wa mfalume wa Misili wamulongela, “Vino ino kezachigaza mbaka zuwaki? Waleke wanhu wano wahite muladi wakamtambikile Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wawo. Vino hugesa kuwa isi ya Misili yodanganizigwa?”<verse eid="EXO 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 10:8" />Maabaho Musa na Haluni wagaligwa kaidi kwa mfalume wa Misili, nayo kawalongela, “Hiteni mukamtosele Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu. Mbali welihi wondawahite?”<verse eid="EXO 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 10:9" />Musa kamwidika, “Chizahita wose, wabwanga na walala. Chizasegela hamwe na wanetu wa chike na wa chilume, ng'hondolo wetu na luti na ng'ombe, mana cholondeka chimtendele dugila da hishima Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="EXO 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 10:10" />Kwa kuwazeha, mfalume wa Misili kawalongela, “Mndewa Mulungu yawe hamwe na mweye one nihamulekeleni muhite na wanenu. Kweli muna lungilo dihile muna imizoyo yenu. <verse eid="EXO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 10:11" />Haidahika! Walume muhala wawo wondawahite kumtambikila Mndewa Mulungu, mana mbuli ino iyo imulondile umwaka.” Maabaho Musa na Haluni wawingigwa haulongozi ha mfalume wa Misili.<verse eid="EXO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 10:12" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Golosa mkono wako uchanyha ya isi ya Misili, muladi nzige walawilile wengile na kuja mimeya yose muna iisi na vinhu vose visigazigwe na mvula ija ya mabwe.” <verse eid="EXO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 10:13" />Musa kagolosa fimbo yake uchanyha ya isi ya Misili, Mndewa Mulungu kagala beho kulu kulawa ulawilo wa zua, dibuma muna iisi ya Misili misi yose na chilo chose. Vikuchile, beho diya da ulawilo wa zuwa digala nzige. <verse eid="EXO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 10:14" />Nzige wawo wapwililika chila hanhu muna iisi ya Misili, na wakala bumbila kulu ng'hani hawanalawilila nzige fana wawo na hawezalawilila kaidi. <verse eid="EXO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 10:15" />Mana waigubika isi yose ya Misili, mbaka isi iwa na ziza. Waja mimeya yose na matunda yose yasigale chipindi chiya cha mvula ya mabwe. Muna iisi yose ya Misili habule hata yani dimwe disigale hebu mbiki hebu mmeya kuna imigunda.<verse eid="EXO 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 10:16" />“Baho mfalume wa Misili kawatanga Musa na Haluni himahima na kawalongela, ‘Nimuhasanya Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu, na mweye iviya nimuhasanyani. <verse eid="EXO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 10:17" />Lelo nilekeleleni uhasanyi wangu mwanza uno umwe muhala, munipulile kwa Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu, yanisegezele hulo dino dihile ng'hani.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 10:18" />“Musa kasegela kwa mfalume wa Misili na kampula Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 10:19" />Mndewa Mulungu kagala beho da uswelo wa zuwa dili na nguvu ng'hani, ijo diwasegeza nzige waja na kuwagala muna ibahali ya Shamu. Hasigale hata nzige imwe muna iisi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 10:20" />Mbali Mndewa Mulungu kautenda moyo wa mfalume wa Misili kuwa mdala, hawalekelele Waisilaili wahite.”<verse eid="EXO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hulo da ziza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 10:21" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Golosa mkono wako kuulanga, muladi ziza totolo diigubike isi yose ya Misili. Ziza dondadiwatende wanhu wababase.” <verse eid="EXO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 10:22" />Lelo Musa kagolosa mkono wake kuulanga, kukala na ziza totolo muna iisi yose ya Misili kwa siku nhatu. <verse eid="EXO 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 10:23" />Wanhu hawadahile kuiwona hebu kusegela hanhu howakalile kwa siku nhatu. Mbali Waisilaili wakala na bung'hulo uko Gosheni kowakalile.<verse eid="EXO 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 10:24" />Mfalume wa Misili kamtanga Musa na kumulongela, “Hiteni mukamtosele Mndewa Mulungu, hamwe na wanenu. Mbali ng'hondolo wenu na luti na ng'ombe wolondeka wasigale hano.”<verse eid="EXO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 10:25" />Mbali Musa kamwidika, “Uching'he wanyama muladi chikamtimbulile Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wetu. <verse eid="EXO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 10:26" />Iviya wanyama wetu wofugigwa cholondeka chisegele nawo, hezasigala hata mnyama imwe hebu mapaga, mana chizamtimbulila Mndewa Mulungu mnyama kulawa muna iwanyama wetu. Cheye hachivimanyile mnyama ilihi yondachimtimbulile Mndewa Mulungu mbaka vondachifike uko.”<verse eid="EXO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 10:27" />Mndewa Mulungu kautenda moyo wa mfalume wa Misili kuwa mdala, hawalekile Waisilaili wahite. <verse eid="EXO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 10:28" />Mfalume wa Misili kamulongela Musa, “Segela haulongozi wangu! Sekewize kuniwona kaidi. Mana siku yondawize kaidi haulongozi wangu, kwizadanganika!”<verse eid="EXO 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 10:29" />Musa kamwidika, “Fana viulongile, sizakwiza kukuwona kaidi.”<verse eid="EXO 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EXO 11" />
  <para style="s">Kukomigwa kwa welekwa wa udele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 11:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Nizagala hulo dimwenga dimwe kwa mfalume wa Misili na wanhu wake. Maabaho kezamulekani musegele, na vondayamulekeni musegele, kezamuwingani ng'hani. <verse eid="EXO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 11:2" />Walongele Waisilaili kuwa chila imwe wawo, muke kwa mulume, kolondeka yampule mkaya miyage via va hela na zahabu.” <verse eid="EXO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 11:3" />Mndewa Mulungu kawatenda Waisilaili wanogelwe na Wamisili. Iviya Musa kakala munhu yohishimika ng'hani muna iisi ya Misili na haulongozi ha mfalume wa Misili na wasang'hani wake.<verse eid="EXO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 11:4" />Ivo Musa kalonga, “Mndewa Mulungu kolonga, ‘Ichilo chikulu nizafosela Misili. <verse eid="EXO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 11:5" />Chila mwana chaudele wa chilume muna iisi ya Misili kezadanganika, kwandusila mwana chaudele wa mfalume wa Misili yokala muna ichigoda cha chifalume yeli muhazi wake, mbaka mwana chaudele wa msang'hani wake wa chike yodunda mhule muna idibwe. Hata wana chaudele wa wanyama wofugigwa, wose wezadanganika. <verse eid="EXO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 11:6" />Muna iisi yose ya Misili mwizakuwa na ndilo ng'hulu, ndilo yake hainalawilila na haizalawilila kaidi. <verse eid="EXO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 11:7" />Mbali mwa Waisilaili kwizakuwa kwabule ndilo na kwizakuwa na tindiwalo, baho wezavimanya kuwa Mndewa Mulungu niiyo yowabagula Wamisili na Waisilaili.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 11:8" />Musa kakomelezela kwa kumulongela mfalume wa Misili, “Wasang'hani wako wano wose wezanizila na kuinama kwa hishima haulongozi wangu, wezanilamba nisegele muna iisi ya Misili, niye na wanhu wose wonisondelela. Zihakomelezeka mbuli izo, nizasegela.” Maabaho Musa kuno kana ludoko kasegela kwa mfalume wa Misili.<verse eid="EXO 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 11:9" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Mfalume wa Misili hezakutegeleza, muladi mauzauza yangu yongezeke muna iisi ya Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 11:10" />Musa na Haluni watenda mauzauza yano yose haulongozi ha mfalume wa Misili, mbali Mndewa Mulungu kautenda moyo wa mfalume wa Misili kuwa mdala. Hawalekile Waisilaili wasegele muna iisi yake.<verse eid="EXO 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EXO 12" />
  <para style="s">Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 12:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kawalongela Musa na Haluni muna iisi ya Misili, <verse eid="EXO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 12:2" />“Mwezi uno wizakuwa mwezi wa mwanduso wa mwaka kumwenu. <verse eid="EXO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 12:3" />Walongeleni wanhu wose wa Isilaili kuwa isiku ya longo ya mwezi uno, chila munhu kolondeka yasole mwanang'hondolo imwe, kwa chila kaye imwe. <verse eid="EXO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 12:4" />One kaye ina wanhu wadodo ng'hani, yolondeka kuilumba na wakaya wayawo kuja inyama ya kuwafaya wanhu wake, maabaho wezasagula nyama chila munhu iyodaha kuja. <verse eid="EXO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 12:5" />Sagula bebelu kulawa mwa ng'hondolo hebu mwa luti. Diwe da mwaka umwe na dilibule chilema chochose. <verse eid="EXO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 12:6" />Mwizamwika mbaka siku ya longo na nne ya mwezi uno, maabaho Waisilaili wose wezachinja wanyama wawo ichigulogulo nguku zikwingila. <verse eid="EXO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 12:7" /><figure style="fig" file="OT-02 BloodOnTheDoorpost.jpg" size="col" ref="12:7">Kuhaka damu muna imibiki yamhilile ulwivi</figure>Wanhu wezasola damu ya mnyama wawo na kuhaka mibiki yamhilile ulwivi lwa ikaye yondawaje ng'hondolo. <verse eid="EXO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 12:8" />Wezakuja nyama ichilo icho vondawayoke, wezakuja hamwe na gate hadigumigwe lusu na mboga zili na usungu. <verse eid="EXO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 12:9" />Sekemuje nyama mbisi hebu itogosigwe, mbali yolondeka yokigwe yose, hamwe na ditwi na migulu na nyama zake za mgati. <verse eid="EXO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 12:10" />Sekemusigaze nyama yoyose mbaka imitondo, one ihasigala mbaka imitondo, molondeka muisome moto. <verse eid="EXO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 12:11" />Vino ivo vondamuje nyama iyo. Mwizakuwa mufunga mikwiji muna ivigudi venu na muyawala vilatu na mwamha mhome muna yamakono yenu kuisasala na mwanza, kaidi mwizakuja himahima. Iyo ni <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pasaka fambulo jake “Kufosa uchanyha ya kaye.”</char></note>Pasaka ya Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 12:12" />“Chilo icho nizafosela muna iisi ya Misili, nizawakoma wana wa udele wose muna iisi ya Misili, wanhu na wanyama. Nizaitagusa milungu yose ya Misili. Niye iyo Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 12:13" />Lelo damu ija izakuwa chilaguso chenu cha kulagusa kaye zondamuwe. Niye vondaniwone damu iyo, nizamfowelani na hamwizapatigwa na mbuli yoyose ihile lusita vondaniwataguse Wamisili. <verse eid="EXO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 12:14" />Siku ino izakuwa ya lukumbuso kumwenu, mwizaitenda iwe dugila kwa Mndewa Mulungu, hata nyelesi zenu zose kwa lagilizo da siku zose kumwenu.”<verse eid="EXO 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 12:15" />“Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, ‘Kwa siku saba, mwizakuja magate hayagumigwe lusu. Siku ya mwanduso ya siku saba izo, mwizasegeza lusu muna zikaye zenu. Munhu yoyose yahaja chinhu chigumigwe lusu muna zisiku saba izo, kolondeka yawingigwe na Waisilaili.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 12:16" />“Siku ya mwanduso na siku ya saba ni mting'hano wa kutosa kwa Mndewa Mulungu, mwizakuwa na dugila. Muna zisiku izo mbili hamulondeka kusang'hana usang'hano wowose, ila usang'hano wa kusasala ndiya. <verse eid="EXO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 12:17" />Mwizatenda dugila dino da magate hayagumigwe lusu fana lukumbuso lwa siku vonimulavileni mweye vibumbila va Waisilaili muna iisi ya Misili. Dugila ijo dizatendigwa siku ino na nyelesi zenu zose zikwiza fana lagilizo da siku zose. <verse eid="EXO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 12:18" />Mwezi wa mwanduso mwizakuja magate hayagumigwe lusu, kwandusila ichigulogulo cha siku ya longo na nne mbaka ichigulogulo cha siku ya malongo maidi na imwe. <verse eid="EXO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 12:19" />Kwa siku izo saba, sekemuwe na lusu jojose muna zikaye zenu. Munhu yoyose yawe mfosanzila hebu mkaya, yahaja chinhu chigumigwe lusu kezawingigwa na Waisilaili. <verse eid="EXO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 12:20" />Hanhu hohose homukala, sekemuje chinhu chigumigwe lusu. Molondeka muje magate hayagumigwe lusu.”<verse eid="EXO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pasaka ya mwanduso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 12:21" />Musa kawatanga walala wose wa Waisilaili na kuwalongela, “Chila imwe wenu yawasagulile wanhu wa ng'holo zake mwanang'hondolo wa chilume na kumchinja kwa ichimu cha Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 12:22" />Mwizasola mayani ya hisopo na kuyachofa muna idamu mgati ya diziga na kuihaka muna imibiki yamhilile ulwivi lwa kaye zenu. Munhu yoyose sekeyalawe kunze ya kaye ichilo icho mbaka imitondo. <verse eid="EXO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 12:23" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kezafosa kuwakoma Wamisili, one yahawona damu yoihakigwe muna imibiki yamhilile ulwivi lwa kaye zenu, kezafosa. Wala hezamuleka mkomaji yengile muna zikaye zenu na kumkomani. <verse eid="EXO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 12:24" />Mweye mwizaika mbuli ino kuwa lagilizo kumwenu na wanenu siku zose. <verse eid="EXO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 12:25" />Vondamwingile muna iisi ija Mndewa Mulungu iyamulaganileni kumwing'hani, mwizatenda dugila dino. <verse eid="EXO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 12:26" />Wanenu vondawawauze, ‘Dugila dino fambulo jake choni?’ <verse eid="EXO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 12:27" />Mwizawedika, ‘Ino nhambiko ya Pasaka ya Mndewa Mulungu, kwaviya kafosa uchanyha ya kaye za Waisilaili muna iisi ya Misili viyawakomile Wamisili, mbali cheye hachikomile.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 12:27">Maabaho Waisilaili waidulika matwi yawo na kumtambikila Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 12:28" />Maabaho Waisilaili wahita, watenda fana Mndewa Mulungu viyawalagilize Musa na Haluni.<verse eid="EXO 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zifa za wana wa udele wa Wamisili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 12:29" />Ichilo chikulu Mndewa Mulungu kawakoma wana chaudele wa muna iisi ya Misili, kwandusila chaudele wa mfalume wa Misili yakalile muna ichigoda cha chifalume, mbaka chaudele wa mfungwa na waudele wose wa wanyama. <verse eid="EXO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 12:30" />Ichilo chiya, mfalume wa Misili na wasang'hani wake na wanhu wose wa Misili, walamka. Kukala na ndilo ng'hulu muna iisi yose ya Misili, kwaviya hakukalile na kaye hata imwe munhu hadanganike. <verse eid="EXO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 12:31" />Ichilo icho mfalume wa Misili kawatanga Musa na Haluni na kawalongela, “Lamkeni! Segeleni muna iwanhu wangu. Segeleni mweye hamwe na Waisilaili muladi mukamtosele Mndewa Mulungu, fana vimulongile. <verse eid="EXO 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 12:32" />Soleni ng'hondolo wenu na luti wenu na ng'ombe wenu, musegele. Na niye iviya munitemele mate.”<verse eid="EXO 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 12:33" />Wamisili wawahimiza Waisilaili wasegele himahima kuna iisi yawo, walonga, “One hamusegele, wose chizadanganika.” <verse eid="EXO 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 12:34" />Ivo Waisilaili wausola usage wawo haugumigwe lusu na mahamha yawo ya kubulugila, waviguma muna yamawalo yawo mmayega. <verse eid="EXO 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 12:35" />Waisilaili watenda fana Musa viyawalongele, wawapula Wamisili via va zahabu na hela na viwalo. <verse eid="EXO 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 12:36" />Mndewa Mulungu kamala kuwatenda Waisilaili wanogelwe na Wamisili, Wamisili waweng'ha Waisilaili chila chinhu chowapulile. Vino niivo Waisilaili viwasolile vinhu va Wamisili.<verse eid="EXO 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisilaili wosegela Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 12:37" />Waisilaili wasegela kulawa bululu da Lamasesi wahita Sukosi. Wakala walume laki sita, wanaake na wana hawapetigwe bule. <verse eid="EXO 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 12:38" />Wanhu wamwenga wengi wahita hamwe nawo, ng'hondolo na luti na ng'ombe iviya wahita hamwe nawo. <verse eid="EXO 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 12:39" />Kwaviya wakala wasegele Misili himahima, hawadahile kusasala ndiya ya kuja muna inzila, ila usage uja ubulugigwe bila kugumigwa lusu, ivo woka magate hayagumigwe lusu. <verse eid="EXO 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 12:40" />Waisilaili wakala Misili miyaka magana mane na malongo matatu. <verse eid="EXO 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 12:41" />Viifikile siku ya uhelelo ya mwaka wa magana mane na malongo matatu, mabumbila yose ya wanhu wa Mndewa Mulungu wasegela Misili. <verse eid="EXO 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 12:42" />Ikala ichilo Mndewa Mulungu viyawakalize Waisilaili muladi yawalave muna iisi ya Misili, chilo chino yolondeka chikumbukigwe na Waisilaili wose na nyelesi zawo, fana ichilo cha kumuhishimu Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vihendo va Pasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 12:43" />Mndewa Mulungu kawalongela Musa na Haluni, “Malagilizo ya Pasaka yayo yano, nyambenyambe yoyose hezakuja ndiya ya Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 12:44" />Mbali mtumwa yoyose yaguligwe, yahengizigwa ulungwana kodaha kuja. <verse eid="EXO 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 12:45" />Nyambenyambe yofosa nzila hebu msang'hani yolihigwa, halondeka kuja ndiya iyo.<verse eid="EXO 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 12:46" />“Ndiya yose yolondeka kudigwa muna ikaye yoisasaligwe, sekemulawe nayo kunze hebu sekemubene hata vuha dimwe da mnyama wa Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EXO 12:47" />Wanhu wose wa Isilaili wolondeka watende dugila ijo. <verse eid="EXO 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EXO 12:48" />Nyambenyambe yoyose yokala kumwenu yahalonda kutenda Dugila da Pasaka da Mndewa Mulungu, teng'hu walume wose wokala muna ikaye yake wolondeka wengizigwe ulungwana, baho kezapeteka kuwa mkaya na kutogoleligwa kutenda dugila. Mulume yoyose hengizigwe ulungwana, sekeyaje ndiya ya Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EXO 12:49" />Malagilizo yayo yomsonhela mkaya Muisilaili na nyambenyambe yokala na mweye.” <verse eid="EXO 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EXO 12:50" />Waisilaili wose watenda fana Mndewa Mulungu viyawalagilize Musa na Haluni. <verse eid="EXO 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EXO 12:51" />Ssiku iyo Mndewa Mulungu kawalava Waisilaili muna iisi ya Misili kwa mabumbila.<verse eid="EXO 12:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EXO 13" />
  <para style="s">Kusafyigwa kwa wana chaudele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 13:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 13:2" />“Nisagulile wana chaudele wose wa chilume wawe wangu, mana wa Waisilaili na wa wanyama ni wangu.”<verse eid="EXO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dugila da Magate Hayagumigwe Lusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 13:3" />Musa kawalongela wanhu, “Muikumbuke siku ino, siku yomusegezigwe muna iisi ya Misili, isi yomukalile watumwa. Mana Mndewa Mulungu kamulavani kwa udahi wake mkulu, muna isiku ino sekemuje magate yagumigwe lusu. <verse eid="EXO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 13:4" />Diyelo muna umwezi wa Abibu, mwizasegela muna iisi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 13:5" />Mndewa Mulungu vondayamgaleni muna iisi ya Wakanaani na Wahiti na Waamoli na Wahivi na Wayebusi, isi ija iyawalahile kuweng'ha wasaho zenu, isi ili na ulongo unogile. Molondeka kuditenda dugila dino chila mwaka muna umwezi uno. <verse eid="EXO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 13:6" />Kwa siku saba muje magate hayagumigwe lusu, siku ya saba mwizatenda dugila da kumuhishimu Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 13:7" />Kwa siku saba hamulondeka kuja magate yagumigwe lusu. Magate yagumigwe lusu hebu lusu, sekeviwoneke kumwenu na muna iisi yenu yose. <verse eid="EXO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 13:8" />Na mwizawalongela wanenu siku ijo kuwa ni kwa ichimu cha yoyawatendeleni Mndewa Mulungu viyamulavileni muna iisi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 13:9" />Dugila dino dizakuwa lukumbuso fana chilaguso muna yamakono yenu hebu muna ivihanga venu, muladi siku zose chiwakumbuse kulonga malagilizo ya Mndewa Mulungu. Mana Mndewa Mulungu kamulavani muna iisi ya Misili kwa udahi wake mkulu. <verse eid="EXO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 13:10" />Ivo molondeka mutende dugila dino lusita lwikigwe chila mwaka.”<verse eid="EXO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waudele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 13:11" />“Lusita Mndewa Mulungu vondayakugale muna iisi ya Kanaani, kezamwing'hani fana viyakulahile weye na wasaho zako, <verse eid="EXO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 13:12" />kolondeka kumwing'ha Mndewa Mulungu chila chaudele wako wa chilume. Waudele wose wa chilume wa wanyama wako wezakuwa wa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 13:13" />Mbali chaudele wa chihongwe kwizamkombola kwa kuliha mwanang'hondolo, mbali one hudaha kutenda ivo, kwizamkoma kwa kumbena isingo yake. Iviya kwizamkombola chila mwanago chaudele wa chilume.<verse eid="EXO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 13:14" />“Hamwande mwanago yahakuuza fambulo da chinhu chino, kwizamulongela, ‘Mndewa Mulungu kachilava muna iisi ya Misili kwa udahi wake mkulu, kachisegeza muna iisi ya Misili kochikalile watumwa. <verse eid="EXO 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 13:15" />Lusita mfalume wa Misili viyakalile na moyo mdala kalema kuchilekela chihite, Mndewa Mulungu kawakoma chila chaudele wa chilume muna iisi ya Misili, wanhu na wanyama. Lekamana chomulavila Mndewa Mulungu nhambiko ya mnyama mulume , mbali chowakombola wanetu wa chilume. <verse eid="EXO 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 13:16" />Chino chizakuwa fana chilaguso muna umkono wako na muna ichihanga chako, kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kachilava muna iisi ya Misili kwa udahi wake mkulu.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuloka ibahali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 13:17" />Mfalume wa Misili viyawalekele wanhu wahite, Mulungu halondile wafosele nzila ihitile isi ya Wafilisiti, ingawa ikala nzila ikanhize. Mulungu kalonga, “One kuhawa na ng'hondo, wezadaha kugalula magesa yawo na kubwela Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 13:18" />Mbali Mulungu kawafoseza Waisilaili kuna inzila nhali kufosela muna ichuwala, kuhita bahali ya Shamu. Waisilaili wasegela Misili kuno waisasala kwa ng'hondo.<verse eid="EXO 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 13:19" />Musa kaisola mivuha ya Yosefu, fana viya Yosefu viyalagilize lusita yang'hali hanadanganika. Kawalahiza Waisilaili, kalonga, “Mulungu vondayamulaveni, molondeka muipape mivuha yangu musegele nayo.” <verse eid="EXO 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 13:20" />Waisilaili wasegela Sukosi na weka lago uko Esamu muimhaka ya ichuwala. <verse eid="EXO 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 13:21" />Imisi Mndewa Mulungu kawalongolela muna yamawingu yalingile fana mhanda kuwalagusa nzila, ichilo kawalongolela muna umoto ulingile fana mhanda kuweng'ha bung'hulo, muladi wadahe kugenda imisi na ichilo. <verse eid="EXO 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 13:22" />Mawingu yalingile fana mhanda lusita lwa imisi na moto ulingile fana mhanda lusita lwa ichilo, havilekile kuwalongolela Waisilaili.<verse eid="EXO 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EXO 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 14:1" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 14:2" />“Walongele Waisilaili wabwele hachisogo na weke mahema haulongozi ha Pihahilosi, hagati ya Migidoli na Bahali ya Shamu, haulongozi wa Baali Sefoni. <verse eid="EXO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 14:3" />Mfalume wa Misili kezagesa kuwa Waisilaili wowegela muna iisi na chuwala chiwahindila. <verse eid="EXO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 14:4" />Nizautenda moyo wa mfalume wa Misili kuwa mdala, nayo kezamsondelelani. Niye nizaipatila utunhizo kwa kuwananga mfalume wa Misili na wakalizi wake, Wamisili wezavimanya kuwa niye iyo Mndewa Mulungu.” Maabaho Waisilaili watenda fana viya viwalongeligwe.<verse eid="EXO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 14:5" />Mfalume wa Misili viyalongeligwe wanhu wamala kusegela, yeye na wasang'hani wake wagalula magesa yawo na walonga, “Choni chino chochitendile? Chiwalekela Waisilaili wasegele na chipuwa wasang'hani wa kuchisang'hanila.” <verse eid="EXO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 14:6" />Mfalume kasasala tololi jake da kubululigwa na falasi na kuwasola wakalizi wake. <verse eid="EXO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 14:7" /><figure style="fig" file="OT-04 Chariot.jpg" size="col" ref="14:7">Mituka ya kubululigwa na falasi</figure>Iviya kasola mituka inogile magana sita na mituka imwenga yose ya Wamisili, wakulu wa wakalizi wake wose, wakwela mituka iyo. <verse eid="EXO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 14:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kautenda moyo wa mfalume wa Misili kuwa mdala, muladi yawasondelele Waisilaili, wowasegele kwa ugangamalo. <verse eid="EXO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 14:9" />Wamisili hamwe na falasi wawo wose na mituka yoibululigwa na falasi na wakalizi wake wawasondelela Waisilaili, wawafika wozenga lago hamgwazo ya bahali, habehi na Pihahilosi, haulongozi wa Baali Sefoni.<verse eid="EXO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 14:10" />Lusita Waisilaili viwamuwonile mfalume wa Misili na wakalizi wake wowasondelela wawo, wadumba ng'hani na wamulilila Mndewa Mulungu yawataze. <verse eid="EXO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 14:11" />Wamulongela Musa, “Vino hakukalile na maleme muna iisi ya Misili mbaka kuchigala chidanganikile kuno kuchuwala? Habali kuchitendela mbuli ino kwa kuchilava muna iisi ya Misili? <verse eid="EXO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 14:12" />Vino hachikulongele mbuli zino vichikalile ching'hali muna iisi ya Misili? Chikulongela uchilekele chigendelele kuwasang'hanila Wamisili. Ihawile muhavu kuwasang'hanila Wamisili sembuse kudanganikila kuno kuchuwala.”<verse eid="EXO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 14:13" />Musa kawedika Waisilaili, “Sekemdumbe! Imeni chigangamavu! Diyelo mwizawona viya Mndewa Mulungu vondayawakomboleni. Mana Wamisili wano womuwawona diyelo, hamwizawawona kaidi. <verse eid="EXO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 14:14" />Mndewa Mulungu kezamgombelani mweye, mweye molondeka munyamale hupi.”<verse eid="EXO 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 14:15" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Habali monililila? Walongele Waisilaili wagendele na mwanza. <verse eid="EXO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 14:16" />Inula mhome yako na uigolose uchanyha ya bahali uyagole yamazi, muladi Waisilaili wadahe kufosa hagati ya bahali hanhu hanyalile. <verse eid="EXO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 14:17" />Niye nizawatenda Wamisili wawe na mizoyo midala muladi wawasondeleleni muna ibahali, nizaipatila utunhizo kwa kumuhuma mfalume wa Misili na wakalizi wake na mituka yake na wakwela falasi wake. <verse eid="EXO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 14:18" />Na wanhu wa isi ya Misili wezanimanya kuwa niye Mndewa Mulungu, vondaniipatile utunhizo kwa mfalume wa Misili na mituka yake na wakwelafalasi wake.”<verse eid="EXO 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 14:19" />Maabaho msenga wa Mulungu kawalongolela wakalizi wa Isilaili, kasegela na kakala hachisogo chawo. Iviya mhanda ija ng'hulu ya wingu isegela na kukala hachisogo chawo, <verse eid="EXO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 14:20" />ima hagati ya Wamisili na Waisilaili. Mhanda iyo ya wingu ubanzi umwe ilava ziza, ubanzi umwenga ilava bung'hulo. Ivo mabumbila yayo maidi, wakalizi wa Misili na Waisilaili hawaikwenhukile ichilo chose.<verse eid="EXO 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 14:21" />
    <figure style="fig" file="OT-06 RedSea.JPG" size="col" ref="14:21">Beho diigola bahali banzi mbili, hagati halawilila isi inyalile</figure>Musa kagolosa mkono wake uchanyha ya bahali, Mndewa Mulungu kaibweleza bahali kuchisogo kwa beho kulu kulawa ulawilo wa zuwa, beho ijo dibuma ichilo chose, diigola bahali banzi mbili, hagati halawilila isi inyalile. Mazi yaigola, <verse eid="EXO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 14:22" />Waisilaili wafosa muna ibahali hana iisi inyalile, mazi yaigola banzi mbili fana ng'huta. <verse eid="EXO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 14:23" />Wamisili wawasondelela na wengila mgati muna ibahali, falasi wawo wose na wakwela falasi wawo na mituka yawo ya ng'hondo. <verse eid="EXO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 14:24" />Habehi na kucha, Mndewa Mulungu kawalola wakalizi wa Wamisili kulawa muna imhanda ija ya moto na wingu, kawatenda bumbila da wakalizi wa Misili wawe na lugano ng'hani. <verse eid="EXO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 14:25" />Kayemiza maguludumu ya matololi yawo ya kubululigwa na falasi, yakala yogenda ugaluga ng'hani. Wamisili walonga, “Leka chiwakimbile Waisilaili! Mndewa Mulungu kowagombela Waisilaili!”<verse eid="EXO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 14:26" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Golosa mkono wako uchanyha ya bahali, muladi mazi yabwele na kuwagubika Wamisili na mituka yawo na wakwelafalasi wawo.” <verse eid="EXO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 14:27" />Musa kagolosa mkono wake uchanyha ya bahali, vikukunguzuke mazi yabwela fana viyakalile. Wamisili wageza kuyakimbila yamazi, mbali Mndewa Mulungu kawasung'hila muna yamazi. <verse eid="EXO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 14:28" />Mazi yabwela na yagubika mituka hamwe na wakwela falasi, wakalizi wose wa mfalume wa Misili wowawasondelele Waisilaili wadanganika muna ibahali. Hasigale Mmisili hata imwe. <verse eid="EXO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 14:29" />Mbali Waisilaili wafosa hagati ya bahali hanhu hanyalile, mazi yakala fana ng'huta kulume kwawo na kumoso kwawo.<verse eid="EXO 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 14:30" />Siku iyo Mndewa Mulungu kawakombola Waisilaili kulawa muna yamakono ya Wamisili. Waisilaili wawawona Wamisili mumgwazo mwa ibahali wadanganika. <verse eid="EXO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 14:31" />Waisilaili viwawonile udahi mkulu Mndewa Mulungu uyalaguse kwa Wamisili, Waisilaili wamdumba Mndewa Mulungu na wamuhuwila yeye na Musa msang'hani wake.<verse eid="EXO 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EXO 15" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 15:1" />Maabaho Musa na Waisilaili wamwimbila Mndewa Mulungu wila uno, walonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:1">“Nizamwimbila Mndewa Mulungu yeli uchanyha ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:1">Kawasa muna ibahali falasi na wakwela falasi.<verse eid="EXO 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 15:2" />Mndewa Mulungu niiyo mgombezi wangu na chimu cha wila wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">yeye iyo yonikombola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">Yeye Mulungu wangu, niye nizamtogoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">Mulungu wa tati yangu, nizamtunhiza.<verse eid="EXO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 15:3" />Mulungu galu wa ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:3">Mndewa Mulungu niijo zina jake.<verse eid="EXO 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 15:4" />“Matololi ya mfalume wa Misili na wakalizi wake kawasa muna ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:4">wakalizi wake wanogile kufosa wose, wadumbukila muna ibahali ya Shamu.<verse eid="EXO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 15:5" />Mazi mengi ya bahali yawagubika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:5">wadumbukila muna ibahali fana dibwe.<verse eid="EXO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 15:6" />Mndewa Mulungu, mkono wako wa kulume upata udahi mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:6">Mndewa Mulungu, mkono wako wa kulume uwahonda wehi.<verse eid="EXO 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 15:7" />Kwa ukulu wako kowagwisa hasi wehi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:7">ludoko lwako lokwaka na kuwalunguza fana mabuwa yanyalile.<verse eid="EXO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 15:8" />Kwa mhumuzi yako, mazi yaiduganya hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:8">mawimbi yema zugaga fana ng'huta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:8">Mazi mengi ya hagati ya bahali yananahila.<verse eid="EXO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 15:9" />Mwihi kalonga, ‘Nizawawinza na kuwagwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">nizagola utajili wawo na kusola vose vinilonda. Nizasomola ngugulila yangu, mkono wangu wizawadanganiza.’<verse eid="EXO 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 15:10" />Mbali kubuma kwa beho jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:10">Wamisili wagubikigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:10">wadumbukila muna yamazi mengi fana dibwe.<verse eid="EXO 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 15:11" />“Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">yelihi muna imilungu yalingile fana weye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">Yelihi yalingile fana weye uli mkulu ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">weye udumbiza kwa sang'hano za utunhizo?<verse eid="EXO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 15:12" />Kugolosa mkono wako wa kulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:12">na isi iwamela wehi wetu.<verse eid="EXO 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 15:13" />“Kwa ulondo wako wa kufunya umoyo, kuwalongoza wanhu wouwakombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:13">kwa udahi wako mkulu kuwalongoza mbaka hanhu helile houkala.<verse eid="EXO 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 15:14" />Wanhu wa isi wahulika yayo na kugudemeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:14">wanhu wokala Filisiti wengilwa na chinhu cha kudumbiza chiwagalile usungu.<verse eid="EXO 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 15:15" />Walangulizi wa Edomu wadumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:15">walangulizi wa Moabu wagudemeka kwa kudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:15">wanhu wose wokala Kanaani mizoyo yawo imong'honyoka.<verse eid="EXO 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 15:16" />Wapatigwa na lugano na ludumbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">Kwa ichimu cha ukulu wa nguvu zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">wanyamala hupi fana dibwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">Mbaka wanhu wako weye Mndewa Mulungu wafose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">mbaka vondawafose wanhu wako wouwakombole.<verse eid="EXO 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 15:17" />Kwizawengiza mgati na kuwemiza hana umulima wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:17">hanhu haja houhasagule weye Mndewa Mulungu hawe hanhu handaukale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:17">hanhu helile houhazengile weye Mndewa Mulungu kwa mkono wako,<verse eid="EXO 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 15:18" />Mndewa Mulungu niiyo mfalume siku zose.”<verse eid="EXO 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wila wa Miliamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 15:19" />Falasi wa mfalume wa Misili na mituka na wakwela falasi wake viwengile muna ibahali, Mndewa Mulungu kayabweleza mazi ya bahali na yawagubika. Mbali Waisilaili wagendelela kugenda hanhu hanyalile hagati ya bahali.<verse eid="EXO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 15:20" />Mulotezi Miliamu, lumbu jake Haluni, kasola chigoma mumkono, na wanaake wose wamsondelela, watowa chigoma na wavina. <verse eid="EXO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 15:21" />Miliamu kawembila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:21">“Mwimbileni Mndewa Mulungu yeli uchanyha ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:21">Kawasa muna ibahali falasi na wakwela falasi.”<verse eid="EXO 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mazi yeli usungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 15:22" />Maabaho Musa kawalongoza Waisilaili kulawa Bahali ya Shamu, wahita kuchuwala cha Shuli. Siku nhatu wagenda muna ichuwala bila kuyawona mazi. <verse eid="EXO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 15:23" />Viwafikile hanhu hatangigwe Mala, hawadahile kung'wa mazi ya uko kwaviya yakala usungu. Lekamana hanhu baho hatangigwa Mala. <verse eid="EXO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 15:24" />Wanhu walongelela kwa Musa, walonga, “Lelo chizakung'wa choni?” <verse eid="EXO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 15:25" />Maabaho Musa kamulilila Mndewa Mulungu, Mndewa Mulungu kamulagusila tambi da biki, Musa kadivabika muna yamazi, mazi yose yahola.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 15:25">Uko Mndewa Mulungu kaweng'ha Waisilaili malagilizo na ndagilizi muladi yawageze, <verse eid="EXO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 15:26" />kawalongela, “One muhaditegeleza vinogile dizi jangu niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu, na kutenda mbuli zinogile haulongozi wangu na kutegeleza ndagilizi na malagilizo yangu, niye sizamgalileni matamu yaja yoniwagalile Wamisili. Kwaviya niye iyo Mndewa Mulungu yonimuhonyani.”<verse eid="EXO 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 15:27" />Maabaho wafika Elimu, kokukalile na nzasa longo na mbili na mitende malongo saba. Uko weka mahema yawo habehi na mazi.<verse eid="EXO 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EXO 16" />
  <para style="s">Mana na ng'hwale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 16:1" />Maabaho Waisilaili wose wasegela kulawa Elimu na wahita kuna ichuwala cha Sini, chili hagati ya Elimu na Sinai, isiku ya longo na tano ya mwezi wekaidi, lusita viwasegele muna iisi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 16:2" />Kuja kuna ichuwala Waisilaili wose walongelela kwa Musa na Haluni, <verse eid="EXO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 16:3" />wanhu wa Isilaili wawalongela, “Muhavu Mndewa Mulungu yahachikomile vichikalile muna iisi ya Misili kochikalile chija nyama na magate mbaka chiguta. Mbali mweye muchigala kuno kuna ichuwala muladi muchikome chose na nzala.”<verse eid="EXO 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 16:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Nizamtonyelani mvula ya magate kulawa kuulanga. Chila siku wanhu wezalawa na kuduganya ndiya ya siku iyo. Kwa nzila ino nizawageza niwone fana wezasondelela ndagilizi zangu hebu hawezasondelela. <verse eid="EXO 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 16:5" />Siku ya sita vondawasasale ndiya yowaduganye, chiyasi icho chizakuwa miyanza midi ya ndiya ya chila siku.”<verse eid="EXO 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 16:6" />Musa na Haluni wawalongela Waisilaili wose, “Ichigulogulo mwizavimanya kuwa Mndewa Mulungu iyo yamulavileni muna iisi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 16:7" />Imitondo mwizawona ukulu wa Mndewa Mulungu, kwaviya kahulika vimulongelela kumwake. Vino cheye china nani mbaka mudahe kulongelela kumwetu?” <verse eid="EXO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 16:8" />Maabaho Musa kawalongela, “Ichigulogulo Mndewa Mulungu kezamwing'hani nyama muje, imitondo kezamwing'hani magate muje mwigute, kwaviya kahulika kulongelela kwenu. Vino cheye china nani mbaka mulongelele kumwetu? Hamulongelele kumwetu mbali mulongelela kwa Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="EXO 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 16:9" />Maabaho Musa kamulongela Haluni, “Walongele wanhu wose wa Isilaili wahite na kwima haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu, kwaviya kahulika kulongelela kwenu.” <verse eid="EXO 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 16:10" />Haluni viyakalile kolonga na Waisilaili wose, walola kuichuwala, bung'hulo da Mndewa Mulungu dilawilila muna diwingu. <verse eid="EXO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 16:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 16:12" />“Nihulika Waisilaili viwolongelela. Walongele, ‘Nguku zikwingila wezakuja nyama na imitondo wezakuja magate. Baho mwizavimanya kuwa niye iyo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 16:13" />Ichigulogulo diza bumbila da ng'hwale na wadigubika dilago da Waisilaili, imitondo nhungwe izunguluka lago jose. <verse eid="EXO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 16:14" />Nhungwe viimalile, kuna ichuwala kuwa na chinhu chilingile fana gate sisili. <verse eid="EXO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 16:15" />Waisilaili viwawone chinhu icho waiuza, “Chino choni?” Kwaviya hawavimanyile chikala choni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 16:15">Musa kawalongela, “Dino ijo gate doyamwing'hileni Mndewa Mulungu muje. <verse eid="EXO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 16:16" />Chino icho chiyalagilize Mndewa Mulungu, ‘Chila munhu yaduganye ndiya kwa kaye yake viyodaha kuja. Yamdondolele mhishi imwe yoimfaya chila munhu yeli muna ikaye yake.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 16:17" />Waisilaili watenda fana viwalongeligwe, wamwenga waduganya nyingi na wamwenga chidogo. <verse eid="EXO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 16:18" />Na viwapimile mhishi ziwaduganye, munhu yaduganye ndiya nyingi hapatile nyingi ng'hani, munhu yaduganye chidogo hapatile chidogo ng'hani. Chila munhu kaduganya ndiya yoimfaya. <verse eid="EXO 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 16:19" />Maabaho Musa kawalongela, “Munhu yoyose sekeyasigaze ndiya iyo mbaka imitondo.” <verse eid="EXO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 16:20" />Mbali wawo hawamtegeleze Musa, ivo wasigaza ndiya mbaka imitondo. Mbali imitondo ndiya iyo iwola, ilava mavunyo na inung'ha vundo. Ivo Musa kawawonela ludoko ng'hani. <verse eid="EXO 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 16:21" />Chila imitondo wanhu woduganya ndiya yoimfaya kuja. Zuwa vidikwelile na kukalika, ndiya isigale hamgwazo ya nzila ilumbuzuka.<verse eid="EXO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 16:22" />Siku yesita Waisilaili waduganya ndiya iyo miyanza midi kufosa mwanduso, chila munhu mhishi mbili. Ivo walangulizi wose wa Waisilaili wamuhitila Musa na wamulongela mbuli izo. <verse eid="EXO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 16:23" />Musa kawalongela, “Vino niivo viyalagilize Mndewa Mulungu, ‘Igolo ni siku ya kuhumula, Siku ya Mhumulo yelile ya Mndewa Mulungu. Ivo hiteni mukambike hebu mukakimuse ndiya yomulonda diyelo, ndiya yondaisigale ikeni mbaka igolo.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 16:24" />Ivo weka goya indiya mbaka imitondo fana Musa viyawalongele, nayo haiwolile na hailavile mavunyo hebu hainung'hile vundo. <verse eid="EXO 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 16:25" />Musa kawalongela, “Diyeni ndiya ino diyelo, kwaviya diyelo Siku ya Mhumulo ya Mndewa Mulungu. Diyelo hamwizafika ndiya yoyose kunze ya lago. <verse eid="EXO 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 16:26" />Mwizaduganya ndiya kwa siku sita, mbali siku yesaba, Siku ya Mhumulo, hakwizakuwa na chinhu chochose.”<verse eid="EXO 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 16:27" />Siku yesaba wanhu wamwenga wahita kudondola ndiya, mbali hawafikile chinhu. <verse eid="EXO 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 16:28" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamuuza Musa, “Mwizalema kwamha malagilizo yangu na ndagilizi zangu mbaka zuwaki? <verse eid="EXO 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 16:29" />Kumbukeni kuwa Mndewa Mulungu kamwing'hani Siku ya Mhumulo, lekamana siku yesita komwing'hani magate kwa siku mbili. Siku yesaba, chila munhu nayakale hanhu hayeli. Munhu yoyose sekeyalawe kunze siku yesaba.” <verse eid="EXO 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 16:30" />Ivo siku yesaba wanhu wahumula.<verse eid="EXO 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 16:31" />Waisilaili waitanga ndiya iyo “Mana.” Ikala fana uhemba mzelu na mumulomo ilinga fana gate sisili digumigwe uki. <verse eid="EXO 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 16:32" />Musa kawalongela, “Vino ivo viyalagilize Mndewa Mulungu, ‘Soleni lita mbili za mana na mwiike kwa ichimu cha nyelesi zikwiza, muladi wawone ndiya yonimulisileni kuna ichuwala chipindi chinimulavileni muna iisi ya Misili.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 16:33" />Musa kamulongela Haluni, “Sola nongo ukagume lita mbili za mana, wiike haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu ikalizigwe kuwa ukalangama kwa nyelesi zikwiza.” <verse eid="EXO 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 16:34" />Fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa, Haluni keka mana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fambulo da zina dino “mana” dikala “chini ni choni?”</char></note> haulongozi ha vibawo va mabwe va ukalangama, muladi ikigwe goya. <verse eid="EXO 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 16:35" />Waisilaili waja mana kwa miyaka malongo mane, mbaka viwafikile muna iisi inogile, isi ili muna imhaka ya Kanaani. <verse eid="EXO 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 16:36" />Mhamba ya mana lita mbili ikala chinhu chimwe muna ichila vinhu longo, ningo iyo izoweleke yoitangigwa efa.<verse eid="EXO 16:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EXO 17" />
  <para style="s">Mazi kulawa muna uluwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 17:1" />Wanhu wose wa Isilaili walawa muna ichuwala cha Sini, wandusa mwanza kulawa hanhu hamwe kuhita hamwenga fana viya Mndewa Mulungu viyawalagilize. Wazenga lago uko Lefidimu, mbali hakukalile na mazi ya kung'wa. <verse eid="EXO 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 17:2" />Walongelela kwa Musa, walonga, “Ching'he mazi ya kung'wa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 17:2">Musa kawedika, “Habali molongelela kumwangu? Habali momgeza Mndewa Mulungu?”<verse eid="EXO 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 17:3" />Mbali wanhu wakala na ng'hilu ng'hani, walongelela kwa Musa, walonga, “Habali kuchilava kuna iisi ya Misili uchikome na ng'hilu cheye na wanetu na wanyama wetu?”<verse eid="EXO 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 17:4" />Musa kamulilila Mndewa Mulungu, kalonga, “Niwatendele choni wanhu wano? Habehi wezanitowa na mabwe.”<verse eid="EXO 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 17:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Fosa kuulongozi wa wanhu wano na uwasole walala wawo wamwenga. Iviya usole mhome ija youitowele lwanda lwa Naili na uhite. <verse eid="EXO 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 17:6" />Lola, nizakwima haulongozi wako muna uluwe uko Holebu. Utowe luwe ulo, mazi ya kung'wa wanhu yezalawa muna uluwe.” Musa katenda ivo haulongozi ha walala wa Isilaili.<verse eid="EXO 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 17:7" />Musa kahatanga hanhu baho Masa na Meliba, kwaviya Waisilaili walongelela na kumgeza Mndewa Mulungu, walonga, “Vino kweli Mndewa Mulungu kahamwe na cheye?”<verse eid="EXO 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'hondo na Waamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 17:8" />Waamaleki weza na kuitowa na Waisilaili uko Lefidimu. <verse eid="EXO 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 17:9" />Musa kamulongela Yoshua, “Sagula walume uhite ukaitowe na Waamaleki. Igolo nizakwima kuinhembeti ya mulima, noyamhilila mhome ija ya Mulungu muna umkono wangu.”<verse eid="EXO 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 17:10" />Ivo Yoshua kawatowa Waamaleki fana viya Musa viyamulagilize. Musa na Haluni na Huli wahita kuinhembeti ya mulima. <verse eid="EXO 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 17:11" />Chila Musa viyokwinula makono yake kuchanyha, Waisilaili wakala wohuma, viyohumulusa makono yake, Waamaleki wakala wohuma. <verse eid="EXO 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 17:12" />Mbali hamwande makono ya Musa yalegela. Ivo Haluni na Huli wasola dibwe na wadika habehi na Musa, nayo kakala. Maabaho wayamha na kwinula makono yake, imwe kenula mkono wa kulume na imwenga mkono wa kumoso. Ivo makono ya Musa yagendelela kugangamala kuno yenuligwa uchanyha mbaka zuwa vidiswile. <verse eid="EXO 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 17:13" />Ivo Yoshua kawahuma Waamaleki kwa upanga.<verse eid="EXO 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 17:14" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Yandika mbuli ino muna ichitabu, maabaho igong'onde muna yamagutwi ya Yoshua iwe lukumbuso kwaviya nizawasegeza Waamaleki wose muna iisi yose.” <verse eid="EXO 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 17:15" />Musa kazenga lupango na kalutanga, “Mndewa Mulungu kanitenda nihume.” <verse eid="EXO 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 17:16" />Kalonga, “Mana makono yenuligwa uchanyha kuna ichigoda cha chifalume cha Mndewa Mulungu. Mndewa Mulungu kezakuwa na ng'hondo na Waamaleki siku zose.”<verse eid="EXO 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EXO 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesilo komulaula Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 18:1" />Yesilo mkulu wa nhambiko wa Midiani yeli mkoi wa Musa, kahulika chila chinhu Mndewa Mulungu chiyamtendele Musa na Waisilaili, na viya viyawalavile kuna iisi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 18:2" />Ivo Yesilo keza kwa Musa, kamgala Sipola muke wa Musa, Musa iyamulekile kuchisogo, <verse eid="EXO 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 18:3" />hamwe na wana waidi wa chilume wa Musa. Mwana wa mwanduso katangigwa Gelishomu. Musa kamtanga zina dino kwaviya kalonga, “Niye nikala nyambenyambe muna iisi ya ugeni.” <verse eid="EXO 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 18:4" />Wekaidi katangigwa Eliezeli, kwaviya kalonga, “Mulungu wa tati yangu kanitaza na kanikombola kulawa muna upanga wa mfalume wa Misili.” <verse eid="EXO 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 18:5" />Yesilo mkoi wa Musa, hamwe na muke wa Musa na wanage, weza kwa Musa kuna ichuwala koyekile lago habehi na mulima wa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 18:6" />Yesilo katuma usenga kwa Musa kalonga, “Niye Yesilo mkoi wako, nokwiza na muke wako na wanage waidi.” <verse eid="EXO 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 18:7" />Musa kalawa kunze kumuhokela Yesilo, kamtumbalila mavindi na kamnonela. Waiuzagiza mbuli za uhonyaji, maabaho wengila muna dilago da Musa. <verse eid="EXO 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 18:8" />Musa kamulongela mkoi wake chila chinhu Mndewa Mulungu chiyamtendele mfalume wa Misili kwa ichimu cha Waisilaili na kusonhela mbuli ndala zose ziwapatile mnzila na viya Mndewa Mulungu viyawakombole. <verse eid="EXO 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 18:9" />Yesilo kadeng'helela viyahulike mbuli zose zinogile Mndewa Mulungu ziyawatendele Waisilaili kwa ichimu cha kuwakombola muna yamakono ya Wamisili. <verse eid="EXO 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 18:10" />Na kamulongela, “Mtogoze Mndewa Mulungu, yoyawakomboleni kulawa kwa mfalume wa Misili na Wamisili! Yatogozigwe Mndewa Mulungu, yoyawagombole wanhu wake kulawa kuutumwa! <verse eid="EXO 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 18:11" />Lelo nivimanya kuwa Mndewa Mulungu mkulu kufosa milungu yose, kwaviya kawakombola wanhu wano muna yamakono ya Wamisili wowawatendele magoda.” <verse eid="EXO 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 18:12" />Maabaho Yesilo mkoi wa Musa kamulavila Mndewa Mulungu nhambiko za kutimbuligwa na nhambiko. Haluni keza na walala wa Isilaili muladi waje ndiya hamwe na Yesilo haulongozi ha Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 18:13" />Igolo yake Musa kakala kowahumiza Waisilaili, nawo wema kuno wamzunguluka kulawa imitondo mbaka ichigulogulo. <verse eid="EXO 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 18:14" />Yesilo mkoi wa Musa viyawonile mbuli zose Musa ziyawatendele Waisilaili, kamuuza, “Chino choni chouwatendela wanhu? Habali kolamula nhaguso wiidumwe kuno wanhu wano wose wakuzunguluka kulawa imitondo mbaka ichigulogulo?”<verse eid="EXO 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 18:15" />Musa kamwidika, “Kwaviya wanhu wokwiza kumwangu kuuza viyolonda Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 18:16" />Wanhu wahagomba wokwiza kumwangu na niye nowahumiza na kuwalongela malagilizo na ndagilizi za Mulungu.”<verse eid="EXO 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 18:17" />Maabaho Yesilo kamulongela Musa, “Viusang'hana havinogile. <verse eid="EXO 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 18:18" />Weye na wanhu wano mwizalegela, kwaviya sang'hano ino ndala. Hudaha kuisang'hana wiidumwe. <verse eid="EXO 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 18:19" />Lelo nitegeleze niye na nizakulongela vinigesa, Mulungu yawe hamwe na weye. Weye kwizahita haulongozi ha Mulungu kwa ichimu cha wanhu na kumgalila magayo yawo. <verse eid="EXO 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 18:20" />Kolondeka uwafundize malagilizo na ndagilizi za Mulungu na kuwalagusa viya viwolondeka kukala na kusang'hana usang'hano. <verse eid="EXO 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 18:21" />Mbali kwa mbuli zimwenga sagula walume weli na udahi mwa iwanhu wose. Wanhu womdumba Mulungu na wanhu goya na hawalonda kusola chochose muladi kubena malagilizo, weng'he usang'hano wa kuwemiliza wanhu muna yamabumbila ya wanhu elufu na mabumbila ya wanhu gana na mabumbila ya wanhu malongo matano na mabumbila ya wanhu longo. <verse eid="EXO 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 18:22" />Wawo wezakuwa na malundo chila siku kuhumiza mbuli za wanhu. Mbuli ndala wezakugalila weye, mbali mbuli ndodondodo wezazilamula wenyewo. Kwa nzila iyo kwizadaha kuitenda sang'hano yako ihuhe, kwaviya wanhu wezailumba na weye muna isang'hano iyo. <verse eid="EXO 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 18:23" />Uhatenda ivo na ihawa niivo viyolonda Mulungu, kodaha kufunya umoyo, wanhu wano wose wezadaha kubwela kumwawo kwa tindiwalo.”<verse eid="EXO 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 18:24" />Musa kamtegeleza mkoi wake na katenda fana viyamulongele. <verse eid="EXO 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 18:25" />Musa kasagula walume weli na udahi mwa Waisilaili, kawatenda kuwa walangulizi wa mabumbila ya wanhu elufu na mabumbila ya wanhu gana na mabumbila ya wanhu malongo matano na mabumbila ya wanhu longo. <verse eid="EXO 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 18:26" />Wasang'hana fana wasemi wa wanhu lusita lose. Mbuli zizamile wamgalila Musa, mbali mbuli ndodondodo wazikomeleza wawo wenyewo. <verse eid="EXO 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 18:27" />Maabaho Musa na Yesilo mkoi wake wailaga, nayo Yesilo kabwela kuna iisi yake.<verse eid="EXO 18:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EXO 19" />
  <para style="s">Waisilaili kuna mulima wa Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 19:1" />Siku ya mwanduso ya mwezi wetatu Waisilaili viwalawile muna iisi ya Misili, wafika kuna ichuwala cha Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 19:2" />Viwasegele Lefidimu na kufika kuichuwala cha Sinai, Waisilaili wazenga lago haulongozi wa mulima wa Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 19:3" />Maabaho Musa kakwela kumulima kwa Mulungu. Mndewa Mulungu kamtanga Musa kulawa kuna mulima, kamulongela, “Walongele vino welesi wa Yakobo na Waisilaili. <verse eid="EXO 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 19:4" />‘Mweye wenyewo muwona viniwatendile Wamisili na viya vinimsolileni fana masumula viyosola wanage kwa mabawa yake, nimgalani kumwangu. <verse eid="EXO 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 19:5" />Lelo, one mwahanitegeleza na kudika goya lagano jangu, mwizakuwa wanhu wangu mwa makabila yose, kwaviya isi yose yangu. <verse eid="EXO 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 19:6" />Mweye kumwangu mwizakuwa ufalume wa wakulu wa nhambiko na wanhu welile.’ Izo niizo mbuli zondauwalongele Waisilaili.”<verse eid="EXO 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 19:7" />Ivo Musa kahumuluka na kawatanga hamwe walala wa Waisilaili, kawalongela chila chinhu Mndewa Mulungu chiyamulagilize. <verse eid="EXO 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 19:8" />Maabaho wanhu wose wedika hamwe, walonga, “Chizatenda chila chinhu chiyalongile Mndewa Mulungu.” Ivo Musa kamulongela Mndewa Mulungu chiwalongile wanhu wawo.<verse eid="EXO 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 19:9" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Nizakwiza muna diwingu dizamile, muladi wanhu wahulike vinilonga na weye na wahuwile siku zose.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 19:9">“Musa kamulongela Mndewa Mulungu chiwalongile wanhu wawo.” <verse eid="EXO 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 19:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Hita kwa wanhu ukawalongele waisafye diyelo na igolo. Wolondeka wayasunhe mawalo yawo <verse eid="EXO 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 19:11" />na waisasale kwa chisindo, kwaviya siku iyo yetatu niye Mndewa Mulungu nizahumuluka kulawa uchanyha ya mulima wa Sinai haulongozi ha wanhu wose. <verse eid="EXO 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 19:12" />Wekile mhaka wanhu kuzunguluka mulima. Walongele, ‘Muiteganye sekemukwele kumulima hebu kubojoga mhaka yake. Munhu yoyose yondayaudalise mulima kezadanganika.’ <verse eid="EXO 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 19:13" />Munhu yoyose yondayadalise mulima, kolondeka yatowigwe na mabwe hebu msale, munhu hebu mnyama, kezadanganika. Mbali mhalati vondailile, wanhu wezakwela kumulima.”<verse eid="EXO 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 19:14" />Musa viyahumuluke kuna mulima, kawahitila wanhu na kawasafya, nawo wayasunha mawalo yawo. <verse eid="EXO 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 19:15" />Maabaho Musa kawalongela wanhu, “Muisasale kwa chisindo, mulume yoyose sekeyambandame muke wake.”<verse eid="EXO 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 19:16" />Siku yetatu imitondo uchanyha ya mulima kulawilila mibumo na mimwemwe na wingu dizamile. Iviya dihulikika dizi da mhalati dodiwagudemeze wanhu wose wa kuna dilago. <verse eid="EXO 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 19:17" />Maabaho Musa kawalava wanhu muna dilago na kawagala wakaiting'hane na Mulungu, wema hasi ya mulima. <verse eid="EXO 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 19:18" />Mulima wa Sinai wakala wogubikigwa na yosi, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kahulumuka muna umoto. Yosi dikwela uchanyha fana yosi da tanuli, mulima wose wagudemeka ng'hani. <verse eid="EXO 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 19:19" />Dizi da mhalati digendelela kulanduka. Musa kalonga na Mulungu, Mulungu nayo kamwidika muna umbumo. <verse eid="EXO 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 19:20" />Mndewa Mulungu kahumuluka kuinhembeti ya mulima wa Sinai na kamtanga Musa kuna inhembeti. Ivo Musa kakwela kuna inhembeti ya mulima. <verse eid="EXO 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 19:21" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Humuluka hasi ukawazume wanhu wose sekeweze kunilola, buleivo wezadanganika. <verse eid="EXO 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 19:22" />Hata wakulu wa nhambiko wonikwenhukila, wolondeka waisafye, buleivo niye Mndewa Mulungu nizawatagusa.” <verse eid="EXO 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 19:23" />Musa kamulongela Mndewa Mulungu, “Wanhu hawadaha kukwela mulima wa Sinai kwaviya kuchizuma weye mwenyewo chike mhaka kuzunguluka mulima na kuutenda wele.”<verse eid="EXO 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 19:24" />Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika, “Humuluka hasi ukamsole Haluni wize nayo. Mbali wakulu wa nhambiko na wanhu wamwenga sekewaloke imhaka na kwiza kumwangu, buleivo nizawatagusa.” <verse eid="EXO 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 19:25" />Ivo Musa kahumuluka kwa wanhu na kawalongela mbuli ziyalagilizigwe na Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EXO 20" />
  <para style="s">Ndagilizi longo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 20:1" />Mulungu kalonga mbuli zino zose, kalonga, <verse eid="EXO 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 20:2" />“Niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako yonikulavile kuna iisi ya Misili, koukalile mtumwa.<verse eid="EXO 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 20:3" />“Sekeutambikile milungu imwenga ila niye.<verse eid="EXO 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 20:4" />“Sekeuitendele nyang'hiti ya chinhu chochose chilingile fana chinhu cha kuulanga hebu chili muna iisi hebu chili muna yamazi. <verse eid="EXO 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 20:5" />Sekeuitumbalile mavindi na kuisang'hanila, kwaviya niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako, ni Mulungu nili na migongo. Nowatagusa wana kwa uhasanyi wa tati zawo, kwa nyelesi yetatu na yekane ya waja wonihila. <verse eid="EXO 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 20:6" />Mbali nowalonda kwa kufunya umoyo kwa nyelesi maelufu kwa waja wonilonda niye na kutegeleza ndagilizi zangu.<verse eid="EXO 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 20:7" />“Sekeudisang'hanile chakachaka zina da Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako, kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kezamtagusa chila munhu yodisang'hanila chakachaka zina jake.<verse eid="EXO 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 20:8" />“Izindilile Siku ya Mhumulo kwa kuitenda yele, mana ni siku ya chiidumwe. <verse eid="EXO 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 20:9" />Siku sita sang'hana usang'hano na utende mbuli zako zose. <verse eid="EXO 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 20:10" />Mbali siku yesaba niiyo Siku ya Mhumulo ya Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako. Siku iyo sekeusang'hane usang'hano wowose, weye hebu mwanago wa chilume hebu mwanago wa chike, hebu wasang'hani wako wa chike hebu wasang'hani wako wa chilume, mnyama wako wa kufugigwa hebu nyambenyambe yeli muna ikaye yako. <verse eid="EXO 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 20:11" />Kwaviya kwa siku sita, niye Mndewa Mulungu nilumba ulanga na isi yose na bahali na vinhu vose vili umo, maabaho siku yesaba nihumula. Ivo niye Mndewa Mulungu niitemela mate siku yesaba na niitenda yele.<verse eid="EXO 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 20:12" />“Wategeleze tati yako na mami yako, muladi ukale siku nyingi muna iisi ija inikwing'ha niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako.<verse eid="EXO 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 20:13" />“Sekeukome giladi.<verse eid="EXO 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 20:14" />“Sekeuibandame na mulume hebu muke wa munhu imwenga.<verse eid="EXO 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 20:15" />“Sekeubawe.<verse eid="EXO 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 20:16" />“Sekeumulongeleze mkaya miyago kwa mbuli za uvwizi.<verse eid="EXO 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 20:17" />“Sekeuimelele mate kaye ya munhu imwenga, sekeumelele mate muke wa miyago hebu msang'hani wake wa chike hebu msang'hani wake wa chilume hebu ng'ombe wake hebu chihongwe wake hebu chinhu chochose chiyeli nacho miyago.”<verse eid="EXO 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 20:18" />“Wanhu viwahulike mibumo na dizi da mhalati na kuwona ng'huwa na yosi kuna mulima, wagudemeka kwa kudumba na wema kutali.” <verse eid="EXO 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 20:19" />Wamulongela Musa, “Longa na cheye weye mwenyewo, chizakutegeleza. Mbali Mulungu sekeyalonge na cheye, buleivo chizadanganika.”<verse eid="EXO 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 20:20" />Musa kawalongela, “Sekemudumbe, Mulungu keza kumgezani muladi kumtendani mumdumbe na sekemutende uhasanyi.”<verse eid="EXO 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 20:21" />Lusita Musa viyawile habehi na wingu diya dizamile moyakalile Mulungu, wanhu wose wema kutali.<verse eid="EXO 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagilizo kusonhela lupango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 20:22" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa yawalongele Waisilaili, “Muwona mweye wenyewo kuwa nilonga na mweye kulawa kuulanga. <verse eid="EXO 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 20:23" />Sekemuitendele vinhu va hela vilingile fana Mulungu viwe hamwe na niye, sekemuitendele milungu ya zahabu hebu shaba. <verse eid="EXO 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 20:24" />Munhendele lupango lwa ulongo na mulave nhambiko zenu za wanyama, fana viya nhambiko ya kugala tindiwalo na nhambiko ya kutimbula. Chila hanhu hondaniwakumbuse wanhu zina jangu, nizamwizilani na kumtemelani mate. <verse eid="EXO 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 20:25" />One mwahazenga lupango lwa mabwe, sekemuzengele mabwe yasongoligwe, kwaviya lusita londamusang'hanile mabwe yasongoke, uhasang'hanila chia chako kusongolela, kwizakuwa kwambula mwiko. <verse eid="EXO 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 20:26" />Wala sekemutende lupango uli na vidando va kukwelela, muladi munhu yokwela uchanyha yake sekeyakale mwazi.”<verse eid="EXO 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EXO 21" />
  <para style="s">Malagilizo kusonhela watumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 21:1" />“Weng'he Waisilaili ndagilizi zino. <verse eid="EXO 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 21:2" />One uhamgula mtumwa wa Chiebulaniya, kezakusang'hanila kwa miyaka sita. Mbali mwaka wesaba kezakuwa kailegeha na kusegela bila kuliha chochose. <verse eid="EXO 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 21:3" />One kaguligwa yahawa hanasola muke, kezasegela yaidumwe. Mbali one keza na muke wake, kezasegela na muke wake. <verse eid="EXO 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 21:4" />Mwenevale wake yahamwing'ha muke na imuke yahamwelekela mwana wa chilume hebu wa chike, basi imuke na iwana wezakuwa wa mwenevale, msang'hani iyo kezasegela yaidumwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 21:5" />Mbali mtumwa yahalonga, ‘Nomulonda mwenevale wangu na muke wangu na wanangu, silonda kuilegeha.’ <verse eid="EXO 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 21:6" />Maabaho mwenevale wake kezamgala mtumwa iyo haulongozi wa Mulungu. Kezamsola na kumgala hana ulwivi hebu chizingiti na kumtobola digutwi kwa sanziya. Maabaho kezamsang'hanila mwenevale wake siku zose.<verse eid="EXO 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 21:7" />“One munhu yahamchuuza mwanage wa chike kuwa mtumwa, iyo hezatendigwa yailegehe fana viili kwa mtumwa wa chilume. <verse eid="EXO 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 21:8" />One mwenevale wake kamgula yawe imwe wa watumwa wake wa chike mbali hanogelwe nayo, basi mwenevale kezamuleka munhu imwenga yoyose yamkombole. Mwenevale iyo kabule haki ya kumchuuza kuna izisi zimwenga, kwaviya kabena lagano na mtumwa ija. <verse eid="EXO 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 21:9" />One yahalonda kumzengeza mtumwa ija kwa mwanage wa chilume, kezamtendela mtumwa iyo fana mndele wake. <verse eid="EXO 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 21:10" />One yahasola muke imwenga, kolondeka yagendelele kumwing'ha muke wake wa mwanduso ndiya imfaya na viwalo na kwiibandama nayo. <verse eid="EXO 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 21:11" />One yahapotwa kumtendela vinhu vino vitatu, muke kosegela kwa kuilegeha bila kuliha chochose.<verse eid="EXO 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagilizo kusonhela usede</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 21:12" />“Munhu yoyose yomtowa miyage na kumkoma, kolondeka yakomigwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 21:13" />Mbali one hamulungile kumkoma ila Mulungu kaleka ilawilile ivo, basi mkomaji iyo kodaha kukimbilila hanhu hondaniwasagulileni. <verse eid="EXO 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 21:14" />Mbali munhu yahamkoma miyage giladi, hata one yahakimbilila hana ulupango lwa kuigombela, msegezeni na mumkome.<verse eid="EXO 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 21:15" />“Munhu yoyose yomtowa tati yake hebu mami yake kolondeka yakomigwe.<verse eid="EXO 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 21:16" />“Munhu yoyose yombawa miyage muladi yakamchuuze hebu kumtenda yawe mtumwa wake, kolondeka yakomigwe.<verse eid="EXO 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 21:17" />“Munhu yoyose yomduwila tati yake hebu mami yake kolondeka yakomigwe.<verse eid="EXO 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 21:18" />“Wanhu waidi wahagomba, maabaho imwenga kamtowa miyage na dibwe hebu ng'honde bila kumkoma, mbali kamulumiza na kumtenda yaugule na kutambalala muna dikomwa, <verse eid="EXO 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 21:19" />one munhu iyo yatowigwe kezapata muhavu na kudaha kugendela mhome, iyo yamulumize kezalekelelwa. Mbali kezamuliha kwa lusita loyagize viyakalile muna dikomwa na kolondeka yamuuguze mbaka yahone.<verse eid="EXO 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 21:20" />“Munhu yahamtowa na balati mtumwa wake wa chilume hebu wa chike na kumkoma baho baho, kolondeka yatagusigwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 21:21" />Mbali mtumwa iyo yahasigala mgima siku dimwe hebu mbili, mwenevale wake hezatagusigwa kwaviya kagiza hela yake iyamgulile.<verse eid="EXO 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 21:22" />“One walume wahaitowa na kumulumiza mwanamke yeli na wimo, mbaka kavumbula siku siyo zake, munhu ija yamulumize kezaliha fana vondayalonde mulume wa mwanamke iyo na fana wasemi vondawalamule. <verse eid="EXO 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 21:23" />Mbali one kuhalawilila mbuli ihile, kezatagusigwa ugima kwa ugima, <verse eid="EXO 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 21:24" />ziso kwa ziso, zino kwa zino, mkono kwa mkono, mgulu kwa mgulu, <verse eid="EXO 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 21:25" />kulungula kwa kulungula, chilonda kwa chilonda, kutowa kwa kutowa.<verse eid="EXO 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 21:26" />“One munhu yahamtowa muna diziso mtumwa wake wa chike hebu wa chilume na kudilava, kolondeka yamuleke yasegele kwa kuilegeha kwa ichimu cha ziso jake. <verse eid="EXO 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 21:27" />One yohamtowa na kumng'ola dizino mtumwa wake wa chilume hebu wa chike, kolondeka yamuleke yasegele kwa kuilegeha kwa ichimu cha zino jake.<verse eid="EXO 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 21:28" />“One ng'ombe yahamkenha mulume hebu muke na kumkoma, ng'ombe iyo kezakomigwa kwa kutowigwa na mabwe na nyama yake haizadigwa. Mwene ng'ombe iyo kezakuwa kabule mbuli. <verse eid="EXO 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 21:29" />Mbali one ng'ombe iyo kazowela kukenha mulume hebu muke na mwene ng'ombe kalongeligwa mbali hamfungile, ng'ombe iyo yahakoma mulume hebu muke kolondeka yatowigwe na mabwe, na mwene ng'ombe kolondeka yakomigwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 21:30" />Mbali munhu iyo yahalongigwa yalave yombe muladi kuulekelela ugima wake, kolondeka yalihe chima chiya chondayalongeligwe kulava. <verse eid="EXO 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 21:31" />One ng'ombe yahamkenha mbwanga hebu mndele, izahumizigwa ivo ivo. <verse eid="EXO 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 21:32" />One ng'ombe iyo yahamkenha mtumwa wa chilume hebu wa chike, mwene ng'ombe kezamuliha mwenevale wa mtumwa iyo kwa shekeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shekeli imwe ilinga fana gilamu longo na imwe na nusu.</char></note> malongo matatu ya hela, na ng'ombe iyo kolondeka yakomigwe kwa kutowigwa na mabwe.<verse eid="EXO 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 21:33" />“One munhu hadisilize kombo hebu yahahimba kombo na sekeyadigubike, maabaho ng'ombe hebu chihongwe kodumbukila umo, <verse eid="EXO 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 21:34" />mwene dikombo ijo kolondeka yamulihe hela mwene mnyama iyo, na mnyama iyo yafile kezakuwa wa mwene dikombo. <verse eid="EXO 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 21:35" />One ng'ombe wa munhu yahamulumiza ng'ombe wa munhu imwenga na kumkoma, wene ng'ombe wezamchuuza ng'ombe iyo imgima na kuigolela zihela, iviya wezaigolela ng'ombe yafile. <verse eid="EXO 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 21:36" />Mbali one ng'ombe kazowela kuwakenha wayage na mwene ng'ombe hamfungile, mwenyewo kezamuliha miyage ng'ombe mgima, ng'ombe yafile kezakuwa wake.<verse eid="EXO 21:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EXO 22" />
  <para style="s">Malagilizo kusonhela maliho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 22:1" />“Munhu yahabawa ng'ombe hebu ng'hondolo na kumchinja hebu kumchuuza, kolondeka yalihe ng'ombe watano kwa ng'ombe imwe na ng'hondolo wane kwa ng'hondolo imwe. <verse eid="EXO 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 22:2" />Mbavi yahafikigwa kobena kaye ichilo, yahatowigwa mbaka kudanganika, munhu yamkomile kabule ubananzi. <verse eid="EXO 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 22:3" />Mbali mbavi iyo yahagwiligwa uchile na kukomigwa, yamkomile kana ubananzi. Mbavi iyo kolondeka yabweleze chinhu, one kabule kolondeka yachuuzigwe muladi kuliha ubavi wake. <verse eid="EXO 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 22:4" />One mnyama yabawigwe yahapatika kwa mbavi iyo yang'hali mgima, basi mbavi iyo kezamuliha miyanza midi, yawe ng'ombe hebu chihongwe hebu ng'hondolo.<verse eid="EXO 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 22:5" />“Munhu yahawadima wanyama wake muna umgunda wa mizabibu na kumulekelela mnyama wake yaje muna umgunda wa munhu imwenga, kezaliha udanganyi uwo kwa ndiya inogile ya umgunda wake mwenyewo hebu mgunda wake wa mizabibu.<verse eid="EXO 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 22:6" />“One munhu yahakwacha moto, nawo uhasoma mibiki ya miwa na kwenela mbaka kusoma maguniya ya ndiya hebu ndiya za munhu imwenga zili hazinagoboligwa hebu mgunda wose wahaka, munhu ija yakwachile moto uwo kolondeka kuliha ubananzi uwo wose.<verse eid="EXO 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 22:7" />“One munhu yahamwing'ha miyage chinhu hebu hela yamwikile goya, maabaho ibawigwa ukaye yake, mbavi yahapatika kolondeka yalihe hela iyo miyanza midi. <verse eid="EXO 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 22:8" />Mbali mbavi one hapatike, mwene kaye kezahita haulongozi ha Mulungu muladi kulonga ukweli kuwa siyo yeye yabawile vinhu va miyage. <verse eid="EXO 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 22:9" />Kwahawa na kuiswela kwa ichimu cha ng'ombe hebu chihongwe, hebu chinhu chochose chagile, wanhu waidi wolonga ni chawo, wanhu watendile ivo wezagaligwa haulongozi wa Mulungu. Munhu ija Mulungu yondayalamule kuwa kabananga, kezamuliha miyage miyanza midi.<verse eid="EXO 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 22:10" />“Munhu yahamwing'ha miyage ng'ombe hebu ng'hondolo hebu chihongwe hebu mnyama imwenga yoyose yamulole goya na mnyama iyo yahafa hebu yahalumila hebu yahasoligwa bila munhu imwenga kumuwona, <verse eid="EXO 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 22:11" />chilaho haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu chizalamula hagati yawo kulagusa kuwa iyo yeng'higwe habawile vinhu va miyage. Mwene mnyama iyo kezatogola chilaho icho, na iyo miyage hezaliha chochose. <verse eid="EXO 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 22:12" />Mbali one ihamanyika kuwa mnyama kabawigwa kumwake, imunhu iyo kolondeka yamulihe mwene mnyama. <verse eid="EXO 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 22:13" />One kakomigwa na wanyama wa kumbago, munhu iyo kolondeka yamgale imnyama fana usindila, halondeka kuliha chochose kwa mnyama yakomigwe na wanyama wa kumbago.<verse eid="EXO 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 22:14" />“One munhu yahazima mnyama kwa miyage, maabaho mnyama iyo kalumila hebu kafa, lusita mwene mnyama kahabule, ija yazime kolondeka yamulihe mnyama fana ija. <verse eid="EXO 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 22:15" />Mbali one ilawilila mwene mnyama kabaho, yazime hezaliha chochose. One kakala yazimigwe kwa hela, hela izo zizafaya kwa kwaga kwa mnyama iyo.<verse eid="EXO 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagilizo ya kukala na wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 22:16" />“Munhu yahamvwizila mhambe yeli hanauzigwa na kambandama, kolondeka yamfungile zengele na kumsola yawe muke wake. <verse eid="EXO 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 22:17" />Tata wa mndele iyo yahalema ng'hani kumzengeza mwanage, munhu iyo kezaliha hela ya zengele yoilondeka kwa mndele yeli mhambe.<verse eid="EXO 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 22:18" />“Sekeumuleke mwanamke muhawi yawe mgima.<verse eid="EXO 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 22:19" />“Munhu yoyose yoibandama na mnyama kolondeka yakomigwe.<verse eid="EXO 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 22:20" />“Munhu yoyose yomulavila nhambiko mulungu imwenga badala ya Mndewa Mulungu muhala, kolondeka yakomigwe.<verse eid="EXO 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 22:21" />“Sekeumbamanye nyambenyambe hebu kumgaza, kwaviya na mweye iviya mukala nyambenyambe muna iisi ya Misili. <verse eid="EXO 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 22:22" />Sekeumgaze mgane yoyose hebu mwana mchiwa. <verse eid="EXO 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 22:23" />One uhawabamanya nawo wahanyululuka, ukweli nizahulika ndilo yawo. <verse eid="EXO 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 22:24" />Nizakuwa na ludoko ng'hani na nizamkomani na panga. Wake zenu wezakuwa wagane na wanenu wezakuwa wachiwa.<verse eid="EXO 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 22:25" />“Uhamwazima hela munhu yoyose mwa iwanhu wangu weli ngayengaye, sekeuwe fana mdai, iviya sekeulonde yakulihe limangwe. <verse eid="EXO 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 22:26" />One uhasola mgolole wa miyago na kuwika poni, kolondeka umbwelezele ding'hali zuwa hadinahonga. <verse eid="EXO 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 22:27" />Kwaviya mgolole wake wa kuigubika uwo muhala. Vino weye kogesa kezaigubika choni? Yahanililila nizamwidika kwaviya niye nina ubazi.<verse eid="EXO 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 22:28" />“Sekeumulige Mulungu na sekeumduwile mtawala wa wanhu wako.<verse eid="EXO 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 22:29" />“Sekeukalame kulava nhosa nyingi kulawa muna zindiya zako zoulimbula na divai zako zoulimbula. Mwizaning'ha wanenu waudele wa chilume. <verse eid="EXO 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 22:30" />Mwizatenda ivo kwa waudele wa ng'ombe na ng'hondolo wenu. Chila mwelekwa wa udele mwizamuleka na mami yake siku saba, siku yenane mwizaning'ha niye.<verse eid="EXO 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 22:31" />“Mweye mwizakuwa wanhu wangu wa chiidumwe. Ivo sekemuje nyama ya mnyama yakomigwe na mnyama wa kumbago. Nyama iyo mwizawasila zimbwa.<verse eid="EXO 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EXO 23" />
  <para style="s">Kuleka kubagula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 23:1" />“Sekeupwililise mbuli za uvwizi, na sekeumtaze munhu mbananzi kwa kulava ukalangama wa uvwizi. <verse eid="EXO 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 23:2" />Sekeusondelele bumbila da wanhu kutenda mbuli zihile, na sekewiilumbe na wanhu kulava ukalangama muna ichitala muladi kwagiza ukweli. <verse eid="EXO 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 23:3" />Sekeuwonele muna imbuli ya ngayengaye.<verse eid="EXO 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 23:4" />“Uhamfika ng'ombe hebu chihongwe wa mwihi wako kaga, mbwelezele mwenyewo. <verse eid="EXO 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 23:5" />One uhamuwona chihongwe wa munhu yokwihila kagwa na mbahasha yake, sekeuleke kumtaza.<verse eid="EXO 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 23:6" />“Sekeuyagize haki iyolondeka kupata ngayengaye muna imbuli yake. <verse eid="EXO 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 23:7" />Iteganye sekeumulongeleze munhu uvwizi na sekeumkome munhu yelibule ubananzi, kwaviya Mulungu hezawalekelela wanhu wabananzi. <verse eid="EXO 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 23:8" />Sekeuhokele chinhu cha kukutenda ubene malagilizo, kwaviya chinhu icho chowatula yameso wanhu weli na ubala na kuwagiza wanhu wanogile.<verse eid="EXO 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 23:9" />“Sekeumbamanye nyambenyambe, mweye muumanya unyambenyambe, kwaviya na mweye mukala nyambenyambe muna iisi ya Misili.<verse eid="EXO 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagilizo ya kusonhela Siku ya Mhumulo na dugila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 23:10" />“Kwa miyaka sita kwizahanda migunda yako na kwaha vinhu vihandigwe. <verse eid="EXO 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 23:11" />Mbali mwaka wesaba, kwizaleka migunda yako yose bila ya kuhanda mbeyu muladi ngayengaye weli mwa wanhu wako wapate ndiya isigale umo na wanyama wa kumbago waje. Kwizatenda ivo muna umgunda wako wa mizabibu na mizaituni.<verse eid="EXO 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 23:12" />“Kwa siku sita kwizasang'hana sang'hano zako, mbali siku yesaba uhumule, muladi ng'ombe wako na vihongwe wako iviya wahumule, na watumwa welekigwe muna ikaye yako na nyambenyambe wahumule.<verse eid="EXO 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 23:13" />“Tegeleza chila chinhu chonikulongela. Sekeuyatambule mazina ya milungu imwenga hata chidogo, mazina yayo sekeyahulikike muna umulomo wako.<verse eid="EXO 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Madugila matatu makulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 23:14" />“Miyanza mitatu chila mwaka mwizatenda madugila kwa hishima yangu. <verse eid="EXO 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 23:15" />Mwizagendelela kutenda Dugila da Magate Hayagumigwe Lusu fana vinimulagilizeni, mwizakuja magate hayagumigwe lusu kwa siku saba lusita lwikigwe muna umwezi wa Abibu, kwaviya muna umwezi uwo mulawa Misili. Munhu yoyose sekeyeze haulongozi wangu makono muhala. <verse eid="EXO 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 23:16" />Mwizagendelela kutenda Dugila da Vinhu va Mwanduso vimugobole muna imigunda yenu. Mwizatenda Dugila da Kuduganya Vinhu Vimugobole kuuhelelo wa mwaka vondamuduganye vinhu venu vimuhandile. <verse eid="EXO 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 23:17" />Miyanza mitatu kwa mwaka walume wose wezalawilila haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, Mndewa Mkulu.<verse eid="EXO 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 23:18" />“Sekeulave damu ya nhambiko yangu hamwe na magate yagumigwe lusu, na sekeuyaleke mavuta ya mnyama ya dugila jangu yasigale mbaka imitondo.<verse eid="EXO 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 23:19" />“Ndiya ya mwanduso ya isi yako kwizaigala kuna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:19">“Sekeumkimuse mwanaluti muna yamatombo ya mami yake.<verse eid="EXO 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Msenga wa Mulungu kosasala nzila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 23:20" />“Lola, nomtuma msenga wa kuulanga kuulongozi wenu muladi yamkalizeni mzila na kumgalani kuna iisi yoniisasale. <verse eid="EXO 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 23:21" />Mtegelezeni na kwamha choyolonga sekemumwehule, hezawalekelelani ubananzi wenu, kwaviya nahamwe nayo. <verse eid="EXO 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 23:22" />Mbali muhamtegeleza chiyolonga na kutenda mbuli zose zonimulongelani, nizakuwa mwihi wa wehi wenu na nizawalema wose womulemani mweye.<verse eid="EXO 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 23:23" />“Msenga wa kuulanga kezamulongolelani na kumgalani kuna iisi ya Waamoli na Wahiti na Wapelizi na Wakanaani na Wahivi na Wayebusi, nawo nizawadanganiza. <verse eid="EXO 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 23:24" />Sekemutumbale mavindi kuitambikila milungu yawo na kuisang'hanila iviya sekemuhige sang'hano zawo. Mwizawadanganiza na kuvibomola vibanda vawo. <verse eid="EXO 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 23:25" />Nisang'hanileni niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu, niye nizamtemelani mate kwa ndiya na mazi na kumsegezelani mitamu. <verse eid="EXO 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 23:26" />Hakwizakuwa na mwanamke yondayatengule hebu mgumba muna iisi yenu. Nizamtendani mukale siku nyingi ng'hani.<verse eid="EXO 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 23:27" />“Nizawadumbiza na kuwatibula wanhu wose womuitowa nawo, wehi wenu nizawatenda wahinduke na kukimbila. <verse eid="EXO 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 23:28" />Nizawawinga Wahivi na Wakanaani na Wahiti fana wanhu viwowingigwa na madondola. <verse eid="EXO 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 23:29" />Wanhu wawo sizawawinga muna umwaka umwe, kwaviya isi izasigala yabule chinhu na wanyama wa kumbago wezakongezeka ng'hani. <verse eid="EXO 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 23:30" />Mbali nizawasegeza chidogo chidogo mbaka vondamongezeke na kuitawala isi yose.<verse eid="EXO 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 23:31" />“Mhaka za isi yenu zizakwandusila bahali ya Shamu mbaka bahali ya Meditelaniya, na kwandusila kuchuwala mbaka lwanda lwa Efulate, kwaviya wakaya wa isi iyo nizawatenda muwahume, na mweye mwizawawinga wasegele kumwenu. <verse eid="EXO 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 23:32" />Sekemutende nawo lagano jojose hebu na milungu yawo. <verse eid="EXO 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 23:33" />Sekemuwaleke wakale muna iisi yenu, buleivo wezamtendani munihasanye, kwaviya muhaitambikila milungu yawo, kweli uwo kumwenu wizakuwa mtego wa kunamata.”<verse eid="EXO 23:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EXO 24" />
  <para style="s">Lagano dolagusigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 24:1" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Kweleni kumwangu, weye na Haluni na Nadabu na Abihu, hamwe na walala malongo saba wa Isilaili, munitumbalile mavindi kwa kutali. <verse eid="EXO 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 24:2" />Mbali weye Musa wiidumwe ukwenhuke habehi na Mndewa Mulungu, wayago sekewakwenhuke habehi. Wanhu sekeweze hamwe na weye.”<verse eid="EXO 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 24:3" />Musa kahita na kuwalongela wanhu mbuli zose za Mndewa Mulungu na ndagilizi zose, wanhu wose wedika kwa dizi dimwe, walonga, “Chizatenda chila chinhu chiyalongile Mndewa Mulungu.” <verse eid="EXO 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 24:4" />Musa kandika chila chinhu chiyalongile Mndewa Mulungu. Igolo yake kaidawa na kazenga ulupango hasi ya mulima na kasimika mhanda longo na mbili fana viili peta ya makabila longo na maidi ya Isilaili. <verse eid="EXO 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 24:5" />Maabaho kawatuma wabwanga wa Waisilaili wamulavile Mndewa Mulungu nhambiko za kutimbula na nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo za ng'ombe lume. <verse eid="EXO 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 24:6" />Musa kasola nusu ya damu ija na kaiguma muna yamahamha, nusu imwenga kaitila uchanyha ya ulupango. <verse eid="EXO 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 24:7" />Maabaho kasola chitabu cha lagano na kawasomela wanhu. Nawo wedika, “Chizatenda chila mbuli iyalongile Mndewa Mulungu izalawilila.” <verse eid="EXO 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 24:8" />Musa kasola damu ija na kawamizila wanhu, kalonga, “Ino iyo damu ya lagano da Mndewa Mulungu diyatendile na mweye kwa mbuli zino zose.” <verse eid="EXO 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 24:9" />Musa na Haluni na Nadabu na Abihu, hamwe na walala malongo saba wa Waisilaili wakwela kuna umulima <verse eid="EXO 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 24:10" />na wamuwona Mulungu wa Isilaili. Hasi ya migulu yake hakala na chinhu chilingile fana sakafu ya mabwe ya yakuti ya langi ya buluu fana ulanga. <verse eid="EXO 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 24:11" />Mbali Mulungu hawalumize walangulizi wawo wa Isilaili. Wamuwona Mulungu na waja na kung'wa.<verse eid="EXO 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kuna mulima wa Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 24:12" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Izo kumwangu kuchanyha ya mulima ukale kuno, nizakwing'ha vibawo vidi va mabwe vili na malagilizo na ndagilizi zonyandike kwa ichimu cha kuwafunza Waisilaili.”<verse eid="EXO 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 24:13" />Ivo Musa kasegela hamwe na Yoshua msang'hani wake, maabaho Musa kakwela kuna umulima wa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 24:14" />Musa kawalongela walala, “Chigozeleni hano mbaka vondachibwele. Haluni na Huli wezakuwa bahano na mweye, yoyose yondayawe na mbuli kodaha kuwahitila wawo.”<verse eid="EXO 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 24:15" />Musa kakwela kuna mulima, maabaho wingu digubika umulima. <verse eid="EXO 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 24:16" />Bung'hulo da Mndewa Mulungu dihumuluka kuna mulima wa Sinai. Wingu diugubika mulima kwa siku sita. Siku yesaba Mndewa Mulungu kamtanga Musa kulawa hagati ya diwingu. <verse eid="EXO 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 24:17" />Bung'hulo da Mndewa Mulungu kuwa fana moto woulunguza hachanyha ya mulima muna yameso ya wanhu wa Isilaili. <verse eid="EXO 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 24:18" />Musa kengila muna diwingu na kakwela kumulima. Kakala kumulima siku malongo mane imisi na ichilo.<verse eid="EXO 24:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EXO 25" />
  <para style="s">Nhambiko kwa ichimu cha hema da Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 25:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 25:2" />“Walongele Waisilaili wanilavile nhosa. Nihokelele nhosa zangu kulawa kwa munhu yoyose yolonda kuning'ha. <verse eid="EXO 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 25:3" />Zino niizo nhosa zondauzihokele kulawa kumwawo, zahabu na hela na shaba <verse eid="EXO 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 25:4" />na langi ya buluu na langi ya zambalau na langi ndung'hu na viwalo vinogile na mazoya ya luti <verse eid="EXO 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 25:5" />na mbende za mabebelu ya ng'hondolo zihakigwe langi ndung'hu, na mbende za wanyama wa mwiibahali na mibiki ya mkenge, <verse eid="EXO 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 25:6" />na mavuta ya chitasa cha hema da Mulungu, vilungo kwa mavuta yelile na ubani, <verse eid="EXO 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 25:7" />na mabwe yokwaka ya salidoniki na mabwe yokwaka yamwenga kwa ichimu cha mahambo, chifuko cha muna imhambaga na chizibawo cha mkulu wa nhambiko. <verse eid="EXO 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 25:8" />Leka wanhu wanizengele hanhu helile, muladi nidahe kukala hamwe nawo. <verse eid="EXO 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 25:9" />Zenga hema da Mulungu na vinhu vake vose kuilinga na viya vondanikulaguse.<verse eid="EXO 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sanduku da lagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 25:10" />
    <figure style="fig" file="OT-01 ArkoftheCovenant.JPG" size="col" ref="25:10">Sanduku da lagano</figure> “Nawo watende sanduku da mbiki wa mkenge, utali wake uwe sentimita gana na longo, ugalamu wake sentimita malongo sita na sita na chimo chake iwe sentimita malongo sita na sita. <verse eid="EXO 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 25:11" />Na weye udihake zahabu yelile mgati na kunze, uditendele lukingilo lwa zahabu banzi zose. <verse eid="EXO 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 25:12" />Maabaho utende mhete nne za zahabu na uzivaze muna imigulu yake mine, mhete mbili banzi imwe na banzi imwenga mhete mbili. <verse eid="EXO 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 25:13" />Iviya utende mibiki ya kupapila ya mkenge na uihake zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 25:14" />Ingiza mibiki iyo muna zimhete zili banzi mbili za sanduku, kwa ichimu cha kudipapa. <verse eid="EXO 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 25:15" />Mibiki iyo ya kupapila izasigala muna zimhete, sekeisegezigwe. <verse eid="EXO 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 25:16" />Muna disanduku ijo, kwizakwika vibawo va mabwe va ukalangama vondanikwing'he.<verse eid="EXO 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 25:17" />“Tenda ngubiko ya zahabu hanhu ha kuilumba, utali wake wizakuwa sentimita gana na longo na ugalamu wake sentimita malongo sita na sita. <verse eid="EXO 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 25:18" />Tenda vilumbe vidi va zahabu vovilingile fana wasenga wa kuulanga, tenda usang'hano wa kuhonda muna imihelelo ya ingubiko iyo. <verse eid="EXO 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 25:19" />Tenda vilumbe ivo vidi, chimwe uhelelo umwe na chimwenga uhelelo wekaidi, vitende vilumbe ivo vidi kuwa chinhu chimwe na ingubiko. <verse eid="EXO 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 25:20" />Vilumbe wawo wezailola, mabawa yawo yakunjuka kuigubika ingubiko, vihanga vawo vizailola ingubiko iyo. <verse eid="EXO 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 25:21" />Muna disanduku mwizakwika vibawo vidi va mabwe va ukalangama na kuika ngubiko iyo uchanyha yake. <verse eid="EXO 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 25:22" />Nizaiting'hana na weye baho, kulawa hachanyha ya ngubiko iyo, hagati ya vilumbe wawo waidi weli mchanyha ya sanduku da lagano, nizakwing'ha malagilizo yangu kwa ichimu cha wanhu wa Isilaili.<verse eid="EXO 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meza kwa ichimu cha magate ya nhosa ya Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 25:23" />“Songola meza ya mibiki ya mkenge ili na utali wa sentimita malongo manane na nane na ugalamu sentimita malongo mane na nne chimo sentimita malongo sita na sita. <verse eid="EXO 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 25:24" />Meza iyo kwizaihaka zahabu yelile na kuizungulusila lukingilo lwa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 25:25" />Maabaho kwizaizungulusila lukingilo lwili na ugalamu wa sentimita nane. <verse eid="EXO 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 25:26" />Kwizaitendela mhete nne za zahabu na kuzika kuna zimhembe zake muna imigulu yake. <verse eid="EXO 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 25:27" />Mhete izo zizakuwa habehi na lukingilo luja lwa kuzunguluka meza na zizakuwa za kwamhilila mibiki ya kupapila imeza iyo. <verse eid="EXO 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 25:28" />Tenda mibiki ya kupapila ya mkenge na kuihaka zahabu, mibiki iyo izakuwa ya kuipapila meza iyo. <verse eid="EXO 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 25:29" />Tengeneza vyano na nhungo na mabuyu na vihamha va kugidila. Tengeneza via ivo vose kwa zahabu yelile. <verse eid="EXO 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 25:30" />Chila siku ika magate yelile hana imeza haulongozi hangu.<verse eid="EXO 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chinala cha chitasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 25:31" />
    <figure style="fig" file="OT-05 Lampstand.jpg" size="col" ref="25:31">Chinala cha chitasa</figure> “Kwizatenda chinala cha chitasa kwa zahabu yelile. Itendigwe kwa kuhonda, kalilo jake na mbiki wake na nhungo zake na matumba yake na maluwa yake, vose vizatendigwa kwa chihande chimwe. <verse eid="EXO 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 25:32" />Matambi sita yezalawilila hana umbiki wa ichinala, matambi matatu ubanzi umwe na matambi matatu ubanzi umwenga. <verse eid="EXO 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 25:33" />Muna ditambi kuna nhungo nhatu zilingile fana matumba na maluwa yotangigwa alimondi, muna ditambi disondelela kuna tumba jake na luwa jake. Matambi yose sita yawe fana ivo. <verse eid="EXO 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 25:34" />Muna ichinala mwizakuwa na nhungo nne zozitendigwe zilingile fana maluwa yotangigwa alimondi, hamwe na ving'honyo va maluwa yake. <verse eid="EXO 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 25:35" />Hanhu hondahalawilile chila jozi ya matambi yaja sita, hasi yake hezakuwa na tumba dimwe dimwe. <verse eid="EXO 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 25:36" />Matumba yayo na matambi yake yezakuwa chinhu chimwe. Chinala icho chose chizahondigwa kwa zahabu yelile. <verse eid="EXO 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 25:37" />Iviya kwizatenda vitasa saba kwa ichimu cha chinala icho na kuvika uchanyha yake muladi vimwemwese kuulongozi. <verse eid="EXO 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 25:38" />Tengeneza makoleo yake na vyano vake kwa zahabu yelile. <verse eid="EXO 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 25:39" />Sang'hanila chilo malongo matatu na tano va zahabu yelile kutengeneza chinala cha chitasa na via vake vose. <verse eid="EXO 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 25:40" />Kolondeka uvitengeneze fana viya vinikulaguse kuja kuna mulima.<verse eid="EXO 25:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EXO 26" />
  <para style="s">Hema jelile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 36:8-38">Kulawa 36:8-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 26:1" />
    <figure style="fig" file="OT-07 Tabernacle.jpg" size="col" ref="26:1">Hema da Mulungu</figure> “Maabaho zenga hema da Mulungu kwa mapanzia longo ya mawalo yanogile yabotigwe kwa nyuzi za langi ya buluu na za zambalau na ndung'hu. Mapanzia yayo kwizayahamba kwa vilumbe walingile fana wasenga wa kuulanga wasongoligwe na fundi. <verse eid="EXO 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 26:2" />Chila panzia dizakuwa na utali wa mita longo na mbili na ugalamu mita mbili. <verse eid="EXO 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 26:3" />Kwizalumbiliza mapanzia matano yawe panzia dimwe, mapanzia yamwenga matano yawe panzia dekaidi. <verse eid="EXO 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 26:4" />Iviya kwizasonela vitanzi va buluu muna imhindo ya dipanzia da uhelelo da chihande cha mwanduso, iviya kwizashona vitanzi kuuhelelo wa mhindo ya kunze ya chihande chimwenga cha panzia. <verse eid="EXO 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 26:5" />Kwizagela vitanzi malongo matano muna dipanzia dimwe, vitanzi vimwenga malongo matano va panzia dekaidi, vitanzi vose viilole. <verse eid="EXO 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 26:6" />Maabaho kwizatengeneza vihindo malongo matano va zahabu muladi kulumbiliza viya vihande vidi va mapanzia, ivo hema da Mulungu dizakuwa dimwe.<verse eid="EXO 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 26:7" />“Iviya kwizatengeneza ngubiko imwenga ya hema da Mulungu kwa mapanzia longo na dimwe ya mazoya ya luti. <verse eid="EXO 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 26:8" />Chila panzia dizakuwa na utali wa mita longo na nhatu na ugalamu wake mita mbili, mapanzia yose longo na imwe yezakuwa na ningo ziya ziya. <verse eid="EXO 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 26:9" />Kwizalumbiliza mapanzia matano hamwe na mapanzia sita hamwe, panzia desita kwizadibanda haulongozi wa hema ijo. <verse eid="EXO 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 26:10" />Maabaho kwizatenda vitanzi malongo matano muna imhindo ya panzia da uhelelo da chihande cha mwanduso, kwizatenda vitanzi malongo matano muna imhindo ya panzia ya uhelelo wa chihande chekaidi. <verse eid="EXO 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 26:11" />Kwizatengeneza vihindo malongo matano va shaba na kuviguma muna ivitanzi viya malongo matano muladi kulumbiliza vihande vidi va mapanzia kutenda panzia dimwe da hema. <verse eid="EXO 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 26:12" />Nusu ya panzia disigale, kwizaitumbika ubanzi wa kuchisogo wa dihema, <verse eid="EXO 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 26:13" />Utali wa panzia disigale kwizaibanda nusu mita ubanzi umwe na nusu mita ubanzi umwenga, muladi itinge ubanzi wa dihema muladi iwe na ngubiko.<verse eid="EXO 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 26:14" />“Kwizatengeneza ngubiko imwenga ya hema kwa mbende ndung'hu ihondigwe ya mabebelu ya ng'hondolo na mchanyha yake ngubiko imwenga ya mbende ya mnyama wa mwiibahali.<verse eid="EXO 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 26:15" />“Kwizatengeneza mibiki ya mkenge ya kwimizila dihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 26:16" />Mibiki izakuwa na utali wa mita nne na ugalamu wa sentimita malongo sita na sita, <verse eid="EXO 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 26:17" />mibiki izakuwa na ndimi mbili za kulumbilizila. Mibiki yose kwizaitenda iwe na ndimi mbili. <verse eid="EXO 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 26:18" />Kwizatengeneza mibiki ya hema, mibiki malongo maidi ubanzi wa kusi <verse eid="EXO 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 26:19" />na vikalilo malongo mane va hela hasi ya mibiki iyo malongo maidi, vikalilo vidi hasi kwa chila mbiki muladi vamhilile ndimi zake mbili na vikalilo vidi viwe hasi ya mbiki umwenga muladi wamhilile ziya ndimi zake mbili. <verse eid="EXO 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 26:20" />Ubanzi wa kasikazi wa hema kwizatengeneza mibiki malongo maidi <verse eid="EXO 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 26:21" />Na vikalilo vake malongo mane va hela, vikalilo vidi hasi ya chila mbiki. <verse eid="EXO 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 26:22" />Ubanzi wa kuchisogo wili uswelo wa zuwa wa hema kwizatengeneza mibiki sita. <verse eid="EXO 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 26:23" />Iviya kwizatenda mibiki midi kwa ichimu cha vingobweda va dihema ubanzi wake wa kuchisogo. <verse eid="EXO 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 26:24" />Mibiki iyo ya hasi iileke mbali ilumbilizigwe kwa kuchanyha kuna imhete imwe. Mibiki yose ya vingobweda izatendigwa ivo ivo muladi itende mbili. <verse eid="EXO 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 26:25" />Ivo kwizakuwa na mibiki minane hamwe na vikalilo vake longo na sita va hela.<verse eid="EXO 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 26:26" />“Kwizatengeneza mapalo ya mkenge, mapalo matano kwa ichimu cha mibiki ya ubanzi umwe wa hema, <verse eid="EXO 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 26:27" />mapalo matano kwa ichimu cha ubanzi umwenga wa hema, mapalo matano kwa ichimu cha mibiki ya kuchisogo cha hema na ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa. <verse eid="EXO 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 26:28" />Palo da hagati difikile nusu ya zengo da hema dizaibebenyeka hagati kulawa kuuhelelo umwe mbaka uhelelo umwenga wa hema. <verse eid="EXO 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 26:29" />Mibiki yose kwizaihaka zahabu na kuitendela mhete za zahabu zondazamhilile mapalo yayo, izo iviya kwizazihaka zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 26:30" />Ivo kwizaditenda hema ijo fana viya vinikulaguse kumulima.<verse eid="EXO 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 26:31" />“Kwizatenda panzia da nyuzi za langi ya buluu na za zambalau na ndung'hu na walo dibotigwe. Panzia ijo kwizadihamba vinogile kwa vilumbe vilingile fana wasenga wa kuulanga wasongoligwe na mafundi. <verse eid="EXO 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 26:32" />Kwizatumbika dipanzia muna izimhanda nne za mkenge zihakigwe zahabu, zili na ngwamo za zahabu na vikalilo vine va hela. <verse eid="EXO 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 26:33" />Kwizatumbika panzia ijo muna ivihindo, maabaho udigale disanduku diya da ukalangama dili na vibao vidi va mabwe kuchisogo ya panzia ijo. Panzia ijo dizagola hanhu helile na hanhu helile ng'hani. <verse eid="EXO 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 26:34" />Ika ngubiko uchanyha ya disanduku da lagano mgati ya hanhu helile ng'hani. <verse eid="EXO 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 26:35" />Meza ija kwizaika ubanzi wa kunze wa panzia ijo, chinala chiya cha chitasa kwizachika ubanzi wa kusi wa dihema, viilole na imeza. Meza iyo izakuwa ubanzi wa kasikazi.<verse eid="EXO 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 26:36" />“Kwa ichimu cha hanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema kwizatengeneza panzia da langi ya buluu na zambalau na ndung'hu na walo dinogile dibotigwe na kuhambigwa vinogile. <verse eid="EXO 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 26:37" />Kwa ichimu cha panzia kwizatengeneza mhanda tano za mkenge na kuzihaka zahabu. Mhanda izo zizakuwa na ngwamo za zahabu, chila imwe izakuwa na kalilo da shaba.”<verse eid="EXO 26:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EXO 27" />
  <para style="s">Lupango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 38:1-7">Kulawa 38:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 27:1" />
    <figure style="fig" file="OT-03 BronzeAltar.jpg" size="col" ref="27:1">Lupango lwa kulavila nhambiko</figure> “Tengeneza lupango lwa mibiki ya mkenge. Lupango ulo lwizakuwa lwa mulaba utali wake mita mbili na lobo na ugalamu wake mita mbili na lobo na chimo chake chizakuwa mita imwe na lobo. <verse eid="EXO 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 27:2" />Kwizatenda mahembe mane, chila chingobweda hembe dimwe. Mahembe yayo yezakuwa chinhu chimwe na ulupango, kwizaluhaka shaba ulupango lose. <verse eid="EXO 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 27:3" />Kwizatenda via vake, vizae va kuzolela maivu na vizae va kuhalila moto na mibatilo na magembe na vyano va kuhalila moto. Vinhu vose vizahakigwa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 27:4" />Maabaho kwizatengeneza lwavu lwa shaba lwili na mhete nne za shaba kuna ivingobweda vake vine. <verse eid="EXO 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 27:5" />Lwavu ulo kwizawika mulugigo lwa ulupango ubanzi wa hasi muladi lwavu lufike hagati ya upango. <verse eid="EXO 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 27:6" />Iviya kwizatengeneza mibiki ya mkenge ya kupapila ulupango, nayo kwizaihaka shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 27:7" />Mibiki iyo izakwingizigwa muna zimhete banzi mbili za ulupango lusita lwa kulupapa. <verse eid="EXO 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 27:8" />Tengeneza lupango wa mibiki uli na uvungu mgati fana simwe donikulaguse kumulima.<verse eid="EXO 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luwa lwa hema da Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 27:9" />“Tengeneza luwa lwa hema da Mulungu. Ubanzi wa kusi wa uluwa kwizakuwa na mapanzia yatengenezigwe kwa walo dinogile dibotigwe yondayawe na utali wa mita malongo mane na nne kwa ubanzi umwe. <verse eid="EXO 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 27:10" />Mapanzia yayo yezakwamhigwa na mibiki malongo maidi ya shaba ili na vikalilo va shaba. Mbali ngwamo za mhanda na vihindo vake vizakuwa va hela. <verse eid="EXO 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 27:11" />Iviya utali wa panzia ubanzi wa kasikazi wizakuwa mita malongo mane na nne na mhanda zake malongo maidi za shaba, mbali ngwamo na mhanda zake na vihindo vake vizakuwa va hela. <verse eid="EXO 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 27:12" />Ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa wa uluwa wizakuwa na panzia dili na utali wa mita malongo maidi na mbili na mhanda zake longo na vikalilo vake longo. <verse eid="EXO 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 27:13" />Ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa wa ulwivi, luwa lwizakuwa na ugalamu wa mita malongo maidi na mbili. <verse eid="EXO 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 27:14" />Panzia da ubanzi umwe wa ulwivi dizakuwa na ugalamu wa mita sita na nusu, hamwe na mhanda nhatu na vikalilo vake vitatu. <verse eid="EXO 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 27:15" />Kuna ubanzi wekaidi wa lwivi panzia dizakuwa mita sita na nusu, hamwe na mhanda tatu na vikalilo vake vitatu. <verse eid="EXO 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 27:16" />Lwivi lwenyewo lwa uluwa lwizakuwa na panzia dili na utali wa mita kenda, ditengenezigwe kwa nyuzi za langi ya buluu na za zambalau na ndung'hu na walo dinogile dibotigwe na kuhambigwa vinogile. Panzia ijo dizakwamhigwa na mhanda nne zili na vikalilo vine. <verse eid="EXO 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 27:17" />Mhanda zose zizunguluke uluwa zizakwamhigwa na vinhu va hela, ngwamo zake zizakuwa za hela na vikalilo vake vizakuwa va shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 27:18" />Luwa ulo lwizakuwa na utali wa mita malongo mane na nne na ugalamu wa mita malongo maidi na mbili, chimo mita mbili na lobo. Mapanzia yake yezakuwa ya walo dinogile na vikalilo vake vizakuwa va shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 27:19" />Via vose va kusang'hanila chila chinhu muna dihema da Mulungu na vigingi vose na hata via va uluwa vizakuwa va shaba.<verse eid="EXO 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwika goya chitasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 24:1-4">Walawi 24:1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 27:20" />“Walagilize wanhu wa Isilaili wakugalile mavuta yanogile ya mzaituni kwa ichimu cha chitasa, muladi chitasa chidahe kwaka lusita lose. <verse eid="EXO 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 27:21" />Muna dihema da Mulungu kunze ya panzia ijo haulongozi ha sanduku da lagano, Haluni na wanage wezadika goya haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu ichigulogulo mbaka imitondo. Lagilizo dino dolondeka dizindililigwe na Waisilaili wose na nyelesi zawo siku zose.<verse eid="EXO 27:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EXO 28" />
  <para style="s">Mawalo ya wakulu wa nhambiko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 39:1-7">Kulawa 39:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 28:1" />“Mgale Haluni ndugu yako na wanage, Nadabu na Abihu na Eleazali na Isamali. Wagale kulawa mwa wanhu wa Isilaili muladi wanisang'hanile fana wakulu wa nhambiko. <verse eid="EXO 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 28:2" />Kwizamsonela Haluni ndugu yako mawalo yelile muladi yadahe kuwoneka yeli na utunhizo na kanoga. <verse eid="EXO 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 28:3" />Walagilize wanhu wose weli na umanyi woniweng'hile ubala wamsonele Haluni mawalo, muladi yadahe kubaguligwa kuwa mkulu wa nhambiko muna usang'hano wangu. <verse eid="EXO 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 28:4" />Walongele wamtendele mawalo yelile, chifuko cha muna imhambaga na chizibawo na ng'hanzu na chilemba na mkwiji na joho dihambigwe. Haluni ndugu yako na wanage wezavala muladi wanisang'hanile fana wakulu wa nhambiko. <verse eid="EXO 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 28:5" />Wezasang'hanila nyuzi za langi ya buluu na za zambalau na ndung'hu na nyuzi za zahabu na walo dinogile dibotigwe.<verse eid="EXO 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 28:6" />“Wezatengeneza chizibawo cha mkulu wa nhambiko kwa nyuzi za zahabu na nyuzi za langi ya buluu na za zambalau na ndung'hu na walo dinogile dibotigwe na fundi. <verse eid="EXO 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 28:7" />Chizakuwa na nzabi mbili za kuchifungila muna diyega zozisonigwe hamwe muna zimhembe zake mbili. <verse eid="EXO 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 28:8" />Mkwiji wizatendigwa fana viya, kwa nyuzi za zahabu na nyuzi za buluu na za zambalau na ndung'hu na walo dinogile dibotigwe na kuwa chinhu chimwe na chizibawo icho. <verse eid="EXO 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 28:9" />Maabaho kwizasola mabwe maidi ya salidoniki na uchanyha yake kwizachola mazina ya wana wa Isilaili. <verse eid="EXO 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 28:10" />Mazina sita muna idibwe da mwanduso na mazina sita muna idibwe dekaidi, uyapange fana viya viwelekigwe. <verse eid="EXO 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 28:11" />Kwizayachola mazina yayo uchanyha ya mabwe yayo fana viya sonala viyochola muhuli. Maabaho uyahambe na kuyengiza muna ivihindo va zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 28:12" />Mabwe yayo maidi yezakwikigwa uchanyha ya vihande va muna yamayega va chizibawo kulagusa makabila longo na maidi ya Isilaili. Ivo Haluni kezavala mazina yayo muna yamayega yake haulongozi wangu niye Mndewa Mulungu fana lukumbuso. <verse eid="EXO 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 28:13" />Kwizatenda vihindo vidi va zahabu, <verse eid="EXO 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 28:14" />na mikufu midi ya zahabu yelile ibotigwe fana luzabi. Kwizaifunga mikufu iyo muna ivihindo.<verse eid="EXO 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chifuko cha mwiimhambaga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 39:8-21">Kulawa 39:8-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 28:15" />“Kwizatenda chifuko cha muimhambaga cha kuhumiza, chitengenezigwe na fundi fana vichitengenezigwe chiya ichizibawo, kwa zahabu na kwa nyuzi za langi ya buluu na za zambalau na ndung'hu na walo dinogile dibotigwe. <verse eid="EXO 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 28:16" />Chifuko icho chibandigwe chizakuwa cha mulaba, sentimita malongo maidi na mbili. <verse eid="EXO 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 28:17" />Chizahambigwa kwa misitali mine ya mabwe ya bei ng'hulu. Msitali wa mwanduso wizakuwa wa hakiki na topazi na alimasi ndung'hu. <verse eid="EXO 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 28:18" />Msitali wekaidi wizakuwa wa zumalidi na johali ya langi ya buluu na alimasi ya langi ya mayani mabisi. <verse eid="EXO 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 28:19" />Msitali wekatatu wizakuwa wa yasito na agate na amesisito. <verse eid="EXO 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 28:20" />Msitali wekane wizakuwa wa zabalajadi na shohamu na yasipi, yose yezagumigwa muna ivihindo va zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 28:21" />Lelo hezakuwa na mabwe longo na maidi yacholigwe mazina longo na maidi ya wana wa Isilaili. Chila dimwe dizakuwa fana uhula muladi kulagusa makabila longo na maidi.<verse eid="EXO 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 28:22" />“Kwa ichimu cha chifuko icho cha muna imhambaga, kwizatengeneza mikufu ya zahabu yelile ibotigwe fana luzabi. <verse eid="EXO 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 28:23" />Iviya kwizachitengenezela ichifuko cha muna imhambaga mhete mbili za zahabu na kuziguma muna zimhembe mbili za chifuko icho. <verse eid="EXO 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 28:24" />Na uigume imikufu midi ya zahabu muna zimhete izo za chifuko cha muna imhambaga. <verse eid="EXO 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 28:25" />Zinhonga ziya mbili za mikufu ya zahabu kwizazigeleka muna ivihindo vidi muladi ziigelekeze na ichihande cha muna yamayega cha chizibawo ubanzi wa kuulongozi. <verse eid="EXO 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 28:26" />Iviya kwizatengeneza mhete mbili za zahabu na kuziguma muna zimhembe mbili za hasi, ubanzi wa mgati wa chifuko cha muna imhambaga habehi na ichizibawo. <verse eid="EXO 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 28:27" />Maabaho kwizatengeneza mhete zimwenga mbili za zahabu na kuziguma kuulongozi muna zimhembe mbili za hasi za vihande va muna yamayega va chizibawo, hanhu chizibawo hochiilumba na mkwiji ubotigwe vinogile. <verse eid="EXO 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 28:28" />Chifuko cha muna imhambaga chizafungigwa kuna ichizibawo kwa kulumbiliza mkwiji wake na chizibawo kwa luzabi lwa langi ya buluu, muladi chifuko icho cha muna imhambaga sekechitohoke mbali chikale muna ichizibawo.<verse eid="EXO 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 28:29" />“Haluni viyokwingila hanhu helile, kezavala chifuko cha muna imhambaga cha kuhumiza chicholigwe mazina ya makabila ya wana wa Isilaili, kwa kutenda ivo, niye Mndewa Mulungu sizawazimiza ng'o. <verse eid="EXO 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 28:30" />Kwizaguma Ulimu na Sumimu muna ichifuko cha muimhambaga cha kuhumiza, izo zizakuwa uchanyha ya moyo wa Haluni chila viyokwiza haulongozi wangu. Haluni kezasola ulamuzi wa wana wa Isilaili wawo uchanyha ya moyo wake haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu siku zose.<verse eid="EXO 28:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawalo yamwenga ya ukulu wa nhambiko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 39:22-31">Kulawa 39:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 28:31" />“Kwizasona joho da kuvalila chizibawo kwa nyuzi za langi ya buluu. <verse eid="EXO 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 28:32" />Hagati dizakuwa na nyafasi ya kufosezela ditwi, nyafasi iyo izasonigwa na nyuzi muladi sekeidegeke. <verse eid="EXO 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 28:33" />Muna imhindo yake ya hasi kuzunguluka banzi zose, dizacholigwa makomamanga ya langi ya buluu na zambalau na ndung'hu, iviya hagati ya makomamanga yayo hezakuwa na mbugi za zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 28:34" />Komamanga na mbugi ya zahabu kuzunguluka joho jose. <verse eid="EXO 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 28:35" />Haluni kolondeka yavale ng'hanzu ino lusita viyosang'hana usang'hano wa ukulu wa nhambiko. Dizi da mbugi dizahulikika viyokwingila hanhu helile haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu na viyolawa, ivo hezakomigwa bule.<verse eid="EXO 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 28:36" />“Maabaho kwizatengeneza chihande cha zahabu yelile na kuchola uchanyha yake fana munhu viyochola muhuli, ‘Yelile kwa Mndewa Mulungu.’ <verse eid="EXO 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 28:37" />Chihande icho kwizachifunga kwa luzabi kuulongozi wa chilemba cha buluu. <verse eid="EXO 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 28:38" />Haluni kezachivala chihande icho kuna ichihanga chake, kwa chihande icho kezasola ubananzi uwatendile Waisilaili kuna ukunilavila nhosa, niye Mndewa Mulungu nizazitogola nhosa zawo. Haluni kezavala chihande icho lusita lose.<verse eid="EXO 28:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 28:39" />“Kwizamtengenezela Haluni joho ditengenezigwe kwa walo dinogile na kumuhogosela chilemba cha walo dinogile na mkwiji utendigwe na fundi.<verse eid="EXO 28:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 28:40" />“Kwizawatengenezela wanage Haluni majoho na mikwiji na kofiya muladi wawoneke wana utunhizo na ukulu. <verse eid="EXO 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 28:41" />Kwizamvaza Haluni ndugu yako na wanage mawalo yano, maabaho uwahake mavuta na kwika kwa sang'hano yelile na uwabagule muladi wanisang'hanile fana wakulu wa nhambiko. <verse eid="EXO 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 28:42" />Iviya kwizawasonela kaputula za chitani zondaziwagubike kwandusila mchigudi mbaka muna yamawambo muladi wagubike mwazi wawo. <verse eid="EXO 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 28:43" />Haluni na wanage wezavala kaputula izo chila vondawengile muna dihema da Mulungu hebu vondawawe habehi na ulupango na kutenda sang'hano za ukulu wa nhambiko hana ihanhu helile. Kwa kutenda ivo hawezalagusa mwazi wawo na kukomigwa. Iyo izakuwa ndagilizi ya siku zose kwa Haluni na welesi wake.<verse eid="EXO 28:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EXO 29" />
  <para style="s">Ndagilizi za kuwabagula Haluni na wanage fana wakulu wa nhambiko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 8:1-36">Walawi 8:1-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 29:1" />“Vino niivo vondauwatendela Haluni na wanage muladi kuwabagula wanisang'hanile fana wakulu wa nhambiko. Sola dang'ang'a da ng'ombe lume dimwe na mabebelu maidi ya ng'hondolo yelibule chilema chochose, <verse eid="EXO 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 29:2" />na magate hayagumigwe lusu, maandazi hayagumigwe lusu yabulugigwe na mavuta, na magate masisili hayagumigwe lusu, mbali yoigumigwe mavuta. Vinhu vino vose vitengenenzigwe kwa usage lunhili wa ngano. <verse eid="EXO 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 29:3" />Maabaho uvike vinhu ivo muna ichigelo chimwe na uvilave hamwe na diya dang'ang'a da ng'ombe lume na ng'hondolo malume maidi.<verse eid="EXO 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 29:4" />“Maabaho wagale Haluni na wanage wa chilume mbaka hana dihema da Mulungu na uwanave na mazi. <verse eid="EXO 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 29:5" />Maabaho kwizasola yaja mawalo ya ukulu wa nhambiko umvaze Haluni, joho na ng'hanzu na chizibawo na chifuko cha muna imhambaga na kumzingiliza umkwiji uja ubotigwe vinogile. <verse eid="EXO 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 29:6" />Mvaze Haluni chilemba chiya muna iditwi na kwika chihande chiya cha zahabu yelile uchanyha ya chilemba icho. <verse eid="EXO 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 29:7" />Maabaho sola mavuta yelile na umgidile mditwi jake na umuhake.<verse eid="EXO 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 29:8" />“Maabaho wasole wanage na uwavaze ng'hanzu, <verse eid="EXO 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 29:9" />na uwafunge mikwiji muna ivigudi na kuwavaza kofiya zawo, vino ivo vondauweke Haluni na wanage kwa sang'hano yelile. Wawo wezakuwa wakulu wa nhambiko siku zose.<verse eid="EXO 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 29:10" />“Maabaho kwizagala dang'ang'a da ng'ombe lume haulongozi ha hema da Mulungu. Haluni na wanage wezakwika makono yawo uchanyha ya ditwi da dang'ang'a da ng'ombe ijo. <verse eid="EXO 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 29:11" />Uchinje dang'ang'a da ng'ombe ijo haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu, hana ihanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 29:12" />Kwizasola damu imwenga ya ng'ombe na kwizaihaka muna yamahembe ya ulupango kwa chidole chako, damu yose yondaisigale kwizaitila hasi ya ulupango. <verse eid="EXO 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 29:13" />Maabaho kwizasola mavuta yose yogubika utumbo, hanhu ha hasi ya maini hamwe na figo mbili na mavuta yake, vose uvitimbule muna ulupango. <verse eid="EXO 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 29:14" />Mbali nyama ya dang'ang'a da ng'ombe lume ijo na mbende na mavi yake kwizavisola na kuvitimbula kunze ya lago. Ino izakuwa nhambiko ya uhasanyi.<verse eid="EXO 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 29:15" />“Maabaho kwizasola imwe mwa ng'hondolo malume waja na umulongele Haluni na wanage weke makono yawo uchanyha ya ditwi jake. <verse eid="EXO 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 29:16" />Weye kwizamchinja na damu yake kwizaimizila banzi zose za ulupango. <verse eid="EXO 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 29:17" />Maabaho kwizamkanha ng'hondolo lume iyo vihande vihande, kwizasunha utumbo wake na migulu yake, uvike vose hamwe na ditwi jake na vihande vake vimwenga. <verse eid="EXO 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 29:18" />Maabaho kwizatimbula bebelu da ng'hondolo ijo jose uchanyha ya lupango muladi kunilavila nhambiko ya kutimbuligwa, mnung'ho wa nhambiko itimbuligwa izaninogeza niye Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 29:19" />“Kwizasola ng'hondolo lume dimwenga, iviya Haluni na wanage wezakwika makono yawo uchanyha ya ditwi jake. <verse eid="EXO 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 29:20" />Kwizamchinja na kusola damu chidogo na kumuhaka Haluni na wanage hanhu ha hasi ha magutwi yawo ya kulume na muna yamadole ng'hulu da mikono yawo ya kulume na madole ng'hulu ya migulu yawo ya ukulume. Damu yondaisigale kwizalumizila ulupango banzi zake zose nne. <verse eid="EXO 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 29:21" />Maabaho kwizasola damu chidogo ili muna ulupango hamwe na mavuta yaja yelile, ummizile Haluni na mawalo yake, iviya uwamizile wanage na mawalo yawo. Haluni na wanage wezakuwa wela kumwangu hamwe na mawalo yawo yose.<verse eid="EXO 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 29:22" />“Kwizasola mavuta ya ng'hondolo lume, mkila wake na mavuta yogubika utumbo na hanhu hanonile hasi ha maini na figo zake mbili na mavuta yake, hamwe na chima cha kulume. Ng'hondolo iyo niiyo ng'hondolo wa kwikigwa kwa sang'hano yelile. <verse eid="EXO 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 29:23" />Muna ichigelo cha magate hayagumigwe lusu chili haulongozi wangu niye Mndewa Mulungu, kwizasola gate dimwe na andazi dimwe digumigwe mavuta na gate sisili dimwe. <verse eid="EXO 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 29:24" />Vinhu vino vose kwizamwing'ha Haluni na wanage muna yamakono yawo, nawo wezavinula uchanyha kuwa chilaguso cha kunilavila nhambiko niye Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 29:25" />Maabaho kwizavisola kaidi muna yamakono yawo na kuvitimbula uchanyha ya ulupango hamwe na nhambiko ija ya kutimbuligwa, viwe mnung'ho unogile uninogeza niye Mndewa Mulungu. Iyo niiyo nhambiko yoitimbuligwa kwa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 29:26" />“Maabaho kwizasola chidali cha bebelu da ng'hondolo na kumwika Haluni kwa sang'hano yelile, na kuchinula uchanyha muladi kunilavila niye Mndewa Mulungu. Nacho chizakuwa chako.<verse eid="EXO 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 29:27" />“Kwika kwa sang'hano yelile ya ukulu wa nhambiko, vihande vidi va bebelu da ng'hondolo. Vino ivo chidali chinuligwe uchanyha na chima chibaguligwe. Chidali yeng'higwe Haluni, chima weng'higwe wanage. <verse eid="EXO 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 29:28" />Ivo Waisilaili siku zose wezasola vihande ivo kulawa muna zinhambiko zawo za tindiwalo zowonilavila niye Mndewa Mulungu na kumwing'ha Haluni na wanage, iyo niiyo nhambiko kwa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 29:29" />“Haluni yahadanganika, mawalo yake yelile wezakwing'higwa welesi wake, nawo wezavala siku yawo ya kuhakigwa mavuta na kwikigwa kwa sang'hano yelile. <verse eid="EXO 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 29:30" />Mwana wa Haluni yondayawe mkulu wa nhambiko hanhu ha tati yake, kezavala mawalo yayo siku saba muna dihema da Mulungu, muladi yasang'hane usang'hano hanhu helile. <verse eid="EXO 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 29:31" />Kwizasola nyama ya bebelu ijo da kwikigwa kwa sang'hano yelile na kuikimusa hana ihanhu hamwenga helile. <verse eid="EXO 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 29:32" />Haluni na wanage wezakuja nyama ya bebelu ijo na gate dili muna ichigelo hanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 29:33" />Wezakuja nyama izo zilavigwe kwa ichimu cha kuilumba na kwika kwa sang'hano yelile na kwa ichimu cha kuwabagula, mbali munhu imwenga sekeyalekeligwe kuja nyama izo kwaviya zela. <verse eid="EXO 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 29:34" />One nyama yoyose hebu magate yezasigala mbaka imitondo, basi kwizaitimbula, sekeidigwe kwaviya yela.<verse eid="EXO 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 29:35" />“Ivo niivo vondauwatendele Haluni na wanage kwa kusondelela na mbuli zose zonikulagilize, kwizaweka kwa sang'hano yelile kwa siku saba. <verse eid="EXO 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 29:36" />“Chila siku kwizalava ng'ombe lume dimwe diwe nhambiko ya uhasanyi, kwa kutenda ivo kwizalusafya ulupango, maabaho kwizalugidila mavuta muladi kulusafya. <verse eid="EXO 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 29:37" />Kwa siku saba kwizalusafya ulupango na kulubagula. Uhakomeleza kutenda ivo, lupango lwizakuwa lwela ng'hani na chinhu chochose chondachidalise ulupango, chizakuwa chela.<verse eid="EXO 29:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhosa za chila siku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 29:38" />“Zino niizo nhambiko zomulondeka kulava uchanyha ya lupango chila siku, wanang'hondolo waidi malume weli na mwaka umwe. <verse eid="EXO 29:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 29:39" />Mwanang'hondolo imwe kwizamulava imitondo, mwanang'hondolo imwenga kwizamulava ichigulogulo nguku zikwingila. <verse eid="EXO 29:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 29:40" />Hamwe na mwanang'hondolo wa mwanduso, kwizalava chibaba cha usage lunhili wouhanganyigwe na lita imwe ya mavuta yanogile na lita imwe ya divai fana nhosa ya ching'waji. <verse eid="EXO 29:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 29:41" />Mwanang'hondolo imwenga wa chigulogulo nguku zikwingila kwizamulavila nhambiko hamwe na nhosa ya usage na ya ching'waji fana viutendile imitondo, mnung'ho wa nhambiko iyo yoilavigwa kwa moto wizaninogeza niye Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 29:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 29:42" />“Nhambiko ino ya kutimbuligwa izalavigwa siku zose, welesi mbaka welesi, haulongozi hangu niye Mndewa Mulungu, haulongozi ha hanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu hondaniiting'hane na kulonga na mweye. <verse eid="EXO 29:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 29:43" />Baho nizaiting'hana na wanhu wa Isilaili, baho hezakwela kwa bung'hulo wangu. <verse eid="EXO 29:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 29:44" />Nizabagula hema da Mulungu na ulupango, iviya nizawabagula Haluni na wanage muladi wanisang'hanile fana wakulu wa nhambiko. <verse eid="EXO 29:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 29:45" />Nizakala hagati ya wanhu wa Isilaili na nizakuwa Mulungu wawo. <verse eid="EXO 29:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 29:46" />Baho wezavimanya kuwa niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wawo, yoniwalavile muna iisi ya Misili muladi nikale hagati yawo. Niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wawo.<verse eid="EXO 29:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EXO 30" />
  <para style="s">Lupango lwa kusomela ubani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 37:25-28">Kulawa 37:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 30:1" />“Kwizatengeneza lupango lwa mibiki ya mkenge, kwa ichimu cha kusomela ubani. <verse eid="EXO 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 30:2" />Lupango ulo luwe lwa mulaba utali sentimita malongo mane na tano na ugalamu sentimita malongo mane na tano na chimo chake sentimita malongo kenda. Mahembe yake ya chila chingobweda yawe chinhu chimwe na lupango lwenyewo. <verse eid="EXO 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 30:3" />Kwizaluhaka zahabu yelile, ubanzi wake wa uchanyha na banzi zake zose na mahembe yake, iviya kwizalutendela lukingo lwa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 30:4" />Kwizaitendela mhete mbili za zahabu na kuziguma muna ulukingo lwa banzi zake mbili zoziilola, mhete izo zizasang'haniligwa kwamhilila mibiki lusita lwa kuipapila. <verse eid="EXO 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 30:5" />Mibiki iyo iwe ya mkenge na ihakigwe zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 30:6" />Lupango ulo lwike haulongozi wa panzia haulongozi wa disanduku da lagano, haulongozi ha ngubiko ya kuilumba, hondaniiting'hane na weye.<verse eid="EXO 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 30:7" />“Chila imitondo Haluni viyosasala vitasa, kezasoma ubani wili na mnung'ho unogile muna ulupango. <verse eid="EXO 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 30:8" />Haluni kolondeka kutenda ivo lusita voyokwacha vitasa ichigulogulo nguku zikwingila. Nhosa ino ya ubani izalavigwa siku zose kwa Mndewa Mulungu bila kuleka muna zinyelesi zenu zikwiza. <verse eid="EXO 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 30:9" />Muna ulupango luno, usome ubani uluhusigwa muhala na sekemulave nhambiko ya kutimbuligwa, hebu nhosa ya usage, hebu kugida nhosa ya ching'waji uchanyha yake. <verse eid="EXO 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 30:10" />Haluni kolondeka kuyasafya mahembe ya ulupango mwanza umwe kwa mwaka. Kezayasafya kwa damu ya nhambiko ya uhasanyi mwanza umwe chila mwaka muna zinyelesi zenu zose, kwaviya lupango ulo lwela ng'hani kumwangu niye Mndewa Mulungu.”<verse eid="EXO 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kodi ya hema da Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 30:11" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 30:12" />“Vondauwapete Waisilaili, chila munhu kezamuliha maliho Mndewa Mulungu kwa ichimu cha ugima wake muladi hagati yawo sekekuwe na mitamu ihile lusita lwa kupetigwa. <verse eid="EXO 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 30:13" />Chila munhu yopetigwa kolondeka yalihe nusu shekeli ya hela, fana viipimigwe muna dihema da Mulungu. Ino niiyo nhosa yondayanilavile niye Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 30:14" />Chila munhu yopetigwa kwandusila miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela, kezanilavila niye Mndewa Mulungu nhosa iyo. <verse eid="EXO 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 30:15" />Tajili sekeyalave kufosa nudu shekeli iyo ya hela hebu ngayengaye sekeyalave chidogo ya nusu shekeli iyo ya hela vomumulavila Mndewa Mulungu nhambiko ya kuilumba kwa ichimu cha ugima wenu. <verse eid="EXO 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 30:16" />Kwizahokela maliho yayo ya kuilumba kulawa kwa Waisilaili na kwizayasang'hanila kwa sang'hano za hema da Mulungu, nayo yawe lukumbuso kwa Waisilaili haulongozi wangu niye Mndewa Mulungu muladi kuwatendelani kuilumba.”<verse eid="EXO 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ziga diumbigwe kwa shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 30:17" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 30:18" />“Kwizatengeneza ziga diumbigwe kwa shaba da kunawila dili na kalilo da shaba, udike hagati ya dihema da Mulungu na ulupango, na kudiguma mazi mgati yake. <verse eid="EXO 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 30:19" />Haluni na wanage wezasang'hanila mazi yayo kunawa makono yawo na migulu yawo, <verse eid="EXO 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 30:20" />Lusita wang'hali hawanakwingila muna dihema da Mulungu hebu kukwenhuka habehi ya lupango muladi kumulavila Mndewa Mulungu nhambiko za kutimbuligwa kwa moto. Wezatenda ivo muladi sekewadanganike. <verse eid="EXO 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 30:21" />Wolondeka wanawe makono yawo na migulu yawo muladi sekewadanganike. Dino dizakuwa lagilizo jawo siku zose, kwandusila Haluni na wanage na kugendelela.”<verse eid="EXO 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mavuta yelile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 30:22" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 30:23" />“Kwizasola vilungo vinogile ng'hani fana vino, manemane ya mazi chilo sita, mdalasini uli na mnung'ho unogile chilo nhatu, vilungo vinung'hila goya chilo nhatu, <verse eid="EXO 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 30:24" />na modeli imwenga ya mdalasini chilo sita. Ningo izo zose zilinge fana ningo za hema da Mulungu, iviya uyahanganye na lita nne za mavuta ya mzaituni. <verse eid="EXO 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 30:25" />Kwa vilungo ivo kwizatenda mavuta yelile na uyahanganye fana munhu yokwenga mavuta yonung'hila goya, mavuta yayo yela kwa kuhaka. <verse eid="EXO 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 30:26" />Maabaho mavuta yayo kwizayagida muna dihema da Mulungu na sanduku da lagano <verse eid="EXO 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 30:27" />na meza na via vake vose, chinala cha chitasa na via vake, lupango lwa kusomela ubani <verse eid="EXO 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 30:28" />na lupango lwa kutimbulila nhambiko na via vake vose na ziga na kalilo jake. <verse eid="EXO 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 30:29" />Kwizavibagula vinhu ivo, muladi vele ng'hani. Chochose chondachidalise vinhu ivo, chizakuwa chela. <verse eid="EXO 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 30:30" />Maabaho umuhake mavuta yelile Haluni na wanage na kuwabagula, muladi wanisang'hanile fana wakulu wa nhambiko. <verse eid="EXO 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 30:31" />Walongele wanhu wa Isilaili, ‘Yano yezakuwa mavuta yangu yelile ya kuhaka muna zinyelesi zenu zose. <verse eid="EXO 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 30:32" />Mavuta yayo sekemumgidile munhu imwenga yoyose, na sekemutengeneze mavuta yamwenga yalingile yano, mavuta yano yela na lusita lose yolondeka yele kumwenu. <verse eid="EXO 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 30:33" />Munhu yoyose yondayenge mavuta fana yano hebu kumuhaka munhu imwenga yoyose halondeka kuhakigwa mavuta yano, kezawingigwa na wanhu wake.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 30:34" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Sola vilungo vino vili umulile, natafi na shekelesi na kelibena, vilungo vili na mnung'ho unogile, hamwe na ubani unogile. Vinhu ivo vose viwe va ningo imwe. <verse eid="EXO 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 30:35" />Maabaho kwizasang'hanila via ivo kutengenezela ubani fana viutengenezigwa na munhu yotenda vinhu vonhung'hila goya, ubani uli na munyu na mzelu na wela. <verse eid="EXO 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 30:36" />Maabaho kwizaudunda uwe usage lunhili muladi usang'haniligwe muna dihema da Mulungu na kuwika haulongozi wa disanduku da lagano, hanhu hondaniiting'hane na weye, uwo kumwenu wizakuwa ubani welile ng'hani. <verse eid="EXO 30:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 30:37" />Sekemuitendele wenyewo ubani ulingile vino, ubani uwo wizakuwa wela kumwenu haulongozi wangu niye Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 30:38" />Munhu yoyose yoitengenezela ubani ulingile uwo na kuusang'hanila fana mavuta yonung'ha goya, kezawingigwa na wanhu wake.”<verse eid="EXO 30:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EXO 31" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wa kusasala hema da Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 35:30-36:1">Kulawa 35:30-36:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 31:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 31:2" />“Nimsagula Bezaleli, mwana wa Uli, mzukulu wa Huli, kulawa kabila da Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 31:3" />na nimmemeza Muhe wangu. Nimwing'ha udahi na kuzowela na nzewele na umanyi wa kutengeneza vinhu, <verse eid="EXO 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 31:4" />muladi yatole sang'hano za umanyi, yahonde zahabu na hela na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 31:5" />na kusongola mabwe ya kuhamba na kusongola mibiki na kutenda ufundi wa chila modeli. <verse eid="EXO 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 31:6" />Iviya nimsagula Oholiabu mwana wa Ahisamaki, kulawa kabila da Dani, yamtaze. Iviya niweng'ha udahi mkulu wanhu wamwenga kwa ichimu cha sang'hano mbasakanyo, muladi watengeneze vinhu vose vinikulagilize. <verse eid="EXO 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 31:7" />Watengeneze hema da Mulungu na sanduku da lagano na ngubiko iyo ya kuilumba ili uchanyha yake, hamwe na via vake vose, <verse eid="EXO 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 31:8" />meza na via vake na chinala cha chitasa na via vake vose na lupango lwa kusomela ubani, <verse eid="EXO 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 31:9" />lupango lwa kutimbulila nhambiko na via vake vose, ziga na kalilo jake, <verse eid="EXO 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 31:10" />na mawalo yabotigwe vinogile, mawalo yelile ya mkulu wa nhambiko Haluni na mawalo ya wanage wondawatende sang'hano ya ukulu wa nhambiko, <verse eid="EXO 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 31:11" />mavuta yelile na ubani wili na mnung'ho unogile kwa ichimu cha hanhu helile. Vinhu ivo vizatengenezigwa fana viya vinikulagilize.”<verse eid="EXO 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siku ya Mhumulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 31:12" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 31:13" />“Walongele wanhu wa Isilaili, ‘Izindilileni siku yangu ya Mhumulo, kwaviya chino niicho chilaguso hagati ya niye na mweye kwa nyelesi zenu zose, ivo mwizavimanya kuwa kweli niye niiyo Mndewa Mulungu, yonimtendani mwele. <verse eid="EXO 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 31:14" />Molondeka muizindilile Siku ya Mhumulo, kwaviya yela kumwenu. Munhu yoyose yoitenda siku iyo yambule mwiko, kolondeka yakomigwe. Munhu yoyose yosang'hana usang'hano siku iyo, kolondeka yawingigwe na wanhu wake. <verse eid="EXO 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 31:15" />Sang'haneni sang'hano zenu kwa siku sita, mbali siku yesaba niiyo siku ya kuhumula ni yela, siku iniibagule niye Mndewa Mulungu. Munhu yoyose yosang'hana usang'hano Siku ya Mhumulo, kolondeka yakomigwe. <verse eid="EXO 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 31:16" />Waisilaili waizindilile Siku ya Mhumulo na waitende kwa nyelesi zawo zose fana viya lagano da siku zose. <verse eid="EXO 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 31:17" />Chizakuwa chilaguso hagati ya niye na Waisilaili siku zose, kwaviya niye Mndewa Mulungu nilumba ulanga na isi kwa siku sita, mbali siku yesaba nileka kusang'hana usang'hano na nihumula.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 31:18" />Mndewa Mulungu viyakomeleze kulonga na Musa kuna umulima wa Sinai, kamwing'ha Musa vibawo vidi va mabwe ya ukalangama, vandikigwe malagilizo kwa chidole cha Mulungu mwenyewo.<verse eid="EXO 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EXO 32" />
  <para style="s">Nyang'hiti ya dang'ang'a da zahabu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 9:6-29">Kumbukumbu 9:6-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 32:1" />Wanhu viwawonile Musa kakalama kuhumuluka kulawa kuna umulima, waiting'hana kumzunguluka Haluni na wamulongela, “Chitengenezele nyang'hiti za milungu yondaichilongoze. Musa yachilavile kuna iisi ya Misili, hachivimanyile kapatigwa na choni.” <verse eid="EXO 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 32:2" />Haluni kawedika, “Soleni heleni za zahabu muna yamagutwi ya wake zenu na wanenu, munigalile. <verse eid="EXO 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 32:3" />Ivo wanhu wose wahambula heleni zawo za zahabu na wamgalila Haluni. <verse eid="EXO 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 32:4" />Haluni kazihokela kulawa muna yamakono yawo na katengeneza dang'ang'a lume da ng'ombe wa zahabu. Wanhu walonga, “Weye Isilaili, ino iyo mulungu wetu, yoyachilavile kuna iisi ya Misili!”<verse eid="EXO 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 32:5" />Maabaho Haluni viyawonile ivo, kazenga lupango haulongozi ha didang'ang'a na kalonga, “Igolo kwizakuwa na dugila da kumuhishimu Mndewa Mulungu.” <verse eid="EXO 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 32:6" />Igolo yake wanhu waidawa walava nhambiko za kutimbula na nhambiko za kugala tindiwalo. Wanhu wakala hasi kuja na kung'wa, maabaho wema na kuvina.<verse eid="EXO 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 32:7" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Humuluka, kwaviya wanhu wako wouwalavile kuna iisi ya Misili wahasanya. <verse eid="EXO 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 32:8" />Waileka nzila ija yoniwalagilize waisondelela, watenda dang'ang'a lume da zahabu na waditambikila na wadilavila nhosa kuno wolonga, ‘Weye Isilaili, ino niiyo mulungu wetu, yachilavile kuna iisi ya Misili!’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 32:9" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Niwawona wanhu wano, wana mizoyo midala. <verse eid="EXO 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 32:10" />Lelo sekeunigomese, nileke niwadanganize kwa ludoko lwangu. Maabaho kufosela weye, nizatenda wanhu wa kabila kulu.”<verse eid="EXO 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 32:11" />Mbali Musa kamulamba Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wake, kamulongela, “Weye Mndewa Mulungu, habali kowawonela ludoko wanhu wako wouwalavile kuna iisi ya Misili kwa udahi wako mkulu na mkono wako uli na nguvu? <verse eid="EXO 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 32:12" />One uhatenda ivo, Wamisili wezadaha kulonga kuwa kawalava muna iisi ya Misili muladi kuwakoma muna umulima na kuwananga. Galula magesa yako ya ludoko na sekeuwatende wanhu wako mbuli zihile. <verse eid="EXO 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 32:13" />Wakumbuke wasang'hani wako, Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo, wouwalahile kwa kulonga, ‘Nizakongeza welesi wenu fana nhondo za kuulanga na nizaweng'ha welesi wenu isi ino yose yonimulahileni kuweng'ha, izakuwa yawo siku zose.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 32:14" />Mndewa Mulungu kagalula magesa yake ya kuwatendela wanhu wake mbuli zihile zoyalongile.<verse eid="EXO 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 32:15" />Maabaho Musa kahumuluka kulawa kuna umulima kuno kamha vibawo vidi va mabwe va ukalangama muna yamakono yake, vandikigwe banzi zose. <verse eid="EXO 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 32:16" />Vibawo ivo vikala sang'hano ya Mulungu, mwandiko wandikigwa na Mulungu mwenyewo.<verse eid="EXO 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 32:17" />Yoshua viyahulike madizi ya wanhu woguta, kamulongela Musa, “Nohulika dizi da ng'hondo muna dilago.”<verse eid="EXO 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 32:18" />Musa kamwidika, “Siyo dizi da kuhuma hebu kuhumwa, mbali dizi da wanhu wokwimba.”<verse eid="EXO 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 32:19" />Musa viyafikile muna dilago na kuwona dang'ang'a na wanhu wovina, kawona ludoko ng'hani. Kavasa ivibawo viya kulawa muna yamakono yake na kuvibena haja hasi ya mulima. <verse eid="EXO 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 32:20" />Kasola dang'ang'a lume dowatendile na kadisoma moto, maabaho kadidunda mbaka diwa usage, kakologa usage uwo muna yamazi na kawawangiliza Waisilaili wang'we. <verse eid="EXO 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 32:21" />Musa kamuuza Haluni, “Wanhu wano wakutenda choni mbaka kuwatenda watende uhasanyi mkulu ivo?”<verse eid="EXO 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 32:22" />Haluni kamwidika, “Sekeuniwonele ludoko niye msang'hani wako. Kuwamanya wanhu wano viwaisasale kutenda mbuli zihile. <verse eid="EXO 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 32:23" />Wanilongela, ‘Chitendele milungu yondaichilongoze. Musa yachilavile kuna iisi ya Misili hachivimanyile kapatigwa na choni.’ <verse eid="EXO 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 32:24" />Niwalongela, ‘Chila munhu yeli na vinhu va zahabu yavigale. Ivo wanigalila, nivilumbula muna umoto na dang'ang'a lume dilawilila!’ ”<verse eid="EXO 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 32:25" />Musa kawona kuwa wanhu wamuleka Mulungu na wotenda viwolonda. Haluni kawalekela wamuleke Mulungu na watende viwolonda, na kuigalila chinyala haulongozi ha wehi wawo. <verse eid="EXO 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 32:26" />Ivo Musa kema haulongozi ha ulwivi lwa dilago na kalonga, “Yoyose yeli ubanzi wa Mndewa Mulungu, yeze hano!” Ivo welesi wose wa Lawi waiting'hana kumzunguluka. <verse eid="EXO 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 32:27" />Kawalongela, “Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili, kolonga, ‘Chila mulume yaifunge panga jake muna ichigudi, yazunguluke chila hanhu muna dilago, kulawa lwivi lumwe mbaka umwenga, chila munhu yamkome ndugu yake na mbwiyake na mkaya miyage.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 32:28" />Walawi watenda fana Musa viyalongile. Siku iyo wanhu elufu nhatu wakomigwa. <verse eid="EXO 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 32:29" />Maabaho Musa kalonga, “Diyelo mwikigwa kwa sang'hano ya Mndewa Mulungu, kwaviya hamulemile kuwakoma wanenu na ndugu zenu. Mndewa Mulungu yamtemeleni mate diyelo idino.”<verse eid="EXO 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 32:30" />Igolo yake Musa kawalongela wanhu, “Muhasanya ng'hani. Mbali sambi nizahita kuchanyha kwa Mndewa Mulungu, yodahika nizadaha kuilumba kwa ichimu chenu.” <verse eid="EXO 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 32:31" />Musa kabwela kaidi kwa Mndewa Mulungu na kumulongela, “Ona, mbuli ziya zowatendile wanhu wano zikala uhasanyi mkulu! Wakala waitendela milungu ya zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 32:32" />Mbali lelo nokulamba walekelele uhasanyi wawo. One huwalekelele, nokulamba unisegeze muna ichitabu chako chowandike mazina ya wanhu wako.”<verse eid="EXO 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 32:33" />Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika Musa, “Wanhu wose wanihasanye nizawasegeza muna ichitabu changu. <verse eid="EXO 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 32:34" />Lelo hita ukawalongoze wanhu mbaka hanhu honikulongele. Msenga wangu wa kuulanga kezakulongolela. Siku yondaniwezileni, nizawatagusa kwa ichimu cha uhasanyi wawo.”<verse eid="EXO 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 32:35" />Ivo Mndewa Mulungu kawagalila wanhu tamu dihile, kwaviya wamulongela Haluni yawatendele dang'ang'a lume da zahabu.<verse eid="EXO 32:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EXO 33" />
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kowalongela Waisilaili wasegele kuna umulima wa Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 33:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Segeleni hano, weye na wanhu wouwalavile kuna iisi ya Misili, muhite kuna iisi yoniwalahile Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo, nilonga, ‘Isi ino nizaweng'ha welesi wenu.’ <verse eid="EXO 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 33:2" />Nizamtuma msenga wa kuulanga yawalongolele, nizawawinga Wakanaani na Waamoli na Wahiti na Wapelizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 33:3" />Hiteni kuna iisi ili na ulongo unogile. Mbali sizahita hamwe na mweye kwaviya mweye muna mizoyo midala, muladi sekeniwadanganize muna inzila.”<verse eid="EXO 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 33:4" />Wanhu viwahulike mbuli zino zihile, wandusa kulila kwa usungu na habule munhu yavalile mahambo. <verse eid="EXO 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 33:5" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Walongele Waisilaili, ‘Mweye ni wanhu muli na mizoyo midala. One nihitile hamwe na mweye kwa lusita, nahadahile kumkomani. Ivo hambuleni mahambo yenu na nizalamula va kutenda.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 33:6" />Ivo wanhu wa Isilaili wahambula mahambo yawo kuna umulima wa Holebu.<verse eid="EXO 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hema dimwenga Mndewa Mulungu moyoiting'hana na Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 33:7" />Musa kakala na chihendo cha kudisola dihema dimwenga na kudisimika kunze ya lago. Hema ijo kaditanga, “Hema da mting'hano.” Munhu yoyose yalondile kumpula Mndewa Mulungu kahita kuna dihema ijo, kunze kutali chidogo na dilago. <verse eid="EXO 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 33:8" />Chila lusita Musa viyohita kuna dihema, wanhu wose wema hana ihanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema jake na kumulola Musa mbaka viyengile muna dihema ijo. <verse eid="EXO 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 33:9" />Musa viyengile muna dihema, wingu dilingile fana mhanda dihumuluka hasi hana ihanhu ha kwingilia hana dihema, Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa kulawa muna diwingu. <verse eid="EXO 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 33:10" />Wanhu wose viwawonile wingu dilingile fana mhanda hana ihanhu ha kwingilila hana dihema, chila imwe wawo katambika hana ihanhu baho ha kwingilila. <verse eid="EXO 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 33:11" />Vino niivo Mndewa Mulungu viyalongile na Musa chihanga kwa chihanga, fana viya munhu kolonga na mbwiyake. Maabaho Musa kabwela kuna dilago. Yoshua, mwana wa Nuni, mbwanga yoyakalile msang'hani wake, kasigala muna dihema.<verse eid="EXO 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mndewa Mulungu kolagana kuwa hamwe na wanhu wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 33:12" />Musa kamulongela Mndewa Mulungu, “Kunilongela, ‘Walongoze wanhu wano,’ mbali hunilongele yelihi yondaumtume na niye. Kulonga, ‘Nikumanya kwa zina jako na ninogeligwa na weye.’ <verse eid="EXO 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 33:13" />Ivo one kunogeligwa na niye, nilagusile nzila zako, muladi nikumanye na kugendelela kunogelwa na niye. Ukumbuke kuwa wanhu wa kabila dino ni wako.” <verse eid="EXO 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 33:14" />Mndewa Mulungu kalonga, “Niye nizahita na weye, nizakutenda uhumule.” <verse eid="EXO 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 33:15" />Musa kamulongela, “One huhita hamwe na cheye, sekeuchisegeze hanhu hano. <verse eid="EXO 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 33:16" />Vino nizavimanyaze kuwa kunogeligwa na niye na wanhu wako, one huhitile hamwe na cheye? Uhahita hamwe na cheye izachitenda niye na wanhu wako kuwa wanhu wa chiiyeka mwa iwanhu wako.”<verse eid="EXO 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 33:17" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Nizatenda fana viya viunilongele, kwaviya ninogeligwa na weye na nikumanya kwa zina jako.”<verse eid="EXO 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 33:18" />Musa kalonga, “Nokulamba, nilaguse ukulu wako.”<verse eid="EXO 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 33:19" />Mndewa Mulungu kamwidika, “Nizafosa haulongozi wako na kukulagusa unovu wangu wose. Niye nizagong'onda zina jangu, ‘Mndewa Mulungu.’ Nizamnogela ija yonilonda kumnogela na nizamuwonela ubazi ija yonilonda kumuwonela ubazi.”<verse eid="EXO 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 33:20" />Mbali kalonga, “Sizakuleka uwone chihanga changu, mana munhu yahaniwona niye hawa mgima.” <verse eid="EXO 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 33:21" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Hana hanhu habehi yangu, hondaudahe kwima uchanyha ya luwe. <verse eid="EXO 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 33:22" />Ukulu wangu viufosa, nizakuguma muna imbane muuluwe na kukugubika kwa mkono wangu, mbaka vondanifose. <verse eid="EXO 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 33:23" />Maabaho nizasegeza mkono wangu na kwizaniwona ichisogo, mbali chihanga changu whizachiwona.”<verse eid="EXO 33:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EXO 34" />
  <para style="s">Vibawo va sambi va ukalangama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 10:1-5">Kumbukumbu 10:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 34:1" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Songola vibawo vidi va mabwe vilingile fana viya va mwanduso, niye nizavandika mbuli ziya zonizandike muna ivibawo va mwanduso vouvibenile. <verse eid="EXO 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 34:2" />Isasale igolo imitotondo ukwele kuna ichisuwili cha mulima wa Sinai uiting'hane na niye. <verse eid="EXO 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 34:3" />Munhu yoyose sekeyeze hamwe na weye, na sekeyawoneke hanhu hohose kuna mulima, iviya ng'ombe na ng'hondolo sekewadimigwe kuna mulima.” <verse eid="EXO 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 34:4" />Ivo Musa kasongola vibawo vidi va mabwe fana viya va mwanduso. Igolo yake chilochilo kasegela, kakwela kumulima wa Sinai, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize. Kuno kamha vibawo viya vidi va mabwe muna yamakono yake.<verse eid="EXO 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 34:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kahumuluka muna diwingu, kema na Musa haja. Mndewa Mulungu kagong'onda zina jake. <verse eid="EXO 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 34:6" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kafosa haulongozi ha Musa, kagong'onda, “Mndewa Mulungu, Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu nili na ubazi na unovu, nabule ludoko lwa himahima, nolonda kwa kufunya umoyo na nokwaminika. <verse eid="EXO 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 34:7" />Nowalonda kwa kufunya umoyo nyelesi maelufu, nolekelela ubananzi na uhasanyi, mbali sizaleka kuwatagusa wana na wazukulu wa nyelesi yetatu na yekane za wabananzi.”<verse eid="EXO 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 34:8" />Musa katumbala mavindi himahima mbaka chihanga chake chidalisa hasi na kamtambikila Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 34:9" />Kalonga, “Weye Mndewa Mulungu, fana nikunogeza, nokupula uhite hamwe na cheye. Wanhu wano wana mizoyo midala, mbali uchilekelele wihi wetu na uhasanyi wetu, uchihokele fana wanhu wako mwenyewo.”<verse eid="EXO 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lagano dotendigwa kaidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 34:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Sambi notenda lagano. Haulongozi ha wanhu wako nizatenda mauzauza yaja hayanalawilila muna iisi yose, hebu muna dikabila jojose. Wanhu wose womukala nawo wezawona sang'hano zangu ng'hulu. Kwaviya nizatenda na weye mbuli za mauzauza na za kudumbiza. <verse eid="EXO 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 34:11" />Yamha malagilizo yonikwing'ha diyelo. Nizawawinga haulongozi wako Waamoli na Wakanaani na Wahiti na Wapelizi na Wahivi na Wayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 34:12" />Uiteganye sekeutende lagano na wanhu wokala muna iisi youhita, kwaviya dizakuwa mtego hagati yako. <verse eid="EXO 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 34:13" />Kwizabomola chila lupango lwawo na kuzibena mhanda zawo za kutambikila na mibiki ya milungu yawo ya Ashela.<verse eid="EXO 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 34:14" />“Sekeutambikile milungu imwenga, kwaviya niye Mndewa Mulungu nomanyika kwa zina, ‘Yeli na migongo,’ niye Mulungu yeli na migongo. <verse eid="EXO 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 34:15" />Sekeutende lagano jojose na wanhu wa isi iyo, kwaviya wanhu vondawasondelele milungu yawo fana munhu yotenda ugoni na vondawaitambikile, wezakugoneka. Weye kwizakuja ndiya zowotambikila milungu yawo. <verse eid="EXO 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 34:16" />Uhawasagula wandele wawo wawe wake wa wanago, na wandele wawo wotambikila milungu yawo, wezawasongeza wabwanga zenu wasondelele milungu yawo fana wanhu wowotenda ugoni.<verse eid="EXO 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 34:17" />“Sekeuitendele nyang'hiti za milungu ya zuma.<verse eid="EXO 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 34:18" />“Tenda Dugila da Magate Hayagumigwe Lusu. Kwa siku saba kwizakuja magate hayagumigwe lusu fana vinikulagilize lusita lwikigwe muna umwezi wa Abibu. Kwaviya muna umwezi uwo kulavigwa muna iisi ya Misili.<verse eid="EXO 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 34:19" />“Wana wa udele wose wangu, hamwe na wana wa udele wa chilume wa wanyama wako wose, ng'ombe na ng'hondolo. <verse eid="EXO 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 34:20" />Mbali chaudele wa chihongwe kwizamkombola kwa kunilavila mwanang'hondolo, one humkombole, mbene isingo. Wakombole wanago wa udele wose wa chilume.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:20">“Munhu yoyose sekeyeze kumwangu bila chinhu.<verse eid="EXO 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 34:21" />“Siku sita kwizasang'hana usang'hano, mbali siku yesaba kwizahumula, hata ihawa lusita lwa kulima hebu kugobola kwizahumula.<verse eid="EXO 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 34:22" />“Tenda Dugila da Majuma kwa kuhuna ngano yako mwanduso, na Dugila da Kuduganya Vinhu Vimugobole kuuhelelo wa mwaka.<verse eid="EXO 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 34:23" />“Miyanza mitatu kwa mwaka chila mulume kolondeka kuiduganya haulongozi wangu niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wa Isilaili. <verse eid="EXO 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 34:24" />Nizawawinga wanhu wa zisi zimwenga haulongozi wako kuzongeza mhaka zenu. Habule munhu yoyose yondayaimelele mate isi yako lusita vondauiting'hane kunitambikila niye Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wenu, miyanza mitatu chila mwaka.<verse eid="EXO 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 34:25" />“Sekeunilavile nhosa ya damu na lusu, hebu nhambiko ya Dugila da Pasaka sekeisigazigwe mbaka imitondo.<verse eid="EXO 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 34:26" />“Ndiya ya mwanduso ya isi yako na ndiya inogile kwizaigala kuna ikaye ya Mndewa Mulungu, Mulungu wako.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:26">“Sekeumkimuse mwanaluti muna yamatombo ya mami yake.”<verse eid="EXO 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 34:27" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, “Yandika malagilizo yano, kwaviya kwa mbuli zino nitenda lagano na weye na Waisilaili.” <verse eid="EXO 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 34:28" />Musa kakala uko na Mndewa Mulungu kwa siku malongo mane, imisi na ichilo, hadile chinhu na hang'wile mazi. Kandika muna ivibawo mbuli za lagano na ndagilizi longo.<verse eid="EXO 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kohumuluka muna mulima wa Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 34:29" />Musa viyahumuluke kuna mulima wa Sinai kuno kamha vibawo vidi va ukalangama muna umkono wake vandikigwe mbuli za lagano, havimanyile kuwa chihanga chake chikala chikwaka kwaviya kalonga na Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 34:30" />Haluni na Waisilaili wose viwamuwonile Musa, wadumba kumkwenhukila kwaviya chihanga chake chikala chokwaka. <verse eid="EXO 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 34:31" />Mbali Musa kawatanga Haluni na walala wose wa Isilaili wamkwenhukile, maabaho kalonga nawo. <verse eid="EXO 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 34:32" />Hamwande Waisilaili wamkwenhukila, nayo kaweng'ha ndagilizi zose ziyeng'higwe na Mndewa Mulungu kuja mulima wa Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 34:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 34:33" />Musa viyakomeleze kulonga nawo, kachigubika chihanga chake na chitambala. <verse eid="EXO 34:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 34:34" />Chila lusita Musa viyahitile kulonga na Mndewa Mulungu, kasegeza ichitambala mbaka viyalawile kunze. Viyalawile kunze kawalongela Waisilaili mbuli zose ziyalagilizigwe, <verse eid="EXO 34:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 34:35" />Waisilaili wachiwona chihanga cha Musa chokwaka. Musa kaigubika na chitambala kaidi mbaka lusita viyahitile kulonga na Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 34:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EXO 35" />
  <para style="s">Malagilizo ya Siku ya Mhumulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 35:1" />Musa kawaduganya hamwe Waisilaili wose, kawalongela, “Vino ivo Mndewa Mulungu voyamulagilizeni mutende. <verse eid="EXO 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 35:2" />Kwa siku sita sang'haneni sang'hano zenu, mbali siku yesaba izakuwa yela kumwenu, siku ya kuhumula ya Mndewa Mulungu. Munhu yoyose yondayasang'hane usang'hano muna isiku iyo kolondeka yakomigwe.<verse eid="EXO 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 35:3" />“Hata moto sekemukwache Siku ya Mhumulo.”<verse eid="EXO 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhosa kwa ichimu cha hema da Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 35:4" />Musa kawalongela wanhu wose wa Isilaili, “Chinhu chino icho Mndewa Mulungu choyamulongeleni mutende. <verse eid="EXO 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 35:5" />Soleni nhosa ya kumwing'ha Mndewa Mulungu muna ivinhu venu. Chila munhu yeli na moyo unogile kezamgalila Mndewa Mulungu nhosa ya zahabu na hela na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 35:6" />na nyuzi za buluu na zambalau na ndung'hu na walo dinogile dibotigwe na mazoya ya luti. <verse eid="EXO 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 35:7" />Mbende za ng'hondolo lume zozihakigwe langi ndung'hu na mbende za wanyama wamwenga na mbawo za mkenge, <verse eid="EXO 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 35:8" />na mavuta kwa chiya chitasa, vilungo kwa mavuta yelile na ubani uli na mnung'ho unogile, <verse eid="EXO 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 35:9" />na mabwe yokwaka ya salidoniki na mabwe yokwaka yamwenga kwa ichimu cha mahambo, chifuko cha muimhambaga na chizibawo cha mkulu wa nhambiko.<verse eid="EXO 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Via va hema da Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 35:10" />“Chila munhu yeli na umanyi yeli hagati yenu yeze yatengeneze chila chinhu Mndewa Mulungu chiyalagilize, <verse eid="EXO 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 35:11" />na hema da Mulungu na ngubiko yake na panzia jake na ngwamo zake na mhanda zake na makalilo yake <verse eid="EXO 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 35:12" />na sanduku da lagano na mibiki yake na ngubiko ya chigoda cha ubazi na panzia da hanhu helile ng'hani, <verse eid="EXO 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 35:13" />na meza na mibiki yake ya kwamhila na viya vake vose, hamwe na magate yelile yekigwe haulongozi ha Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 35:14" />Na vinala va chitasa hamwe na via vake vose, vitasa vake na mavuta yake, <verse eid="EXO 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 35:15" />na lupango lwa kufukizila ubani na mibiki yake, mavuta yelile na ubani wili na mnung'ho unogile na panzia da hanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 35:16" />Na lupango lwa kutimbulila nhambiko hamwe na lwavu lwa shaba, mibiki yake hamwe na via vake vose na ziga na kalilo jake, <verse eid="EXO 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 35:17" />na mapanzia ya luwa, na mhanda zake na vikalilo vake vose, panzia da ulwivi lwa luwa, <verse eid="EXO 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 35:18" />na vigingi va hema da Mulungu na vigingi va uluwa na nzabi zake. <verse eid="EXO 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 35:19" />Na mawalo yoyabotigwe vinogile ng'hani kwa ichimu cha sang'hano ya hanhu helile, yaani mawalo yelile ya mkulu wa nhambiko Haluni na wanage kwa ichimu cha sang'hano zawo za ukulu wa nhambiko.”<verse eid="EXO 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wogala nhosa zawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 35:20" />Wanhu wose wa Isilaili wasegela haulongozi wa Musa, <verse eid="EXO 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 35:21" />na chila munhu moyo wake womulonda yeze kumgalila nhosa Mndewa Mulungu kwa ichimu cha hema da Mulungu na kwa ichimu cha usang'hano wa hema ijo, na kwa mawalo yayo yelile ya ukulu wa nhambiko. <verse eid="EXO 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 35:22" />Wose weli na moyo wa kuinyendanyenda, walume kwa wanaake wagala heleni za kuvala muna imhula na heleni za kuvala muna yamagutwi na mhete za mihuli na bangili na chila chinhu cha zahabu, chila munhu kamulavila Mndewa Mulungu chinhu cha zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 35:23" />Wanhu wose wagala nyuzi zawo za buluu na zambalau na ndung'hu na chitani chinogile hebu mazoya ya luti hebu mbende za ng'hondolo dihakigwe langi ndung'hu hebu mbende za wanyama wamwenga. <verse eid="EXO 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 35:24" />Chila munhu yadahile kulava hela hebu shaba, kaigala kwa Mndewa Mulungu fana nhosa yake. Iviya chila munhu yakalile na mbawo za mkenge kwa sang'hano yoyose kazigala. <verse eid="EXO 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 35:25" />Wanaake wose wadahile kubota, wagala vinhu vibotigwe kwa nyuzi za langi ya buluu na zambalau na ndung'hu na walo dinogile dibotigwe vinogile. <verse eid="EXO 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 35:26" />Wanaake wose mizoyo yawo yowalonda kuwatendela, wabota mazoya ya luti. <verse eid="EXO 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 35:27" />Walangulizi wagala mabwe ya yotangigwa salidoniki na mabwe ya kwikigwa muna ichifuko cha muna imhambaga na chizibawo. <verse eid="EXO 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 35:28" />Iviya wagala vilungo na mavuta ya mzaituni kwa ichimu cha chitasa na mavuta yelile na ubani uli na mnung'ho unogile. <verse eid="EXO 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 35:29" />Waisilaili wose walume kwa wanaake, walondile muna imizoyo yawo kugala chinhu chochose kwa kusang'hana usang'hano uja Mndewa Mulungu uyamulagilize Musa usang'hanike, wagala vinhu ivo kuwa nhambiko ya kulonda wenyewo kwa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wasang'hani wotenda hema jelile da Mndewa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 35:30" />Musa kawalongela Waisilaili, “Mndewa Mulungu kamsagula Bezaleli, mwana wa Uli, mzukulu wa Huli kulawa kabila da Yuda. <verse eid="EXO 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 35:31" />Mulungu kammemeza muhe wake na kamwing'ha udahi na nzewele na umanyi na ufundi <verse eid="EXO 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 35:32" />muladi yatole sang'hano za umanyi, yahonde zahabu na hela na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 35:33" />na kusongola mabwe ya kuhamba na kusongola mibiki na kutenda ufundi wa chila modeli. <verse eid="EXO 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 35:34" />Iviya kamulongoza yeye na Oholiabu mwana wa Ahisamaki, wa kabila da Dani wadahe kuwafunza wamwenga. <verse eid="EXO 35:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 35:35" />Mndewa Mulungu kawatenda wadahe kusang'hana chila sang'hano ya ufundi hebu yoitendigwa na wanhu wa umanyi hebu mafundi wa kutalizi kwa nyuzi za langi ya buluu na zambalau na ndung'hu na walo dinogile dibotigwe kwa kusang'hanila ufundi wowose wa msanii.<verse eid="EXO 35:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EXO 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 36:1" />“Bezaleli na Oholiabu na wasang'hani wamwenga waja Mndewa Mulungu yaweng'hile nzewele na umanyi, waja wavimanyile kutenda chila chinhu chilondeka kuzengela hema da Mulungu, wezatenda chila chinhu fana viya Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.”<verse eid="EXO 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu wogala vitumetume vingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 36:2" />Musa kamtanga Bezaleli na Oholiabu na mafundi wamwenga waja Mndewa Mulungu yaweng'hile udahi, wowolonda kutaza. Musa kawalongela wanduse usang'hano. <verse eid="EXO 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 36:3" />Wahokela kulawa kwa Musa vinhu vose vilavigwe na Waisilaili kwa ichimu cha sang'hano za hema da Mulungu. Wanhu wagendelela kumgalila Musa nhambiko zawo chila imitondo kwa kulonda wenyewo. <verse eid="EXO 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 36:4" />Ivo wanhu waja weli na ufundi watendile sang'hano zose muna dihema wahita <verse eid="EXO 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 36:5" />na wamulongela Musa, “Wanhu wagala vinhu vingi kufosa viya vilondeka kwa usang'hano uja uyachilagilize Mndewa Mulungu chiusang'hane.”<verse eid="EXO 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 36:6" />Musa kalagiliza na mbuli iyo igong'ondigwa muna dilago, “Chila munhu, mulume hebu mwanamke, sekeyagale vitumetume vingi kwa ichimu cha hema da Mulungu.” Wanhu wagomesigwa kugala vinhu, <verse eid="EXO 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 36:7" />kwaviya vinhu viwagalile vifaya kwa sang'hano iyo yose na vimwenga visigala.<verse eid="EXO 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutenda hema da Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 26:1-37">Kulawa 26:1-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 36:8" />Walume wose weli na udahi wazenga hema da Mulungu kwa mapanzia longo ya mawalo yanogile yabotigwe kwa nyuzi za langi ya buluu na za zambalau na ndung'hu na kuhamba vilumbe walingile fana wasenga wa kuulanga wasongoligwe na fundi. <verse eid="EXO 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 36:9" />Mapanzia yose yakala na utali wa mita longo na mbili na ugalamu mita mbili. Mapanzia yose yakala na ningo imwe. <verse eid="EXO 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 36:10" />Kayalumbiliza mapanzia matano kutenda panzia dimwe na kutenda ivo ivo yaja yamwenga matano. <verse eid="EXO 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 36:11" />Kasona vitanzi va buluu muna imhindo ya dipanzia da uhelelo da chihande cha mwanduso, vitanzi vimwenga muna dipanzia da uhelelo da chihande cha uhelelo. <verse eid="EXO 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 36:12" />Kagela vitanzi malongo matano muna dipanzia da mwanduso da chihande cha mwanduso na vitanzi malongo matano muna uhelelo wa panzia dekaidi, vitanzi vose viilola. <verse eid="EXO 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 36:13" />Maabaho katengeneza vihindo malongo matano va zahabu muladi kulumbilizila vihande vidi va panzia, ivo hema da Mulungu diwa chinhu chimwe.<verse eid="EXO 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 36:14" />Iviya katenda ngubiko imwenga ya hema jelile kwa mapanzia longo na dimwe ya mazoya ya luti. <verse eid="EXO 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 36:15" />Wayatenda yose yailinge, utali wa mita longo na tatu na ugalamu mita mbili. <verse eid="EXO 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 36:16" />Kayalumbiliza mapanzia matano hamwe na mapanzia sita hamwe. <verse eid="EXO 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 36:17" />Maabaho kagela vitanzi malongo matano muna imhindo ya panzia da uhelelo da chihande cha mwanduso na vitanzi malongo matano muna imhindo ya chihande chekaidi. <verse eid="EXO 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 36:18" />Maabaho katenda vihindo malongo matano va shaba muladi kulumbiliza viya vihande vidi va mapanzia, muladi kutenda panzia dimwe da hema. <verse eid="EXO 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 36:19" />Maabaho katenda ngubiko ya mbende sisili ya bebelu da ng'hondolo dihakigwe langi ndung'hu uchanyha ya ngubiko imwenga ya mbende sisili ya mnyama imwenga.<verse eid="EXO 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 36:20" />Maabaho katenda mibiki ya mkenge ya kwimizila dihema. <verse eid="EXO 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 36:21" />Chila mbiki ukala na utali wa mita nne na ugalamu wa sentimita malongo sita na sita. <verse eid="EXO 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 36:22" />Chila mbiki ukala na ndimi mbili za kulumbilizila. Mibiki yose ya hema kaitendela ndimi. <verse eid="EXO 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 36:23" />Katenda mibiki malongo maidi ubanzi wa kusi wa hema <verse eid="EXO 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 36:24" />na vikalilo malongo mane va hela hasi ya mibiki iyo malongo maidi hasi ya chila mbiki muladi kwamhilila ziya zindimi zake mbili. <verse eid="EXO 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 36:25" />Ubanzi wa kasikazi wa hema, katenda mibiki malongo maidi <verse eid="EXO 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 36:26" />na vikalilo vake malongo mane va hela, vikalilo vidi hasi ya chila mbiki. <verse eid="EXO 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 36:27" />Kwa ubanzi wa kuchisogo wili uswelo wa zuwa wa hema katenda mibiki sita. <verse eid="EXO 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 36:28" />Iviyakatenda mibiki midi kwa ichimu cha vingobweda va dihema ubanzi wake wa kuchisogo. <verse eid="EXO 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 36:29" />Mibiki iyo ya hasi iileke mbali ilumbilizigwe kwa kuchanyha kuna imhete imwe. Mibiki yose ya ivingobweda kaitenda ivo ivo muladi itende mbili. <verse eid="EXO 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 36:30" />Ivo kukala na mibiki minane hamwe na vikalilo vake longo na sita va hela.<verse eid="EXO 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 36:31" />Iviya katenda mapalo ya mkenge, mapalo matano kwa ichimu cha mibiki ya ubanzi umwe wa hema, <verse eid="EXO 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 36:32" />mapalo matano kwa ichimu cha ubanzi umwenga wa hema, na mapalo matano kwa ichimu cha mibiki ya kuchisogo cha hema na ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa. <verse eid="EXO 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 36:33" />Katenda palo da hagati difikile nusu ya zengo da hema dodiibebenyeke hagati kulawa uhelelo umwe mbaka uhelelo umwenga wa hema. <verse eid="EXO 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 36:34" />Mibiki yose kaihaka zahabu na kaitendela mhete za zahabu za kwamhilila mapalo yayo yahakigwe zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 36:35" />Katenda panzia da nyuzi za langi ya buluu na zambalau na ndung'hu na walo dinogile dibotigwe. Panzia ijo dihambigwa vinogile kwa vilumbe vilingile fana wasenga wa kuulanga wasongoligwe na fundi. <verse eid="EXO 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 36:36" />Katumbika dipanzia muna izimhanda nne za mkenge zihakigwe zahabu, zili na ngwamo za zahabu na vikalilo vine va hela. <verse eid="EXO 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 36:37" />Iviya katenda panzia da nyuzi za langi ya buluu na za zambalau na ndung'hu na walo dinogile dibotigwe kwa ichimu cha hanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema. Panzia dihambigwa vinogile. <verse eid="EXO 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 36:38" />Katenda mhanda zake tano hamwe na ngwamo za zahabu. Hanhu ha uchanyha yake na vihindo vake kavihaka zahabu, mbali vikalilo vake vitano vikala va shaba.<verse eid="EXO 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EXO 37" />
  <para style="s">Kutenda sanduku da lagano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 25:10-22">Kulawa 25:10-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 37:1" />Bezaleli katenda sanduku da lagano kwa mibiki ya mkenge, utali wake ukala sentimita gana na longo, ugalamu wake sentimita malongo sita na chimo chake sentimita malongo sita na sita. <verse eid="EXO 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 37:2" />Kahaka zahabu yelile mgati na kunze na kaditendela lukingilo lwa zahabu banzi zose. <verse eid="EXO 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 37:3" />Maabaho katenda mhete nne za zahabu za kudipapila muna imigulu yake mine, mhete mbili ubanzi wake umwe na mhete mbili ubanzi wake wekaidi. <verse eid="EXO 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 37:4" />Katenda mibiki ya kupapila ya mkenge na kuhaka zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 37:5" />Mibiki iyo kaifoseza muna zimhete zili muna zibanzi mbili za sanduku kwa ichimu cha kupapila. <verse eid="EXO 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 37:6" />Maabaho katenda ngubiko ya zahabu yelile, utali wake sentimita gana na longo na ugalamu wake ukala sentimita malongo sita na sita. <verse eid="EXO 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 37:7" />Maabaho kasongola vilumbe vidi vilingile fana wasenga wa kuulanga kwa kuhonda zahabu hana imihelelo ya ngubiko iyo, <verse eid="EXO 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 37:8" />chilumbe chimwe uhelelo umwe na chilumbe chimwenga uhelelo umwenga. Katenda vilumbe wawo walingile fana wasenga wa kuulanga kuna imihelelo ya ngubiko iyo, viwa chinhu chimwe na ngubiko. <verse eid="EXO 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 37:9" />Vilumbe ivo vilingile fana wasenga wa kuulanga vikunjula mabawa yawo kugubika ngubiko ya kuiumba. Vilumbe ivo viihindukila kuilola ngubiko iyo.<verse eid="EXO 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusongola meza ya magate yelile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 25:23-30">Kulawa 25:23-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 37:10" />Kasongola meza ya mbiki wa mkenge, utali wake sentimita malongo manane na nane na ugalamu wake sentimita malongo mane na nne na chimo chake sentimita malongo sita na sita. <verse eid="EXO 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 37:11" />Kaihaka zahabu yelile na kuitendela lukingilo lwa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 37:12" />Maabaho kachizungulusila lukingilo lumwenga lwa zahabu lwili na ugalamu wa sentimita nane. <verse eid="EXO 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 37:13" />Kaitendela imeza iyo mhete nne za zahabu na kuziguma muna ivingobweda vake vine haimile imigulu. <verse eid="EXO 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 37:14" />Mhete izo zikala habehi na lukingilo luja lwa kuzunguluka meza na zikala za kwamhilila mibiki ya kupapila imeza iyo. <verse eid="EXO 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 37:15" />Katenda mibiki ya mkenge ya kupapila, maabaho kaihaka zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 37:16" />Katenda via va zahabu yelile va kwika uchanyha ya meza, vyano na nhungo kwa ichimu cha ubani na mabuyu na vihamha kwa ichimu cha kugidila nhosa za ching'waji.<verse eid="EXO 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutenda chinala cha chitasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 25:31-40">Kulawa 25:31-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 37:17" />Katenda chinala cha chitasa kwa zahabu yelile. Itendigwe kwa kuhonda, kalilo jake na mbiki wake na nhungo zake na matumba yake na maluwa yake, vose vitendigwa kwa chihande chimwe. <verse eid="EXO 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 37:18" />Matambi sita yalawilila hana ichinala cha lukingo lwake, matambi matatu ubanzi umwe na matambi matatu ubanzi umwenga. <verse eid="EXO 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 37:19" />Muna ditambi kuna nhungo nhatu zilingile fana matumba na maluwa yotangigwa alimondi, muna ditambi disondelela kuna tumba jake na luwa jake. Matambi yose sita yawa fana viya chinala cha chitasa <verse eid="EXO 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 37:20" />Na muna ichinala muna nhungo nne zozitendigwe zilingile fana maluwa yotangigwa alimondi, hamwe na ving'honyo va maluwa yake. <verse eid="EXO 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 37:21" />Hanhu halawilila chila jozi ya matambi yaja sita, hasi yake hana tumba dimwe dimwe. <verse eid="EXO 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 37:22" />Matumba yayo na matambi yake yawa yake, yawa chinhu chimwe. Chinala icho chose chihondigwa kwa zahabu yelile. <verse eid="EXO 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 37:23" />Maabaho katenda vitasa vake saba na makoleo yake na vyano vake kwa zahabu yelile. <verse eid="EXO 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 37:24" />Katenda chinala icho na via vake vose kwa vibaba malongo matatu na tano va zahabu yelile.<verse eid="EXO 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutenda lupango lwa kusomela ubani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 30:1-5">Kulawa 30:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 37:25" />Maabaho kazenga lupango lwa kusomela ubani kwa mbiki wa mkenge. Utali wa lupango ulo na ugalamu viilinga, utali ukala sentimita malongo mane na tano na ugalamu ukala sentimita malongo mane na tano na chimo chake sentimita malongo kenda. Mahembe ya lupango ulo yakala chinhu chimwe na lupango lwenyewo. <verse eid="EXO 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 37:26" />Kachihaka zahabu yelile, ubanzi wake wa kuchanyha na banzi zake na mahembe yake, iviya katenda lukingo lwa zahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 37:27" />Kaitendela mhete mbili za zahabu hasi ya ulukingo hana zibanzi mbili zoziihindukile. Mhete izo zamhilila mibiki ya kupapila. <verse eid="EXO 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 37:28" />Katenda mibiki midi ya mkenge na kaihaka zahabu.<verse eid="EXO 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutenda mavuta yelile na ubani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 30:22-38">Kulawa 30:22-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 37:29" />Iviya katenda mavuta yelile na ubani wili na mnung'ho unogile fana mwenzi wa mavuta yonung'hila goya.<verse eid="EXO 37:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EXO 38" />
  <para style="s">Kutenda lupango lwa kutimbulila nhambiko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 27:1-8">Kulawa 27:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 38:1" />Kazenga lupango lwa kutimbulila nhambiko kwa mibiki ya mkenge. Utali na ugalamu wa lupango ulo viilinga, mita mbili na lobo kwa mita imwe na lobo, na utali wake mita mbili na lobo. <verse eid="EXO 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 38:2" />Katenda mahembe mane, chila ubanzi hembe dimwe. Mahembe yayo yawa chinhu chimwe na ulupango, kaluhaka shaba lupango lose. <verse eid="EXO 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 38:3" />Katenda via vake, vizae va kuzolela maivu na vizae va kuhalila moto na mibano na magembe na vizae vake. Vinhu vose vihakigwa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 38:4" />Kachitendela ulupango lwavu lwa shaba, kalwika hasi ya lukingilo lwa ulupango mbaka hagati ya ulupango. <verse eid="EXO 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 38:5" />Katenda mhete nne za shaba za kupapila ulupango, kaziguma chila chingobweda mhete imwe. <verse eid="EXO 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 38:6" />Katenda mibiki ya mkenge na kuihaka shaba <verse eid="EXO 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 38:7" />na kaiguma mibiki ija muna zimhete ziya zikalile mumgwazo wa ulupango muladi kulupapa. Lupango ulo lukala na uvungu.<verse eid="EXO 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuumba ziga kwa shaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 30:17-21">Kulawa 30:17-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 38:8" />Maabaho kaumba ziga kwa shaba na kalilo jake da shaba, ziga ijo ditendigwa kwa vilole va shaba va wanaake wasang'hanile hana ihanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutenda luwa lwa hema da Mulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 27:9-19">Kulawa 27:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 38:9" />Maabaho katengeneza luwa. Mapanzia ya ubanzi wa kusi wa uluwa yakala ya chitani ibotigwe vinogile na yeli na utali wa mita malongo mane na nne. <verse eid="EXO 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 38:10" />Yamhililigwa na mhanda malongo maidi za shaba zili na vikalilo malongo maidi va shaba. Mbali ngwamo za mhanda izo na vihindo vake vikala va hela. <verse eid="EXO 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 38:11" />Ubanzi wa kasikazi utali wa panzia ukala mita malongo mane na nne na mhanda zake malongo maidi za shaba, mbali ngwamo za mhanda izo na vihindo vake vikala va hela.<verse eid="EXO 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 38:12" />Ubanzi wa uswelo wa zuwa ukala na panzia dili na utali wa mita malongo maidi na mbili, mhanda zake longo na vikalilo vake longo, ngwamo za mhanda izo na vihindo vake vikala va hela. <verse eid="EXO 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 38:13" />Ubanzi wa ulawilo wa zuwa, hakalile na ulwivi, ubanzi uwo ukala na ugalamu wa mita malongo maidi na mbili. <verse eid="EXO 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 38:14" />Panzia da ubanzi umwe wa lwivi dikala na ugalamu wa mita sita na nusu, mhanda nhatu na vikalilo vake vitatu, <verse eid="EXO 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 38:15" />iviya ubanzi umwenga ukala na panzia dili na ugalamu wa mita sita na nusu, hamwe na mhanda nhatu na vikalilo vake. <verse eid="EXO 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 38:16" />Mapanzia yose kuluzunguluka uluwa yakala ya walo dinogile dibotigwe. <verse eid="EXO 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 38:17" />Vikalilo vose va mhanda vikala va shaba, mbali ngwamo za mhanda izo na vihindo vake vikala va hela. Iviya hanhu ha uchanyha ha mhanda hakala ha hela na mhanda zake zose zizakwamhigwa na vinhu va hela.<verse eid="EXO 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 38:18" />Panzia da lwivi lwa luwa ditendigwa kwa luzi lwa langi ya buluu na zambalau na ndung'hu na walo dinogile dibotigwe na kuhambigwa vinogile, najo dikala na utali wa mita kenda na chimo mita mbili. Dilinga fana mapanzia ya uluwa. <verse eid="EXO 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 38:19" />Iviya mhanda zake zikala nne na vikalilo vine va shaba. Ngwamo zake zikala za hela, hanhu ha uchanyha ha mhanda na mango zake vizakwamhigwa na vinhu va hela. <verse eid="EXO 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 38:20" />Vigingi vose va hema na va luwa mumgwazo wa dihema vikala va shaba.<verse eid="EXO 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Via va hema da Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 38:21" />Ino iyo peta ya via visang'haniligwe kwika hema da kwika goya vibawo va ukalangama. Peta ino isasaligwa na Walawi kwa ndagilizi ya Musa, muna ulongozi wa Isamali mwana wa mkulu wa nhambiko Haluni.<verse eid="EXO 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 38:22" />Bezaleli mwana wa Uli, mzukulu wa Huli, wa kabila da Yuda, watenda chila chinhu Mndewa Mulungu choyamulagilize Musa. <verse eid="EXO 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 38:23" />Katazigwa na Oholiabu mwana wa Ahisamaki wa kabila da Dani, yoyakalile galu wa kuhamba, kuchola na kuhamba kwa nyuzi za langi ya buluu na zambalau na ndung'hu na walo dinogile dibotigwe.<verse eid="EXO 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 38:24" />Zahabu yose yowamulavile Mndewa Mulungu kwa kwinula uchanyha kwa ichimu cha kuzengela hema da Mulungu, ikala ya chilo magana manane na malongo saba na saba na gilamu magana matatu, ningo fana viili kwa sang'hano za hema da Mulungu.<verse eid="EXO 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 38:25" />Hela yowailavile wanhu wa makabila ikala chilo elufu tatu na longo na saba na gilamu magana saba na malongo matano. <verse eid="EXO 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 38:26" />Chila munhu yapetigwe kwandusila miyaka malongo maidi na kugendelela, kalava mchango wake wa nusu shekeli ya hela, na walume wose wapetigwe wakala laki sita na elufu tatu na magana matano malongo matano. <verse eid="EXO 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 38:27" />Chilo elufu nhatu za hela zisang'haniligwa kutendela vikalilo viya gana va hema da Mulungu na diya dipanzia, chilo malongo matatu kwa chila chikalilo. <verse eid="EXO 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 38:28" />Ziya chilo longo na saba na gilamu malongo saba na tano zozisigale, zisang'haniligwa kutengenezela ngwamo za mhanda na kuhaka hanhu ha uchanyha ha mhanda na kuitendela lukingilo.<verse eid="EXO 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 38:29" />Shaba ziya Waisilaili zowamulavile Mndewa Mulungu kwa kwinula uchanyha zikala shekeli 212,400 za hela. <verse eid="EXO 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 38:30" />Bezaleli kasang'hanila shaba iyo kutendela vikalilo va hanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu, lupango lwa shaba hamwe na lwavu lwa shaba na via vose va lupango. <verse eid="EXO 38:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 38:31" />Vikalilo va luwa luzunguluke hema da Mulungu na va ulwivi lwa luwa na vigingi vose va hema da Mulungu na va luwa.<verse eid="EXO 38:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EXO 39" />
  <para style="s">Kutenda mawalo ya wakulu wa nhambiko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 28:1-14">Kulawa 28:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 39:1" />Kwa nyuzi za langi ya buluu na zambalau na ndung'hu, wabota mawalo ya kuvala lusita lwa kulava nhambiko hanhu helile. Wamsonela Haluni mawalo yelile fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 39:2" />Watenda chizibawo cha nyuzi za zahabu na nyuzi za langi ya buluu na zambalau na ndung'hu na walo dinogile dibotigwe. <verse eid="EXO 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 39:3" />Wahonda zahabu iyo mbaka iwa sisili ng'hani na kukanha nyuzi, muladi kuzibota hamwe na nyuzi za langi ya buluu na za zambalau na ndung'hu na walo dinogile dibotigwe vinogile. <verse eid="EXO 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 39:4" />Chizibawo icho chitendigwa kwa nzabi muna yamayega zozisonigwe kuna imihelelo yake midi. <verse eid="EXO 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 39:5" />Mkwiji ubotigwa goya mchanyha yake muladi kuifunga, ukala chinhu chimwe na chizibawo icho. Utendigwa kwa vinhu ivo ivo, nyuzi za zahabu na nyuzi za buluu na za zambalau na ndung'hu na walo dinogile dibotigwe, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 39:6" />Wasasala mabwe ya salidoniki na kuyahamba na kuyengiza muna ivihindo va zahabu, yacholigwa fana munhu voyochola muhuli, mazina longo na maidi ya wana wa Isilaili. <verse eid="EXO 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 39:7" />Wayeka mabwe yayo muna ivihande va muna yamayega va chizibawo chiya muladi kulagusa makabila longo na maidi ya Isilaili, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutenda chifuko cha muna imhambaga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 28:15-30">Kulawa 28:15-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 39:8" />Katenda chifuko cha muna imhambaga fana viya viyatendile ichizibawo chiya, kwa nyuzi za zahabu na nyuzi za langi ya buluu na ya zambalau na ndung'hu na kwa walo dinogile dibotigwe. <verse eid="EXO 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 39:9" />Utali wa chifuko icho na ugalamu wake vikala voilinga, utali sentimita malongo maidi na mbili, ugalamu sentimita malongo maidi na mbili, nacho chikunjigwa. <verse eid="EXO 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 39:10" />Chihambigwa na misitali mine ya mabwe ya bei ng'hulu. Msitali wa mwanduso ukala wa hakiki na topazi na alimasi ndung'hu. <verse eid="EXO 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 39:11" />Msitali wekaidi ukala wa zumalidi na johali ya langi ya buluu na alimasi. <verse eid="EXO 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 39:12" />Msitali weketatu ukala wa yasito na agate na amesisito. <verse eid="EXO 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 39:13" />Msitali wekane ukala wa zabalajadi na shohamu na yasipi, yose yagumigwa muna ivihindo va zahabu <verse eid="EXO 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 39:14" />Hakala na mabwe longo na maidi yoyacholigwe mazina longo na maidi ya wana wa Isilaili. Yakala yacholigwa fana viwochola muhuli, chila dibwe dicholigwa zina kulagusa makabila longo na maidi.<verse eid="EXO 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 39:15" />Kwa ichimu cha chifuko icho cha mwiimhambaga, katengeneza mikufu ya zahabu yelile ibotigwe fana luzabi. <verse eid="EXO 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 39:16" />Iviya kachitengenezela ichifuko cha muimhambaga vihindo va zahabu na mhete mbili za zahabu na kuziguma muna zimhembe mbili za chifuko icho. <verse eid="EXO 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 39:17" />Mikufu iyo midi ya zahabu waifunga muna zimhete izo za zimhembe za chifuko cha muimhambaga. <verse eid="EXO 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 39:18" />Zimhembe ziya mbili za mikufu ya zahabu waziguma muna ivihindo viya vidi na wazilumbiliza na ivihande viya vidi va muna yamayega ya chizibawo, ubanzi wa kuulongozi. <verse eid="EXO 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 39:19" />Watenda mhete mbili za zahabu na waziguma kuna zimhembe mbili za hasi ubanzi wa mgati wa chifuko cha muimhambaga habehi na chizibawo. <verse eid="EXO 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 39:20" />Watenda mhete zimwenga mbili za zahabu na waziguma kuulongozi hana zimhembe za hasi za vihande va chizibawo, hanhu hochiilumba na mkwiji uja ubotigwe vinogile. <verse eid="EXO 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 39:21" />Wafunga chifuko cha muimhambaga hana ichizibawo kwa kulumbiliza mhete zake na chizibawo kwa luzabi lwa buluu, muladi chifuko icho sekechihagaye ila chikalile mkwiji uja ubotigwe vinogile, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutenda mawalo yamwenga ya ukulu wa nhambiko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 28:31-43">Kulawa 28:31-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 39:22" />Katenda joho da kuvala mgati ya chizibawo cha nyuzi za langi ya buluu. <verse eid="EXO 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 39:23" />Joho ijo dikala na nyafasi ya kufosezela ditwi hagati, najo dizungulusiligwa lukingilo lubotigwe muladi sekedidegeke. <verse eid="EXO 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 39:24" />Kuna imhindo ya hasi ya dijoho wabota mahambo ya makomamanga ya nyuzi za langi ya buluu na za zambalau na ndung'hu na walo dinogile dibotigwe vinogile. <verse eid="EXO 39:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 39:25" />Maabaho watenda mbugi za zahabu yelile, chila dihafosa komamanga dimwe weka mbugi hana imhindo ya dijoho. <verse eid="EXO 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 39:26" />Ivo mbugi na komamanga, mbugi na komamanga, viyandakana kuizunguluka imhindo ya joho ijo, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 39:27" />Wawatendela Haluni na wanage majoho ya chitani inogile. <verse eid="EXO 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 39:28" />Chilemba cha chitani inogile na kofiya ya chitani inogile na kaputula za chitani ibotigwe vinogile, <verse eid="EXO 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 39:29" />na mikwiji ya walo dinogile dibotigwe kwa nyuzi za langi ya buluu na ya zambalau na ndung'hu na kuihamba vinogile, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 39:30" />Watenda chihande cha zahabu yelile kwa ichimu cha chilemba chelile kwa zahabu yelile na kuchola uchanyha yake fana viwacholile muhuli, “Yelile kwa Mndewa Mulungu.” <verse eid="EXO 39:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 39:31" />Maabaho wachifunga kwa luzabi lwa langi ya buluu haulongozi wa ichilemba chiya, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulongele Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukomelezeka kwa sang'hano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 35:10-19">Kulawa 35:10-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 39:32" />Ivo sang'hano yose ya hema da Mulungu ikomelezeka. Waisilaili watenda chila chinhu fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 39:33" />Maabaho wadigala dihema da Mulungu kwa Musa, hamwe na via vake vose, vihindo vake na mibiki yake na mapalo yake na mhanda zake na vikalilo vake, <verse eid="EXO 39:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 39:34" />na ngubiko ya mbende za ng'hondolo lume yoihakigwe langi ndung'hu na ngubiko ya mbende za wanyama wamwenga na panzia da hanhu helile, <verse eid="EXO 39:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 39:35" />na sanduku da lagano na mibiki yake na ngubiko ya kuilumba, <verse eid="EXO 39:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 39:36" />na meza na via vake vose na magate yelile yekigwe haulongozi ha Mulungu, <verse eid="EXO 39:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 39:37" />na chinala cha chitasa cha zahabu na vitasa vake, via vake vose na mavuta ya vitasa ivo, <verse eid="EXO 39:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 39:38" />na lupango lwa zahabu, mavuta yelile na ubani uli na mnung'ho unogile na panzia da hanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu, <verse eid="EXO 39:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 39:39" />na lupango lwa shaba na lwavu lwake lwa shaba, mibiki yake na via vake vose na ziga na kalilo jake, <verse eid="EXO 39:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 39:40" />na mapanzia ya luwa, mhanda zake na vikalilo vake na panzia da lwivi lwa luwa na nzabi zake na vigingi vake na via vose vovilondeke kuna isang'hano ya hema da Mulungu, iviya dotangigwa hema da Mulungu <verse eid="EXO 39:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 39:41" />na mawalo yabotigwe vinogile kwa ichimu cha sang'hano ya hanhu helile, yaani mawalo yelile ya mkulu wa nhambiko Haluni na ya wanage kwa ichimu cha sang'hano ya ukulu wa nhambiko.<verse eid="EXO 39:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 39:42" />Waisilaili wasang'hana sang'hano zose fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 39:43" />Musa kalola chila chinhu, kawona Waisilaili wasang'hana chila chinhu fana Mndewa Mulungu viyalagilize. Ivo Musa kawatemela mate.<verse eid="EXO 39:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EXO 40" />
  <para style="s">Hema jelile dosimikigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 40:1" />Maabaho Mndewa Mulungu kamulongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 40:2" />“Siku ya mwanduso ya mwezi wa mwanduso, kwizasimika hema da Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 40:3" />Muna dihema ijo mwizakuwa na sanduku da lagano, maabaho ika panzia haulongozi hake. <verse eid="EXO 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 40:4" />Digale hana imeza na wike via vake uchanyha. Maabaho chigale chinala cha chitasa na wike vitasa vake uchanyha. <verse eid="EXO 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 40:5" />Maabaho kwizakwika lupango lwa zahabu lwa kusomela ubani haulongozi wa sanduku da lagano, maabaho kwizatumbika panzia hana ihanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 40:6" />Kwizakwika lupango lwa kutimbulila nhambiko haulongozi wa hanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 40:7" />Kwizakwika ziga hagati ya hema da Mulungu na lupango, kwizaguma mazi muna diziga ijo. <verse eid="EXO 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 40:8" />Maabaho kwizazenga luwa na kutumbika panzia hana ulwivi lwake.<verse eid="EXO 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 40:9" />“Maabaho kwizasola mavuta yelile na kudihaka hema da Mulungu hamwe na vinhu vake vose na kudibagula na vinhu vake vose, najo dizakuwa jela. <verse eid="EXO 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 40:10" />Maabaho kwizabagula ulupango lwa kutimbulila nhambiko na via vake vose kwa kuluhaka mavuta yelile, nalo lwizakuwa lwela ng'hani. <verse eid="EXO 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 40:11" />Maabaho kwizadibagula diziga na kalilo jake na kuvihaka mavuta fana ivo ivo.<verse eid="EXO 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 40:12" />“Mgale Haluni na wanage hana ihanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu, maabaho uwanave. <verse eid="EXO 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 40:13" />Maabaho mvaze Haluni mawalo yelile, muhake mavuta yelile na umbagule muladi yadahe kunisang'hanila fana mkulu wa nhambiko. <verse eid="EXO 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 40:14" />Kwizawasola wanage na kuwavaza ng'hanzu. <verse eid="EXO 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 40:15" />Maabaho uwahake mavuta yelile fana viya viumuhakile tati yawo, muladi wadahe kunisang'hanila fana wakulu wa nhambiko. Kuhakigwa kwawo mavuta yelile kwizawengiza muna ukulu wa nhambiko siku zose muna zinyelesi zawo zose.”<verse eid="EXO 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 40:16" />Musa katenda chila chinhu fana viya Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize. <verse eid="EXO 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 40:17" />Mwezi wa mwanduso muna mwaka wekaidi, siku ya mwanduso ya mwezi, hema da Mulungu disimikigwa. <verse eid="EXO 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 40:18" />Musa viyasimike hema da Mulungu, keka vikalilo vake na kwinula mibiki yake, kalumbiliza mapalo yake na kusimika mhanda zake. <verse eid="EXO 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 40:19" />Kanzanza panzia uchanyha ya hema da Mulungu na keka ngubiko ya hema uchanyha yake, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa. <verse eid="EXO 40:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 40:20" />Maabaho kasola vibawo viya vidi na kuvika hana disanduku diya da ukalangama. Kaifoseza imibiki ija hana zimhete za sanduku na keka ngubiko ya kuilumba uchanyha yake. <verse eid="EXO 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 40:21" />Maabaho kadika disanduku da lagano muna dihema da Mulungu na kutumbika panzia, kwa kutenda ivo kadifisa disanduku da lagano fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulongele Musa.<verse eid="EXO 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 40:22" />Musa keka meza mgati ya hema da Mulungu, ubanzi wa kasikazi, kunze ya panzia, <verse eid="EXO 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 40:23" />na uchanyha yake kapanga magate haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu fana viyalagilizigwe na Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 40:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 40:24" />Keka chinala cha chitasa muna dihema da Mulungu, ubanzi wa kusi, viilola na imeza. <verse eid="EXO 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 40:25" />Kemiza vitasa vake haulongozi wa Mndewa Mulungu, fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize. <verse eid="EXO 40:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 40:26" />Keka lupango lwa zahabu muna dihema da Mulungu kuulongozi wa panzia, <verse eid="EXO 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 40:27" />na kasoma ubani uli na mnung'ho unogile uchanyha yake, fana viyalagilizigwe na Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 40:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 40:28" />Katumbika panzia hana ihanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu, <verse eid="EXO 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 40:29" />Musa keka lupango lwa kutimbulila nhambiko hana ihanhu ha kwingilila muna dihema da Mulungu. Uchanyha yake kalava nhambiko ya kutimbula na nhosa ya usage, fana viyalagilizigwe na Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 40:30" />Kadika diziga hagati ya dihema da Mulungu na lupango na kuguma mazi ya kunawa. <verse eid="EXO 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 40:31" />Musa na Haluni na wana wa Haluni, wose wanawa makono yawo na migulu yawo umo. <verse eid="EXO 40:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 40:32" />Viwengile mgati ya hema da Mulungu hebu viwakwenhukile ulupango, wanawa fana Mndewa Mulungu viyamulagilize Musa. <verse eid="EXO 40:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 40:33" />Musa kemiza luwa kuzunguluka hema da Mulungu na lupango, na keka panzia hana ulwivi lwa luwa. Ivo Musa kakomeleza sang'hano yose.<verse eid="EXO 40:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wingu uchanyha ya hema da Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 40:34" />Maabaho wingu digubika hema da Mulungu, dihema dimema utunhizo wa Mndewa Mulungu. <verse eid="EXO 40:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 40:35" />Musa kapotwa kwingila muna dihema da Mulungu kwaviya wingu dikala uchanyha yake, na utunhizo wa Mndewa Mulungu umema umo. <verse eid="EXO 40:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 40:36" />Muna imiyanza yose ya Waisilaili, wingu vidinuligwe kulawa uchanyha ya hema, Waisilaili wandusa mwanza. <verse eid="EXO 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 40:37" />Mbali one diwingu hadinuligwe, wawo hawanduse mwanza, wagozela mbaka vondadinuligwe. <verse eid="EXO 40:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 40:38" />Wingu da Mndewa Mulungu dikala uchanyha ya hema da Mulungu lusita lwa imisi, umoto waka muna dihema da Mulungu lusita lwa ichilo, haulongozi wa kaye zose za Waisilaili lusita lose lwa miyanza yawo.<verse eid="EXO 40:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 40" />
</usx>